 ember-24-2025-633418\n Ever wonder what diva is on those billboards all ov
 er the city? Come find out at Bottlerocket\, because Pitsburgh's Poetess i
 s back with her famous one-woman variety show featuring whatever she feels
  like doing that evening. It's a celebration of outsider art\, and you nev
 er know what's next. There's no one like Rachel - spend an evening with he
 r and find out why.   Expect\, in her words "Poetry...Songs...One Liners..
 .Movie Trivia...Elvis & Beatles Skit...Candy Bar Reading...Q & A...Singalo
 ngs." 
