UID:a4d53128-b0f2-11f0-a9b0-0242ac11001c
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/acousticafe-open-stage-13/\nMONDAY 
 OCT 27\, 2025 \nWYEP 91.3 & Straub Brewing Presents: \nAcoustiCafe Open St
 age with host Matthew Siegler ft Midnight Genesis!  \nTHEME: “ILLUSIONS
 ”  \nDelusions\, Deceptions\, Diversions\, Masquerades\, Subterfuges\, S
 hadows. Physical or metaphysical\, inward or outward\, intended or not\, w
 hat artifice do you weave and to what ends? On this special Halloween inst
 allation indulge in our suspension of disbelief.  \nMIDNIGHT GENESIS: Toni
 ght's featured artist was built-to-suit for tonight's theme and is compris
 ed of vocalists Autumn Ayers\, Kylie Koch and Adam Levine.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
