BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Very Merry RICK SEBAK Screening!
DTSTART:20251209T010000Z
DTEND:20251209T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20251026T040054Z
UID:5e8497b6-b220-11f0-b6e3-0242ac11001c
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/a-very-merry-rick-sebak-screening-dec
 ember-08-2025-632102\n RICK SEBAK returns with the coziest event of the ye
 ar\, our annual screenings of "Happy Holidays in Pittsburgh" followed by a
  Q&A with Rick and more fun surprises! The film spans the entire holiday s
 eason and across several religions\, holdays\, and traditions- including t
 rips to tree farms\, churches\, dances\, and jumping into a frozen river. 
 It's a typically lovely film about what makes Pittsburgh\, Pittsburgh!  Ha
 ppy Holidays in Pittsburgh It's a holiday season from Rick Sebak and his j
 olly crew. When winter arrives\, people of Pittsburgh have ways of coping 
 with the gloom. It's a time of parties\, shopping\, celebrating\, going to
  worship services\, renewing friendships and jumping in the frozen river. 
 We look at some of the things that make the end of the year and the start 
 of the new one special times in Western Pennsylvania. It's a joyous\, ligh
 t-filled celebration of hometown happiness. Approx. 75 mins  Why We Booked
  It The man\, the myth\, the legend. We are honored to welcome Rick Sebak 
 to Bottlerocket to join us for a screening of the film\, with a Q&A follow
 ing. Rick has captured Pittsburgh with a razor sharp lens since 1984. Alon
 g the way he has become one of the cities most beloved figures\, and perha
 ps its most celebrated storyteller. And our friend! 
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
