DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/bad-movie-bingo-striking-distance-nov
 ember-25-2025-634300\n It's BAD MOVIE BINGO - a fun way to make terrible m
 ovies slightly more watchable! You get a bingo card full of terrible movie
