DESCRIPTION:https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/event/penelope-road/thunderbir
 d-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nPenelope Road\nThursday\, Ma
 rch 12\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, Pittsburgh\, PADoo
 rs @ 7pmShow @ 8pmAll Ages\n \nEmerging from Atlanta’s vibrant music sc
 ene\, Penelope Road brings a bold\, soulful edge to modern indie rock. Cen
 tered around lush\, layered vocals\, the five-piece blends elements of ‘
 70s rock\, funk\, soul\, and pop into a sound that feels both timeless and
  fresh. Drawing inspiration from legends like Stevie Wonder and Hall & Oat
 es while channeling the forward-thinking creativity of artists like Mk.gee
 \, the band bridges eras with easy confidence. Their tight harmonies and d
 ynamic live energy have earned them a growing reputation for performances 
 that connect and resonate. After releasing their debut EP with Warner Reco
 rds in 2024\, Penelope Road has continued to tour and release new music th
 roughout 2025.Ticket Tier Info:General Admission Tickets – Standing Room
  Only\nThere are no additional entry protocols at this time. Entry requi
