BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:System Freeze ft. Dack Janiels
DTSTART:20260117T020000Z
DTEND:20260117T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20251106T180119Z
UID:98fd0e32-bb3a-11f0-b907-0242ac110022
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/system-freeze/\n*Early Bird tickets
  available until BLACK FRIDAY (ending 11/28 @ 11:59PM)\n**Advance tickets 
 available until the WEEK OF SHOW (ending 1/10 @ 11:59PM)\n***Week of Show 
 tickets. This is also the Day of Show price at doors.\n\nSYSTEM FREEZE is 
 a high-voltage Riddim experience designed to overload your senses and melt
  the mainframe. Expect bone-rattling bass\, filthy drops\, and a lineup en
 gineered to push the limits of sound. As the system locks in and the frequ
 encies surge\, the only rule is to move.\nJoin us as KKS and Mr. Smalls Fu
 nhouse present a night of pure bass energy featuring Dack Janiels with sup
 port from Mushroom Cloud and Krystal Klarity. Get ready to dive deep into 
 the underground — where the rhythm glitches\, the lights pulse\, and the
  crowd moves as one.\n\nSYSTEM FREEZE initiated. Brace for impact.\n\nThis
  Event Is 21+
