BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:J RODDY WALSTON’S CHRISTMAS TO THE BONE TOUR 2025
DTSTART:20251212T010000Z
DTEND:20251212T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20251120T201755Z
UID:00072c20-c64e-11f0-987a-0242ac110022
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/j-roddy-walston/\nJ. Roddy Walston 
 is a force of nature. If his hits like Heavy Bells is are a war cry\, then
  the\ndeep cuts like Boys Can Never Tell are a tactical cosmic retreat. Fo
 r some\, his music is a\nform of religion\, psychedelic in its intensity\,
  transformative in its grip on the body\,\nshaking loose something primal 
 that’s been buried too long. It’s not about thinking\, It’s\nabout m
 oving\, feeling\, surrendering. His influences are a riot of contradiction
 s: Kurt\nCobain’s fury\, Nilsson’s fractured sweetness\, Zeppelin’s 
 power\, and somewhere in there\na perverted nod to William Onyeabor’s lo
 nely calculator funk. Critics try to box him in\,\nbut Walston can’t be 
 contained—he does chaos\, and his live shows do damage\, but\nfortunatel
 y his songs can pay the tab. Catch him and his band before he burns it all
 \ndown again.\n\nThis Event Is All Ages
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
