UID:71e6730e-c654-11f0-9a8e-0242ac110022
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/dollar-monday-december-01-2025-639483
 \n  Do you like local music? Do you like cheap beer? Would you like both o
 f those things together?  Yeah\, we thought so.  DOLLAR MONDAYS - every fi
 rst Monday of the Month we'll give you 2 handpicked local bands\, $1 beer*
