DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/y2k-nye-december-31-2025-634935\n  Wh
 ile we were cleaning out our basement when we first were opening the bar w
 e stumbled upon a bunch of stuff from New Years Eve 2000\, and it got our 
 heads working - so now every New Years we present... the Bottlerocket Y2K 
 party!  From 9 to 11:59 it's going to be a Bottlerocket party straight out
  of 1999 - with 90's music\, a 1999 ball drop\, and more! Then the lights 
 go off and we party like the world is ending with 2000's music and black l
 ights to close out the night!  Plus free champagne at midnight!!  Feat. DJ
  Rojo       
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
