BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FOUND FOOTAGE FESTIVAL: Volume 11
DTSTART:20260123T010000Z
DTEND:20260123T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20251120T210404Z
UID:720c2586-c654-11f0-9a8e-0242ac110022
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/found-footage-festival-volume-11-janu
 ary-22-2026-628568\n  Joe Pickett (The Onion) and Nick Prueher (Late Show 
 With David Letterman) have over 14\,000 VHS tapes in their cluttered offic
 e in Brooklyn and will take viewers on a guided tour of their latest/great
 est finds in this brand new Volume 11 show for 2025. Highlights include a 
 psychotic dollar store salesman\, a video catalog of frightening porcelain
  dolls\, two wonderfully homemade Bigfoot videos and a new age “miracle
 ” treatment from the 80s called “Psychic Surgery.” (90 mins - contai
 ns nudity\, language\, clowns)  Why'd We Book It? The FOUND FOOTAGE FESTIV
 AL guys have become a yearly occurance for us here at Bottlerocket - and i
 t's not hard to see why. As a proud box set owner of the first 10 Volumes\
 , the FFF crew continues to amaze and baffle with the weirdest stuff in th
 e bargain bins they can find\, compiled with love & presented with pride. 
 We love Nick and Joe\, and are pysched to have them back at Bottlerocket f
 or volume ELEVEN - with tons of new videos!  “I think I speak for fans e
 verywhere when I express gratitude for their continued hunt for hilariousl
 y bad videos. I hope the search never ends.” -Steven Hyden\, Uproxx   
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
