DESCRIPTION:6djmj5o5drsq0p9a7d5kbjkbaq@google.com\nAre you looking to meet 
 other queer folks who understand that *super specific* experience of being
  exvangelical?? Join us at your favorite they-bar for our first ever Queer
  Exvangelical Mixer! Come meet new friends and enjoy a low-pressure queer 
 environment– all are welcome. This event is brought to you by the Common
 wealth of Oakland (oaklandcommonwealth.com). We’re a local\, queer-led p
 rogressive faith community focused on deconstructing and reconstructing to
 gether what faith means to us. See you there!
LOCATION:Harold's Haunt\, 142 Grant Ave\, Millvale\, PA 15209\, USA
END:VEVENT
