BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SHARP PINS
DTSTART:20260129T010000Z
DTEND:20260129T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20251123T050059Z
UID:66b9e99e-c829-11f0-b62f-0242ac110022
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/sharp-pins-january-28-2026-638326\n  
 SHARP PINS with support from EX PILOTS THE GARMENT DISTRICT  $15 ADV / $18
  DOS 7PM DOORS / 8PM MUSIC ALL AGES  for fans of... Guided by Voices\, Tee
 nage Fanclub\, Tony Molina  BIO: We are 1/4 way through this century - - -
  now is the time to strum some atomic pop perfection. The new Sharp Pins a
 lbum Radio DDR is just what the world requires in this new year 2025 - - -
  every song is a sing-a-long\, a head bang-a-long\, lost guitars found!  R
 adio DDR was recorded spring\, 2024 by Kai Slater and Sharp Pins band mate
 s in his house on the roof in the basement with all the doors open. It was
  initially released as a cassette-only delight and immediately caught fire
 . Everyone wants to beat this tambourine. Radio DDR has taken on a life of
  its own.  Some say Sharp Pins are Geniuz\; others proclaim a Minor New Ta
 lent on high. It don’t matter none. If you are busy staying up late watc
 hing vampire movies and devouring bowls of chocolatey fruit loops you only
  know you want to play Radio DDR again. And hear it again. And play it out
  the window for the birds in the trees.   
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ALINGON MITRA (Friday)
DTSTART:20260131T010000Z
DTEND:20260131T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20251123T050059Z
UID:66bf62e8-c829-11f0-b62f-0242ac110022
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/alingon-mitra-friday-january-30-2026-
 632115\n  ALINGON MITRA is a stand-up comedian and comedy writer living in
  New York. He has written for THE DAILY SHOW WITH TREVOR NOAH on Comedy Ce
 ntral and was also staffed on ADAM RUINS EVERYTHING for TruTV. He has done
  stand-up on THE LATE SHOW WITH STEPHEN COLBERT\, CONAN\, LATE NIGHT WITH 
 CRAIG FERGUSON\, and ADAM DEVINE'S HOUSE PARTY.   Why'd We Book It? As a w
 riter for The Daily Show and Adam Ruins Everything\, you might notice that
  some of your favorite jokes were written by Alingon. Although he is norma
 lly behind the scenes\, he will be coming to talk about hot topics with gr
 ace that can only be acheived by a guy who has better hair than me. We hop
 e you enjoy his humor as much as we do.  For Fans Of... Hasan Minhaj\, Pet
 e Holmes\, Josh Johnson  Extended Bio: After becoming a semi-finalist on L
 AST COMIC STANDING\, Alington won the coveted "Comic Comback" award to app
 ear in the season finale. He was selected to be a new face at Just for Lau
