 st running indie comedy show in the country in their home town of Denver\,
  and have a popular podcast called\, "Advice Fight.”   Why'd We Book It?
  Adam has a decorated history in the comedy scene from JFL to competing on
  @midnight. He has a way of making you really feel his comedy from joking 
