 rday Night Live for its milestone 50th season. Emil made his late-night te
 levision debut on The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon and can be seen on th
 e latest season of Comedy Central’s Stand-Up Featuring. Also\, he was se
 lected as a New Face of Comedy at the prestigious Just For Laughs Comedy F
 estival in Montreal.   Why'd We Book It? Emil has a fresh political voice 
 and a knack for sharp joke writing\, he's found a place in the comedy scen
 e hense his stint on SNL last season - and on our stage too! We are so exc
 ited to have him back with us and we are sure you are too!   For Fans Of..
 . John Mulaney\, Hasan Minhaj\, Gianmarco Soresi   Extended Bio: Emil has 
