 -music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nVARIALSwith UnityTX\, HEAVY//HITTE
 R\, BOLTCUTTERTuesday April 7\, 2025Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Stre
 et\, Pittsburgh\, PADoors @ 7pmShow @ 8pmAGE RESTRICTION: 18+\nVarials cha
 nnel hardcore intensity and nu-metal groove into something unapologeticall
 y human. Formed in Philadelphia\, the band built its reputation on unflinc
 hing honesty across Pain Again\, In Darkness\, and Scars for You to Rememb
 er.\n \nTheir fourth album\, WHERE THE LIGHT LEAVES (Fearless Records\, 2
 025)\, marks a rebirth—four musicians tearing everything down to rebuild
  stronger. Produced by Josh Schroeder (Lorna Shore\, Dayseeker)\, the rec
 ord captures Varials at their most instinctive and unfiltered. Imperfect t
 akes\, emotional performances\, and new melodic textures create a sound th
 at’s both crushing and alive.\n \nOnstage\, the lineup (Skyler Conder\,
  Mike Foley\, Sean Rauchut\, and Shane Lyons) continues to prove why Varia
 ls remain one of heavy music’s most cathartic and commanding live acts.\
 n\n \nTicket Tier Info:General Admission Tickets – Standing Room Only\n
