BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CHRIS GETHARD'S BEAUTIFUL/ANONYMOUS
DTSTART:20260202T010000Z
DTEND:20260202T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20251210T030124Z
UID:8347d30c-d574-11f0-9691-0242ac11001e
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/chris-gethard-s-beautiful-anonymous-f
 ebruary-01-2026-642138\n  Bottlerocket legend CHRIS GETHARD returns for a 
 very special live taping of his wonderful podcast\, BEAUTIFUL/ANONYMOUS  R
 ecently celebrating 500 Episodes and a place on Time Magazine's 100 Best P
 odcasts of All Time list - B/A is a vulnerable\, tender show spotlighting 
 average every day people\, and some unexpected comedy ensues. Basically\, 
 it's a typical Chris Gethard project.  One Hour. One phone call. No names.
  No holds barred. We open the line to one anonymous caller\, and we can’
 t hang up\, no matter what.   
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
