BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jenn Taiga // Calluna // Izolat
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260102T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260102T210000
DTSTAMP:20251210T050053Z
UID:343406d0-d585-11f0-8a65-0242ac11001e
DESCRIPTION:https://www.poetrymillvale.com/event/jenn-taiga/\nIZOLAT [ē-z
 ō-laht\, Romanian for Isolated] is the Dungeon Synth project of Derek Rus
 h [DREAM INTO DUST\, UNFEELING]. Solemn melodies and dissonant chords dren
 ched in the echoes of solitary spaces\, with intermittent ambient and perc
 ussive sounds from forests and cemeteries. A split with ETVRNE was release
 d on No Sides Records in 2024\, with a full-length forthcoming. \n  \nhtt
 ps://www.instagram.com/izolatds/ \nPhoto credit: Michael Weeks (@endmusik_
 studios on Instagram) \nCALLUNA (Heather Harper) is a singer\, violinist\,
  DJ\, and sound artist. Vocal melodies arc across the sky\, looping and sw
 irling through her vocal processing instrument\, The Augmented Voice. An o
 cean of ambient textures\, surging drones\, distorted beats\, and crushing
  noise churns below.  \nHeather has played at Pittsburgh’s most vibrant
  underground and experimental music events\, including Misophonia\, The Pi
 tt\, Sweet Escape\, PS\, Sweet Abyss\, Dropout\, and the Fire Lights festi
 val\, at venues including Collision\, Club Pittsburgh\, the Government Cen
 ter\, the 40th St Bridge\, and HAVEN. She is a violinist in the grindcore 
 project SHAME HOLE\, a DJ and visual artist in the duo Reverse Cowgirl\, a
 nd a frequent collaborator with genre-fluid pop artist Bella Figlia. \nhtt
 ps://www.instagram.com/ca11.11una/ \nheatherharper.bandcamp.com \nJenn Tai
 ga draws from a cornucopia of influences to craft a resplendent and dark s
 tyle of music tangentially related to dungeon synth and Berlin school musi
 c. A prolific studio artist and even more active touring act\, having perf
 ormed at several Dungeon Siege festivals across the nation and completed a
  self-booked nationwide tour in July 2025\, Jenn Taiga draws from real-lif
 e experiences– putting on full display her deep struggles as a trans wom
 an in America\, as well as her deep affinity for SM –to craft a unique l
 ive presence with a performance which is as extramusical as it is exciting
 . Performed entirely live and exclusively with analog synthesizers\, Jenn 
 Taiga’s entrancing performances are marked with a professional level of 
 skill a striking intensity.  \n  \nhttps://www.instagram.com/jenntaiga \
 nhttps://jenntaiga.bandcamp.com/ \n  \nhttps://www.instagram.com/apupname
 drosy/ \nhttps://apupnamedrosy.bandcamp.com/ \n 
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
