BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AARON CHEN
DTSTART:20260308T000000Z
DTEND:20260308T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20251211T160102Z
UID:97902314-d6aa-11f0-a6b6-0242ac11001e
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/aaron-chen-march-07-2026-643445\n  Bo
 rn and raised in Sydney\, Australia\, Aaron has quickly climbed the ranks 
 of the international comedy scene. He was just named one of Deadline’s 1
 5 Comedians Ready to Break Out In 2025 [deadline.com] and Vulture’s 2024
  Comedian’s You Should Know [vulture.com]. Aaron made his mark on Austra
 lian comedy with his debut solo show at the Melbourne Comedy Festival in 2
 017 and since then has toured internationally in front of sold-out crowds.
  On the acting front\, Aaron has had feature roles in Ronny Chieng: Intern
 ational Student (ABC)\, Orange is the New Brown (Seven Network)\, and the 
 international hit comedy series FISK (Netflix). As a comedian he also appe
 ars on Australia’s #1 panel show\, Have You Been Paying Attention (Netwo
 rk 10) and Guy Montgomery’s Spelling Bee (Three).   Why'd We Book It? Aa
 ron has a fresh perspective on being raised in an immigrant family from Au
 tralia. His jokes\, with dry delivery\, about the cultural absurdities he 
 sees in his day to day life\, are extremetly witty and different than I've
  seen before. Hopefully\, he can soon determine if he is a robot or not.  
   For Fans Of... Sam Campbell\, Demetri Martin\, Tig Notaro   Extended Bio
 : Aaron’s acclaimed 2021 Adult Swim special A Life in Questions was nomi
 nated for Best Short Form Comedy Special at the Australian Academy of Cine
 ma and Television Arts Awards\, and lead to a development deal with Adult 
 Swim/Warner Media. His stand-up special\, If Weren’t Filmed\, Nobody Wou
 ld Believe was released on YouTube in September 2022 and has accumulated o
 ver 1 million views. Aaron can be seen opposite Ben Stiller and Jake Johns
 on in the upcoming Red Hour Feature THE DINK [deadline.com] and just made 
 his US late-night debut on LATE NIGHT WITH SETH MEYERS. He is based in New
  York City.    Seating/Show Information: Limit 4 tickets per transaction. 
 You can not purchase tickets to multiple shows.   This show will have thea
 ter seating. Seats will be assigned upon arrival\, or can be chosen ahead 
 of time for an additional fee.   QR Code Ordering will be available for th
 is performance.  Doors open at 5pm.  Don't miss our famous Bottlerocket Pr
 e-Show Clip Collection\, beginning one hour before the start of the perfor
 mance.  This show is ALL AGES  *all information subject to change as neede
 d.    Bottlerocket FAQ:   All shows starting before 10pm are all ages unle
 ss otherwise noted.  Free parking is available at 824 Industry Street and 
 205 Allen Street\, as well as other public lots in the area.  Live Music s
 hows have limited seating options\, please arrive early or reach out to th
 e venue directly if you know that you require a seat.  Doors open at 5pm f
 or all shows unless noted otherwise. The time listed on the ticket is the 
 event's true start time.  Most shows have a preshow experience starting 1 
 hour before the show.  All tickets are non-refundable - our full refund po
 licy can be viewed here  Please contact us ahead of time with any accesibi
 lty requests or concerns\, we're happy to accomodate you.  More FAQ's can 
 be found here   
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:HOLMES
