BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Documentary Screening: Come See Me in the Good Light
DTSTART:20260114T000000Z
DTEND:20260114T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20251218T110053Z
UID:d24f1ee6-dc00-11f0-ba1b-0242ac110024
DESCRIPTION:1lb6earc8m6o3ths42tcorfrkk@google.com\nLesbiFriends hosts: Come
  See Me in the Good Light. A documentary that explores how poets and partn
 ers Andrea Gibson and Megan Falley navigate Andrea's terminal ovarian canc
 er diagnosis. The film explores themes of love\, mortality\, and resilienc
 e\, using Gibson's spoken-word poetry throughout. Rather than focusing sol
 ely on the sadness of impending death\, the documentary highlights the cou
 ple's determination to live life to the fullest\, finding joy\, humor\, an
 d purpose in everyday moments.\n\nDoor at 7\, Movie at 7:30\, this is a fr
 ee event
LOCATION:Harold's Haunt\, 142 Grant Ave\, Millvale\, PA 15209\, USA
END:VEVENT
