BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WAR ON WOMEN (at Little Giant)
DTSTART:20260319T000000Z
DTEND:20260319T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20251218T180053Z
UID:7ece297a-dc3b-11f0-90c5-0242ac110024
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/war-on-women-at-little-giant-march-18
 -2026-642338\n  THIS SHOW IS AT LITTLE GIANT LOCATED BEHIND BOTTLEROCKET A
 T 100 ASTEROID WAY  WAR ON WOMEN with support from OCEANATOR  $18 ADV / $2
 0 DOS 7PM DOORS / 8PM MUSIC ALL AGES  for fans of... Queens Of The Stone A
 ge\, Rise Against\, Halestorm\, Turnstile\, Bikini Kill  BIO: War On Women
  is a feminist punk/rock band\, known for their wild stage shows and anthe
 mic songs. Blending riot grrrl energy with progressive guitar riffs and ou
 tspoken lyrics\, War On Women have been touring and releasing albums for t
 he last decade. After their widely-acclaimed album Wonderful Hell (Bridge 
 Nine Records)\, the band is set to release their 4th full length studio al
 bum and are back on tour giving their live audiences an exclusive preview 
 of some brand new songs from the upcoming release. War On Women are a fan 
 favorite\, featured on the stages of festivals such as Warped Tour\, Riot 
 Fest\, Download Fest\, and touring with legendary acts like Bad Religion\,
  Jawbreaker\, Frank Turner\, Propagandhi\, Alkaline Trio\, and Helmet. The
  band collectively brings an impressive level of proficiency and entertain
 ment to the stage while sporting a roster of main characters. War On Women
  are a band inciting a good time while having nothing to prove\, and there
 ’s nothing more delightfully dangerous than that.    
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
