BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AcoustiCafe Open Stage
DTSTART:20251223T000000Z
DTEND:20251223T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20251218T180053Z
UID:7ed31138-dc3b-11f0-90c5-0242ac110024
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/acousticafe-open-stage-21/\nMONDAY 
 DECEMBER 22\, 2025 - WYEP 91.3 & Straub Brewing Presents: AcoustiCafe Open
  Stage with host Dan Syslinger featuring Standard Broadcast\, and Britt an
 d Frankie\, plus (hopefully!) special guests The Conspiracy Theory - don't
  miss this Friday's Feed the Burgh featuring a bunch of Mr Smalls & Ac fri
 ends on Fri Dec 19 in Mr Smalls Theater!\n\nTheme. HOME\nWe are bringing i
 t HOME for our final AC of 2025.  Including special events\, we did 50 sho
 ws this year - even 4 mondays in a row with only hosts named Dan!  We are 
 so grateful for all the musicians\, comics\, poets\, audience\, behind-the
 -scenes technicians and staff that keep the wheels on this jalopy!!  Bring
  songs and stories that ( remind you of || make you feel at || smell like 
 ) HOME!\n\nDAN STYSLINGER is an award-winning songwriter\, multi-instrumen
 talist\, and filmmaker from Pittsburgh\, PA. Drawing from a wide musical p
 alette\, Dan creates music rooted in storytelling and atmosphere\, often a
 dding wit and levity to his work. \n\nSTANDARD BROADCAST is a Pittsburgh\,
  PA based Indie Rock four-piece founded in 2014. Their current lineup is N
 athan Jay (piano and vocals)\, Dave Parrish (bass)\, Dean Henry (drums) an
 d Mike Szemanski (guitar).\n\nBRITT AND FRANKIE are a multi-genre cover du
 o that have been collaborators for over 15 years. With Britt's vocal prowe
 ss and Frank's exceptional guitar and piano skill\, expect to be grooving 
 in your seat to some of the soul\, funk\, and pop classics.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
