 ggles. After winning his high school’s talent show and receiving the ove
 rwhelming amounts of applause\, badluv discovered his passion for songwrit
 ing\, performing\, and sharing his story with others. Having gone through 
 several personal hardships\, badluv’s goal is to continue sharing his st
 ory through songs that provide those going through similar struggles with 
 peace\, security and strength.\n\nThis Event Is All Ages\nAll Sales Are Fi
 nal.
