UID:c2f3644c-e241-11f0-a897-0242ac110024
DESCRIPTION:https://www.stagepittsburgh.com/events/good-kid-band-13-april-2
 026/\nFresh from Ontario\, indie rock band GOOD KID is back for the highly
 -anticipated release of their debut album “Can We Hang Out Sometime?” 
 With the record finally taking shape\, this era followed several EPs that 
 amassed a loyal following\, and gained dominance as their music was featur
 ed in Fortnite. This time\, the band is kicking off a huge CAN WE HANGOUT?
  Tour with special guest Inoha joining most North American dates. With 40 
 dates on the list\, get ready for amazing adventures with these fellas who
  rock. \nComing to Pittsburgh\, the band is all set to light up STAGE AE o
 n Monday\, April 13th. With infectious beats\, rock-out hits\, and new mus
 ic that marks Good Kid as one of the hottest names in a new era of standou
 t rockers\, you’re in for a wild ride. It's bound to be a blast\, indeed
 . Be part of the celebration by booking your tickets now!
LOCATION:Stage AE
END:VEVENT
