UID:a7edea52-e9bf-11f0-b842-0242ac110024
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/the-music-of-neil-young-february-07-2
 026-651842\n  Andre Costello returns to Bottlerocket with a few friends in
  tow for what's become an annual tradition - an evening celebrating the fu
 ll songbook of Neil Young\; from the acoustic harmonies that created a fol
 k icon to the loud and brash tunes that made him the Grandfather of Grunge
  - and everything in between.  Andre's show is (still!) the highest attend
 ed show in Bottlerocket history\, and was so fantastic I asked him to perf
 orm at my wedding - so believe me when I tell you that Neil is an all-time
  favorite of ours here at Bottlerocket\, and no one in the city can captur
 e his unique sound quite like Andre.  Limited Reserved Seating tickets is 
 available for a small upcharge. General Admission may have limited bar/tab
 le seating on a first come\, first serve basis.   
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
