DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/play-by-play-february-05-2026-653309\
 n  The art of long-form improv explained (or perhaps\, ruined) by live com
 mentary.  Imagine if long-form improv were a sport. Now imagine that this 
 sport had two live commentators. And now imagine that these two commentato
 rs were as much of an improv nerd as the people doing it — naming every 
 deep-cut improv move\, strategy\, historical precedent as the show continu
 ed! Would this make the improv more playful and accessible? Or does it mak
 e an already-niche activity completely inaccessible? You be the judge!  Fe
 aturing a rotating cast of your favorite improvisers! Hosted by Will Hines
    Seating/Show Information: Limit 4 tickets per transaction. You can not 
 purchase tickets to multiple shows.   This show will have theater seating.
