UID:8188a6aa-efc7-11f0-9e20-0242ac11001a
DESCRIPTION:https://librarymusichall.com/event/airplane-screening-live-with
 -director-david-zucker-and-star-robert-hays\nMills Entertainment & Drusky 
 Entertainment presents:\nAirplane! Live with Julie Hagerty and Robert Hays
 !\nThursday\, May 28th\, 2026\nDoors: 7:00PM / Show: 8:00PM\nCarnegie of H
 omestead Music Hall (Munhall\, PA)\n*All tickets subject to day of show pr
 ice increase. Prices at the ticket link reflect the all-in ticket price (f
 ace value + fees) - minus any taxes / credit card processing fees.\nThis e
 vent is recommended for all ages.\nYou ever seen a... screening of the gre
 atest comedy to ever hit the skies?\nWell surely you’ve seen Airplane! 
 — but not like this!\nWe have clearance\, Clarence\, to show the beloved
  comedy classic\, Airplane! on the BIG screen joined live\nby two stars of
  the film!\nAssuming they don’t have the fish for dinner... Robert Hays 
 (reluctant pilot “Ted Striker”) and Julie Hagerty\n(flight attendant 
 “Elaine Dickinson”) will take the stage for a live discussion and Q&A 
 after the film to share\nbehind-the-scenes stories\, insights\, and person
 al memories from working on this genre-defining comedy\nmasterpiece.\nSo p
 ut down that glue\, because SURELY this is the wrong week to miss Robert H
 ays & Julie Hagerty with a\nscreening of Airplane! (And don't call them Sh
 irley!)\nAct quick: A limited number of passengers can upgrade to a “Fir
 st Class” VIP meet & greet experience!\nVIPs will meet Julie Hagerty and
  Robert Hays\, pose with them for a professionally shot photograph\, and\n
 receive an autographed tour poster!\nThis post-show VIP opportunity is ava
 ilable to add on to any ticket purchase while supplies last. The VIP\nadd-
 on is not valid without an accompanying show ticket and each attendee must
  have both for entry to the\nVIP.
LOCATION:Carnegie of Homestead
END:VEVENT
