DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/acousticafe-songwriter-series-11/\n
 Vanessa Prentiss is a songwriter\, guitarist and bassist who leads her own
  band and plays in bands Posterchild and Shiva Shiva. Usually calling on s
 urrealist and imagery based lyrics\, she writes with an eye on the world a
 round her.Skylar Edson is a rising country‑pop artist from Pittsburgh\, 
 born with music in her blood and raised on classic rock\, country music an
 d the Pittsburgh Steelers. At just 15\, she's already a talented multi‑i
 nstrumentalist and pop vocalist — but songwriting is where she truly com
 es alive\, crafting stories with the emotional punch of old school country
  but with a sharper\, more rebellious edge that's entirely her own. Now st
 udying songwriting at the renowned Interlochen Arts Academy\, Skylar is ho
 ning her craft and shaping a voice that feels both fresh and fearless. She
 's young\, driven\, and already finding her place in the next wave of coun
 try‑pop artists.This Event Is All Ages
LOCATION:Mr. Smalls Cafe
