DESCRIPTION:https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/event/brahctopus-the-brrrrrrct
 opus-tour/thunderbird-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nBRAHCTOP
 USwith Seven Teller and Wild Blue YonderSaturday\, March 7\, 2026Thunderbi
 rd Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, Pittsburgh\, PADoors @ 7PMShow @ 8PMAGE 
 RESTRICTION: 21+https://www.brahctopus.com/Brahctopus is a space-rock coll
 ective playing originals and covers from many genres including jam-rock\, 
 psychedelic\, disco\, reggae\, and funk. The band is balanced with an incr
 edible flow of musicianship\; giving space to one another to create musica
 l soundscapes capable of making anyone feel squiggly.https://seventeller.c
 om/Seven Teller is the art-rock brainchild of Baltimore musician and songw
 riter Sam Cochran\, who started the project in 2020. A blend of post-punk\
 , dance\, and psych-rock music nourishes the band’s unique\, immersive s
 ound. After several big releases and national tours\, Sam has sought to re
 -imagine the band’s sound with steady releases throughout 2025 and a ful
 l-length expected in 2026. Seven Teller is expanding the norms by creating
  music that’s reminiscent of acts like LCD Soundsystem\, Talking Heads\,
  and CAN\, while still performing live shows that showcase deep improvisat
 ion\, referencing their roots in the jam scene and early influences like P
 hish and Lotus. Seven Teller has featured sit-ins from Cotter Ellis (Goose
 )\, Jake Brownstein (Eggy)\, and Eli Winderman (Dopapod). \n \nhttps://w
 ww.wildblueyondermusic.com/Coming from Pittsburgh\, PA\, Wild Blue Yonder 
 draws inspiration from funk\, jazz\, R&B/soul\, and folk music\, creating 
 music that flows like rivers and blossoms like wildflowers. Their style mi
 xes deliberate songwriting and spontaneous improvisation\, making each son
 g into an organic voyage of growth and exploration.Ticket Tier Info:Genera
 l Admission Tickets – Standing Room Only\nThere are no additional entry
  protocols at this time. Entry requirements are subject to change. By pur
 chasing tickets to this event you agree to abide by entry requirements in 
