BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vinyl Williams X HOTT MT – Star Harmony Tour 2026
DTSTART:20260606T000000Z
DTEND:20260606T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260202T210130Z
UID:58e6f95e-007a-11f1-b1bc-0242ac11000a
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/star-harmony-tour/\nAlmost two deca
 des into his career\, Lionel (Vinyl) Williams is an enduring fixture of th
 e psychedelic scene. He unveiled his Vinyl Williams alias in 2007\, immedi
 ately establishing the blueprint for a sound that shimmers like biolumines
 cent glitter. With releases on labels including Chaz Bear’s Company Reco
 rds\, Requiem Pour Un Twister\, and Harmony Records\, Williams translates 
 vast\, galactic concepts into cosmic sonic textures. It seems fitting that
  Williams is the inventor of a system for understanding relationships call
 ed Musical Astrology — an app that allows you to hear the music of your 
 birthdays\, as well as the precise musical pitches of the planets in relat
 ion to Earth\, on any given day.HOTT MT (Hour Of The Time Majesty Twelve) 
  is an experimental pop group based in Los Angeles. Duo Nick (Spooky) Logi
 e and Ash (Ashi) Allard make an introspective psychedelic fantasy awash in
  fuzz guitar\, new age synth and ethereal vocals.Since their formation in 
 2012 the group has collaborated withThe Flaming Lips\, Ke$ha\, and many ar
 tists in their local DIY community. The band’s 5th full length album is 
 set to be released in May 2026. Titled “Haunted House”\, the record wa
 s recorded and engineered by Spooky and Ashi and was mixed by Shags Chambe
 rlain (Pearl and the Oysters\, Weyes Blood).This Event Is All AgesAll Sale
 s Are Final.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
