DESCRIPTION:https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/event/the-vindys-3/thunderbird
 -cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nTHE VINDYSMcConnell\, Vitullo
  & ChoeFriday\, March 27\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, 
 Pittsburgh\, PADoors @ 7:00PMShow @ 8:00PMAGE RESTRICTION: 21+https://www.
 thevindys.com\nAs Ohio Rockers The Vindys prepare to release new music thi
 s coming year\, they continue to evolve while staying true to their pop\, 
 rock\, and soul roots. With fresh sounds on the horizon and a national tou
 r ahead planned for 2026\, their next chapter promises to be their most th
 rilling yet.\nPat Benatar praises lead singer Jackie Popovec\, saying\, 
 “She’s amazing. That girl can sing her ass off.” (2023)  Meanwhile\
 , The Washington Post’s Marc Thiessen included them in his list of The 1
 0 Best Concerts I Saw in 2024.  They were also named Cleveland Magazine
 ’s 2023 Editor’s Pick for “Best Indie Rock Band.”\n\nTicket Tier I
