BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Akeylah Simone & Company
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260321T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260321T210000
DTSTAMP:20260214T040236Z
UID:ff51bba2-0959-11f1-a2b8-e693d1edaa33
DESCRIPTION:https://www.poetrymillvale.com/event/akeylah-simone-company/\nA
 keylah Simone delivers a stunning performance by fusing genres from Rock\,
  R&B\, Pop & Jazz in an eclectic set of original music.  Her sultry\, sou
 lful vocals are effective in keeping her audience engaged. Akeylah Simone
 ’s team puts together a band of professional musicians specific to the n
 eeds of each booking and market. Each performance is choreographed specifi
 c to the venue and audience. Akeylah’s ability to produce such a dynamic
  show has landed her a variety of bookings nationwide since she started pe
 rforming as a solo artist just two short years ago. Although\, she has bee
 n singing and performing since her first time on stage at an elementary sc
 hool talent contest\, and frequenting many stages with her dad\, Bobby Bla
 ckhat\, over the past 10 years. This past year has been spent focusing on 
 performing her own original music all over including festivals\, award sho
 ws\, showcases and private events. \n  \nAkeylah Simone\, from Hampton Ro
 ads\, VA is just getting her feet wet as a singer\, songwriter\, and now r
 ecording artist. In just her first year of releasing original music\, she
 ’s landed 4 songs on the 2021/22 Grammy Ballot and voted Encore’s 2021
  Best Solo Artist. She was most recently voted ISSA’s 2022 Female Rising
  Star and Veer Magazine 2022 Best R&B/ Soul Artist. She’s also had numer
 ous nominations across various publications including Best New Artist (Sou
 l Tracks Reader’s Choice Awards\,) and Song of the Year & EP of the Year
  (Veer Awards.)
LOCATION:Poetry Lounge
END:VEVENT
