 fterparty. Expect to move to LCD Soundsystem\, The Rapture\, Foals\, Yeah 
 Yeah Yeahs\, TV on the Radio\, and that remix you forgot you loved.\nTicke
 t Tier Info:General Admission Tickets – Standing Room Only\nThere are no
