DTEND:20260602T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260216T210816Z
UID:9c90131e-0b7b-11f1-be3b-aa4e6ea5cfaa
DESCRIPTION:https://www.stagepittsburgh.com/events/taking-back-sunday-01-ju
 ne-2026/\nPittsburgh\, summer is rolling in fast\, and this one promises t
 o be the hottest one yet! Not because of extreme temperatures\, but becaus
 e pure grungey\, emo greatness is blowing in with the summer breeze - and 
 they’re going to crank up the heat! \nThese guys have all your favorite 
 things: off-the-charts intensity\, raw emotion\, supercharged choruses\, l
 yrics that hit differently\, heaps of mic-swinging\, slick charisma\, and 
 some of the best music of the last two-and-something decades! And it’s a
 ll coming to your neck of the woods! \nThat’s right\, Pittsburgh\, emo j
 uggernauts Taking Back Sunday is coming to Stage AE on 1 June 2026 with th
 eir ‘Summer Tour 2026’ and is bringing longtime friends Bayside along 
 for the ride!\nTickets are priced to go from only $67 - a total steal for 
 an off-the-charts evening like this\, so hit that ‘Get Tickets’ button
  now to secure your spot to catch emo royalty live in action!
LOCATION:Stage AE
