UID:9e5815a0-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:cq3nuoaltr8248bkiu1epb9pqs@google.com\n2015 Kunkle Park Star Pa
 rty Dates Set\n\n2015 Kunkle Park Star Party Dates Set by Township Supervi
 sors\nAAAP members should email vicepresident@3ap.org to volunteer for the
 se public Kunkle Park Star Parties events.\n\nSaturday\, May 23:  Crescent
  Moon\, Venus\, Jupiter\, Saturn\, Star Clusters\nSaturday\, June 27\, Gib
 bous Moon\, Venus\, Jupiter\, Saturn\, MAYBE some deep sky objects but the
  moon will be pretty bright\n\nSaturday\, August 8\, Dark Sky – Saturn\,
  Clusters\, Nebulas and Galaxies\n\nSaturday\, October 3\, Dark Sky – Cl
 usters\, Nebulas and Galaxies\n\nhttp://www.meetup.com/www-3ap-org/pages/M
 ap_of_Kunkle_Park_Star_Party_Site/\n\nKD2/4/2015\n\n\nUpdate 5/5/2015 KD\n
 Our 1st Kunkle Star Party will be held Saturday night\, May 23.  This is a
  Wagman and Mingo star party night as well\, but we could use your help if
  you’re interested in coming.  \n\nKunkle Park is located behind the Was
 hington Township Municipal Building\, in northern Westmoreland County.  Fo
 r GPS users\, that’s 285 Pine Run Church Road\, Apollo\, PA 15613.  (Nea
 r the State Police barracks on Route 66.)  GPS users can also insert the f
 ollowing coordinates: 40 degrees\, 32.92 minutes north latitude\, 79 degre
 es\, 36.26 minutes west longitude.\n\nPlease let me know if you’re able 
 to attend.\n\nThanks a million.\n\nTerry\n\nPS.  It looks as if I will be 
 interviewed about the star party on the Saturday Light Brigade that mornin
 g.  http:/ /slbradio.org/listen  I’ll try to plug Mingo and Wagman as we
 ll.\n\n\n
LOCATION:Elbert N. Kunkle Park\, 285 Pine Run Church Road.\, Apollo\, PA 15
 613\, United States
END:VEVENT
