  This is not just an amateur radio event but more of a space education eve
 nt.  However this year the same amateurs who are active in Echoes of Apoll
 o are also bringing Yuri's Night into the their program with the idea to i
 ntroduce EME and amateur radio to young people.  More on this at http://yu
 risnight.net/about/.\n\n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
