  Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul Road (Gravel and A
 sphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Road) Continue 0.7 miles on
  Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillman State Park Model Airfi
 eld Follow gravel road to airfield at top of hill. \n\n**Please note that 
 once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for Radio Control Model
  Airport to find Hillman State Park Model Airfield. \n\n\nFrom the South (
 Burgettstown and Washington)\n\nTake PA-18 north\nTurn Right at Light in F
 lorence onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles on Steubenville Pike Tur
