 oad and turn left into entrance of Hillman State Park Model Airfield Follo
 w gravel road to airfield at top of hill. \n\n**Please note that once you 
 enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for Radio Control Model Airport 
 to find Hillman State Park Model Airfield. \n\n\nFrom East (Pittsburgh)\n\
 nTake US-22 West\nTake the PA-18 exit for Florence/Burgettstown Turn Left 
 at Light onto PA-18 North Turn Right at Light onto Steubenville Pike Conti
 nue 1.5 miles on Steubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 mil
 es on Haul Road (Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Grave
 l Road) Continue 0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of H
 illman State Park Model Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top of 
 hill. \n\n**Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow si
 gnage for Radio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park Model Air
 field. \n\n\nFrom West (Weirton and Steubenville)\n\nTake US-22 East\nTake
  the PA-18 exit for Florence/Burgettstown Turn Left onto PA-18 North Turn 
 Right at Light onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles on Steubenville P
 ike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul Road (Gravel and Asp
 halt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Road) Continue 0.7 miles on K
 ramer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillman State Park Model Airfiel
 d Follow gravel road to airfield at top of hill. \n\n**Please note that on
 ce you enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for Radio Control Model A
