DESCRIPTION:68i486p47qprld5e1pnoofrjj4@google.com\n\n6:45pm - Presentation 
 &quot\;Star Life&quot\;\n7:15pm - Sky Viewing\nNotes: There will be no moo
 n that night\, but 4 planets will be visible as well as many deep sky obje
 cts. The event takes place at the model airplane field. This is on top of 
 a hill with \nclear viewing in all directions.\n\nInformation for 3AP Volu
 nteers: Those with scopes can drive onto the runway to setup. \n\nDirectio
 ns to Hillman SP&#39\;s Radio Control Airport/Airfield:\n\n\nFrom the Nort
 h (Beaver)\n\nTake PA-18 south\nTurn Left at Light in Florence onto Steube
 nville Pike Continue 1.5 miles on Steubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road
  Continue 1.7 miles on Haul Road (Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on K
 ramer Road (Gravel Road) Continue 0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left i
 nto entrance of Hillman State Park&#39\;s Model Airfield Follow gravel roa
 d to airfield at top of hill. \n\n**Please note that once you enter Hillma
 n State Park\, follow signage for Radio Control Model Airport to find Hill
 man State Park&#39\;s Model Airfield. \n\n\nFrom the South (Burgettstown a
 nd Washington)\n\nTake PA-18 north\nTurn Right at Light in Florence onto S
 teubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles on Steubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul
  Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul Road (Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right
  on Kramer Road (Gravel Road) Continue 0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn l
 eft into entrance of Hillman State Park&#39\;s Model Airfield Follow grave
 l road to airfield at top of hill. \n\n**Please note that once you enter H
 illman State Park\, follow signage for Radio Control Model Airport to find
  Hillman State Park&#39\;s Model Airfield. \n\n\nFrom East (Pittsburgh)\n\
 nTake US-22 West\nTake the PA-18 exit for Florence/Burgettstown Turn Left 
 at Light onto PA-18 North Turn Right at Light onto Steubenville Pike Conti
 nue 1.5 miles on Steubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 mil
 es on Haul Road (Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Grave
 l Road) Continue 0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of H
 illman State Park&#39\;s Model Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at 
 top of hill. \n\n**Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, fo
 llow signage for Radio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park&#3
 9\;s Model Airfield. \n\n\nFrom West (Weirton and Steubenville)\n\nTake US
 -22 East\nTake the PA-18 exit for Florence/Burgettstown Turn Left onto PA-
 18 North Turn Right at Light onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles on 
 Steubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul Road (
 Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Road) Continue 
 0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillman State Park
 &#39\;s Model Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top of hill. \n\n
 **Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for 
 Radio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park&#39\;s Model Airfie
 ld. 
LOCATION:Hillman State Park\, Burgettstown\, PA 15021\, USA
