DESCRIPTION:o32qec8raki9708d90un8adqp0@google.com\nRAIN DATE IS ALSO CANCEL
 LED (Originally scheduled for August 10th)\n\nIf clear\, ( <a href="http:/
 /www.cleardarksky.com/c/PittsburghPAkey.html?1">http://www.cleardarksky.co
 m/c/PittsburghPAkey.html?1</a> )\, join us for views of the heavens throug
 h a telescope. Emerald View Park is a large municipal park in Pittsburgh\,
  Pennsylvania. It encircles the neighborhoods of Mt. Washington\, Duquesne
  Heights\, and Allentown and offers scenic views of the city that draw mor
 e than 1 million visitors annually.\n\nThere is no real address for Skooku
 m Field (WH Athletic Association). It is located off of Greenleaf St on Br
 adley St and Lizardi Way. The coordinates are: 40°26'23"N   80°1'43"W.\n
 \nThe event is scheduled for Wednesday\, August 10\, 2016 (Cloud/Rain Date
  is August 17 or 18). Sunset: 8:23 pm.\n\nThis event is free and open to t
 he public. \n\nMore Info: \n<a href="http://mwcdc.org/park/">http://mwcdc.
 org/park/</a>\nor\n<a href="http://www.3ap.org">http://www.3ap.org</a>\nor
 \n<a href="https://www.facebook.com/Amateur-Astronomers-Association-of-Pit
 tsburgh-114188205266611/">https://www.facebook.com/Amateur-Astronomers-Ass
 ociation-of-Pittsburgh-114188205266611/</a>\n\n\nPark Map Website: <a href
 ="http://mwcdc.org/evphistory/">http://mwcdc.org/evphistory/ </a>\nor\nPar
 k Map PDF: <a href="http://mwcdc.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/Web_EVPMap
 _2015.pdf">http://mwcdc.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/Web_EVPMap_2015.pdf
 </a>\n\nPhone: (412) 255-2539 \n\nPlease contact Fred for information or t
 o volunteer. Can also contact Diane\, Judy\, or Fred for more information.
LOCATION:40°26'23"N 80°1'43"W
