BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mingo SP
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20110708
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20110708
DTSTAMP:20260224T194009Z
UID:a0d7b6a0-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:bdd0j6pufu89cr67mcv0mievdo@google.com\n\n<a>(Posted May 211\, 2
 011\, KD)Space Shuttle Final Launch\, Atlantis STS-135 - July 8\, 2011\n\n
 Yesterday NASA announced Friday\, July 8\, 2011 as date of final space shu
 ttle launch. Conveniently AAAP has dual Public Star Parties scheduled that
  day at both Mingo and Wagman\, and same again the following day\, Saturda
 y.\n\nDepending (schedule hold\, timing of passes\, weather\, etc) it may 
 be optimal to celebrate this last space shuttle mission at out July Public
  Star Parties.</>\n\n<p>2011 Mingo Public Star Parties</p> April 8&9 May 6
 &7 June 3&4 July 8&9 August 5&6 August 20 MCPO Picnic September 17 October
  1\,15\,&29</p>\n<p>Nicholas E. Wagman Observatory</p>\n\n\n<p> 2011  Star
  Party Schedule</p>\n\n<p>Mar 12 Winterfest \nApril 8 and 9\nMay 6 and 7\n
 June 10 and 11\nJuly 8 and 9\nAugust 5 and 6\nSeptember 2 and 3 and 17 for
  Dark Sky SP\nOctober 8 and 15 for Moonrise SP\nStar Parties begin at dusk
 .\n \nClub picnic at Deer Lakes Park and members' star party will be June 
 25 at Minnow 2.\n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
