 www.pittsburghparks.org/earthday\n \nMembers of the Amateur Astronomers As
 sociation of Pittsburgh will assist the Pittsburgh Parks Conservancy in ce
 lbrating Earth Day by sharing the night sky at the Pittsburgh Parks commun
 ity Campfire.\n\n\nInterested AAAPers not already registered can email Min
 goSPCoordinator@3ap.org.\n\n\n--------------------------------\nfrom their
  website: \nDay One: Community Campfire*\nFriday\, April 17th\n7:00 - 9:00
 pm\nThis event is weather-dependent. In the case of inclement weather\, ch
 eck http://www.pittsburghparks.org/earthday   for cancellation information
 .\nWe'll have the fire and sticks\, you bring whatever you want to roast. 
