BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AAAP Holiday Party & Meeting
DTSTART:20141213T230000Z
DTEND:20141214T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194011Z
UID:a1f66856-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:2fl0q4fdjgg9o4t0pvo8e435og@google.com\nThe annual holiday party
  and meeting. Let's face it -- this meeting is about the food! The AAAP an
 d members will provide food for a buffet-style dinner. Cosmic Keilbassa? O
 f course. Home-made ice cream? Yum. Desserts upon desserts? Sure!\n\nAfter
  dinner and socializing\, door prizes -- some provided by the AAAP and som
 e provided by members -- will be available to lucky winners. Normally\, th
 ere are enough prizes such that everyone gets a prize ... or even two!\n\n
 Note that this meeting is limited to AAAP members and invited guests.\n\nH
 appy Holidays!
LOCATION:Buffalo Inn\, South Park
END:VEVENT
