UID:a23d492e-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:CSVConvert7c867105a72f9d12c3798ed7c4a16774\n<br>UPDATE: Due to 
 the COVID-19 pandemic\, this event has been cancelled.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>PL
 EASE NOTE: Star Parties Will Begin At Sunset\, not the time listed on the 
 calendar.<br><br>3AP Contact:  Terry Trees ( <a href="mailto:TreesT@comcas
 t.net">TreesT@comcast.net</a> )<br><br>Directions:  Kunkle Park is located
  behind the Washington Township Municipal Building.  For GPS users\, that
 ’s 285 Pine Run Church Road\, Apollo\, PA 15613.  (Near the State Police
  barracks on Route 66.)  GPS users can also insert the following coordinat
 es: 40 degrees\, 32.92 minutes north latitude\, 79 degrees\, 36.26 minutes
  west longitude.  <br><br>This year\, we will try a new observing site in 
 the park.  We will set up our telescopes in the new parking lot behind the
  refreshment stand/restroom building.
LOCATION:285 Pine Run Church Road\, Apollo\, PA 15613
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Conjunction of Venus and Jupiter
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20190122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20190122
DTSTAMP:20260224T194011Z
