DESCRIPTION:CSVConvert15b6b90abf77a39dde4290995554dcc2\nJanuary 22 - Conjun
 ction of Venus and Jupiter. A conjunction of Venus and Jupiter will be vis
 ible on January 22. The two bright planets will be visible within 2.4 degr
 ees of each other in the early morning sky. Look for this impressive sight
  in the east just before sunrise.\n\nSource: <a href="http://www.seasky.or
 g/astronomy/astronomy-calendar-2019.html">http://www.seasky.org/astronomy/
 astronomy-calendar-2019.html</a>
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
