BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AAAP Holiday Party
DTSTART:20091212T003000Z
DTEND:20091212T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194013Z
UID:a2fc77fe-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:hodekjrb50scrqh1mh3nc056mg@google.com\nAAAP Holiday Party\n12/1
 1/09\nDoors may open a bit earlier than 7:30. \n\nShaler Villa Fire Dept H
 all\, 960 Saxonburg Blvd\, Glenshaw\, PA 15116\n\n\nDirections to Shaler F
 ire Hall\n\nFrom the South\nRoute 28 to Route 8 through Etna and make a ri
 ght turn at\nthe first light after leaving Etna. That's Saxonburg Blvd. Go
 \nabout 1/4 of a mile and it's on the left.\n\nFrom North \nRoute 8\,and t
 urn left onto Saxonburg \nor \nSaxonburg going south from either Route 228
 \, Route 910 or Harts Run\nRoad.\n\nShaler Villa Fire Dept Hall\n960 Saxon
 burg Blvd\nGlenshaw\, PA 15116\n \nIf you're coming from the Pittsburgh or
  the south take Route 28 to Route 8 North.  You'll come to a light in Etna
  and a second one a block after it.  Stay on Route 8 for about 7/10 of a m
 ile and make a right turn at the third light.  This is Saxonburg Blvd.  St
 ay on it for about a quarter of a mile and the Hall will be on the left.\n
  \nIf you're coming from the north\, take Route 8 south until you come to 
 the same intersection and turn left on to Saxonburg Blvd.  I would avoid t
 aking Saxonburg from the north if you go past Hartwood Acres because of th
 e Celebration of Light Pollution.  You can get stuck in traffic for up to 
 an hour.\n \nRoute 8 is the key road. Once you get on it you should have l
 ittle or no trouble finding it.  The Shaler Shopping Plaza is very close t
 o the Fire Hall and there's an Eat 'N' Park at the corner of Saxonburg Blv
 d\, Route 8 and Middle Road.  Middle Road forks off to the left of Saxonbu
 rg Blvd.  DO NOT make this turn.  Go straight.  See yinz Friday.  The door
 s will open by 6:30 PM.\nSpeaker: Kevin Serafini\, Google software enginee
 r\, introducing a new application for certain types of cell\nphones with p
 ush-to/go-to combining GPS and Google Skymap cell phone technology.
LOCATION:Shaler Villa Fire Dept Hall\, 960 Saxonburg Blvd\, Glenshaw\, PA 1
 5116
END:VEVENT
