BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Doors to the Universe (Art Exhibit)
DTSTART:20160507T220000Z
DTEND:20160507T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194013Z
UID:a3639f7e-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:ropk0rrnqjuoaeoh0rbip2kus0@google.com\nOngoing: Call for artist
 s for Saturday\, May 7\, 6:00 pm\, “Doors to the Universe” CopyLeft Ga
 llery pop-up art gallery space\, opening night\, 127 Brownsville Road\, Pi
 ttsburgh\, PA 15210. Join us to celebrate the juncture of art and science.
  The gallery will bring in new guest artists weekly until June 4. \n\nMore
  Info: <a href="https://copyleft.gallery/">https://copyleft.gallery/</a>\n
 \nMore Info: <a href="http://wp.3ap.org/calendar/our-pittsburgh-constellat
 ion-calendar">Our Pittsburgh Constellation Calendar</a>
LOCATION:127 Brownsville Rd\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15210\, USA
