BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ISAN 7
DTSTART:20140309T000000Z
DTEND:20140309T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194014Z
UID:a384ced8-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:u5lpl74tg7u8gc0h6o7lkpmfvs@google.com\nISAN 7 (International Si
 dewalk Astronomy Night) will be held in honor of John Dobson on March 8th.
  Amateur astronomers worldwide can join in and celebrate his life by carry
 ing the torch that John lit back in 1968 when he co-founded the San Franci
 sco Sidewalk Astronomers.\n\nTo honor John Dobson and Dave Smith If the we
 ather is not too cold and the sky is clear members may set up at 19th and 
 Carson St on March 8 ~ 7 to 11 pm. Meanwhile enjoy astronomy outreach at W
 agman Winterfest held on this same day.
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
