 ill be carrying the Operationally Responsive Space-3 mission. This will be
  launching from Pad 0B at the Mid-Atlantic Regional Spaceport. Expect more
  information on this mission in the coming days.  https://www.facebook.com
 /NASAWFF\n\nThere may be observing planned at Mingo.  Call 724-348-6150 cl
 ose to the launch or check back here for update\, LADEE Launch was easily 
 observed from Mingo.\n\nPosted 11/13/2013 KD
