BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ToV Telecon
DTSTART:20120120T020000Z
DTEND:20120120T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194015Z
UID:a41bc1a8-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:32lbhdghhm80t06lbb4i18m9nc@google.com\n \n\n\n Jan 19th Telecon
  Prepares us for Transit of Venus\n\n\n\nWhat is our club doing for the Tr
 ansit of Venus on June 5th\, 2012? \n\nIn beginning to plan our/your event
 \, this telecon is a perfect time to get ideas. \nChuck Bueter will share 
 some great resources available for this outreach opportunity. Hear a quick
  and engaging history of the Venus transits that humans have witnessed. Fi
 nd out how to use new and innovative resources to engage the public around
  this event. Chuck will give us great ideas and links to find more. \n\nCh
 uck first became interested in the transit of Venus when he read engaging 
 stories of the international expeditions to time the planet's passage acro
 ss the sun. For the 2004 transit of Venus\, he built the website www.trans
 itofvenus.org\, and Chuck now brings the 2012 transit of Venus to the publ
 ic by hosting solar-viewing workshops\, coordinating community celebration
 s\, writing articles and blog entries\, building website content\, and rai
 sing awareness about the celestial phenomenon. \n\nTo join the Teleconfere
 nce on Thursday\, January 19th at 6:00 pm PST (9:00 pm Eastern) call the t
 oll-free conference call line: 1-888-455-9236 \n\nCall anytime after 5:45 
 pm the evening of the telecon. An operator will answer and: \n- You will b
 e asked for the passcode: NIGHT SKY NETWORK\n- You will be asked to give y
 our NAME and the CLUB you belong to\, and number of people listening with 
 you. \n\nYou can view the slides online here: http://www.astrosociety.org/
 nsntelecon/ \n\nOr download the PowerPoint from this page. \n\n \n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
