 t the Moon rises around Midnight and is up all night.\n\nhttp://earthsky.o
 rg/space/everything-you-need-to-know-geminid-meteor-shower\n\nhttp://www.a
 lmanac.com/astronomy/rise/PA/Pittsburgh/2014-12-13\n\nLast quarter moon is
