BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mingo Perseid Meteor Shower Party
DTSTART:20180813T003000Z
DTEND:20180813T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194015Z
UID:a48ddd4c-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:2fna73jscv5tjgr0u9tl846tl5@google.com\nSpecial Event: Perseid M
 eteor Shower Watch\n\nThe Amateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh wi
 ll open the observatory grounds in Mingo Creek County Park for the annual 
 Perseid Meteor Shower which is anticipated to peak on Sunday night into Mo
 nday morning. Limited access to the observatory will also be available. Br
 ing a blanket and some extra clothing layers and enjoy the wonders of the 
 night sky for this special event.\n\nThe Mingo Creek Park Observatory is h
 andicap accessible..  There is no charge for your visit\, but we gladly ac
 cept donations to cover operating expenses. There is no reservation needed
  and there is no limit on group sizes.\n\nNOTE: Mingo Creek Park Observato
 ry and its grounds\, as a part of Mingo Creek County Park\, are a no smoki
 ng and no alcohol permitted area.\n\nMingo Creek Park Observatory is opera
 ted by an all-volunteer staff of members of the Amateur Astronomers Associ
 ation of Pittsburgh.\n\nBecky Nichols\, Director\, Mingo Creek Park Observ
 atory\nAmateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh
LOCATION:Mingo Creek Park Observatory\, 1 Shelter 10 Road\, Finleyville\, P
 A 15332\, USA
END:VEVENT
