BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Quadrantid Meteors 
DTSTART:20140103T043000Z
DTEND:20140103T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194016Z
UID:a4b7abfe-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:eafu6vnf5fco9nsrq5u836a1i4@google.com\nQuadrantid Meteor Shower
  Kicks of 2014\nThe Quadrantids peak this year after Midnight on the night
  of January 2.  They should be visible between Midnight and Dawn for sever
 al days. Viewing is favorable this year coinciding with a Moonless sky. Th
 e Quadrantids can rival the better known Perseids of August.\nKD 12/29/201
 3\n\nAlas\, in Pittsburgh (Mingo) in 2014\, clouds are predicted up to Jan
 uary 2. Quadrantids peak the night\, Jan. 2-3\, it turns from cloudy and c
 old to bitter and mostly clear. Those who choose to brave the cold may get
  a celestial delight.\n\nKD 12/31/2013
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
