BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Moon
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20190830
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20190830
DTSTAMP:20260224T194016Z
UID:a549955a-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:CSVConvertdba1578e1d2197dce6b435f2d607f724\nAugust 30 - New Moo
 n. The Moon will located on the same side of the Earth as the Sun and will
  not be visible in the night sky. This phase occurs at 10:37 UTC. This is 
