DESCRIPTION:5iefullv5csdaq5jfumdt8r6q4@google.com\n<p>Please check the Wagm
 an Winterfest Website button at http://www.3ap.org/</p>\n\n<p><b>3.12 @ 2:
 40pm EST :: Winterfest is still on! Be cautious when parking.</b></p>\n\n<
 p>Please be advised to follow the weather conditions.</p><p>As of Noon\, M
 arch 12.</p>\n\n\nWagman Winterfest is still on. It appears the weather is
  improving\,\nthough forecasts later are iffy\, and we're concerned about 
 the soggy\nnature of the grounds with temperatures in the 40s and 50s.<p/>
 <p>\n*For immediate notice should a cancellation occur: http://www.twitter
 .com/3apmeetings\n\n<p><a href="http://nightsky.jpl.nasa.gov/event-view.cf
