 rfest \nApril 8 and 9\nMay 6 and 7\nJune 10 and 11\nJuly 8 and 9\nAugust 5
  and 6\nSeptember 2 and 3 and 17 for Dark Sky SP\nOctober 8 and 15 for Moo
