 ay on June 25th. This used to be the Great american Backyard Campout. \n\n
 <a href="http://www.post-gazette.com/life/lifestyle/2006/06/20/Backyard-Ca
 mpout-promotes-bonding-under-the-stars/stories/200606200176">http://www.po
