BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:York County Star Party Star Party\,Wellsville\, Pennsylvania
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20160727
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20160727
DTSTAMP:20260224T194020Z
UID:a7157390-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:so3dbeqr4a2980brearklc5f98@google.com\nYork County Star Party\n
 Shreveport Airport North\nWellsville\, Pennsylvania (near Philadelphia\, B
 altimore\, Washington DC)\nWebsite: <a href="http://yorkcountystarparty.or
 g/">http://yorkcountystarparty.org</a>\n\n<a href="http://wp.3ap.org/calen
 dar/international-astronomy-calendar/">International Astronomy Calendar</a
 >\n\nUPDATED INFORMATION:\n\nHello! My name is Phil De Rosa\, and I have c
 haired the Mason Dixon Star Party (MDSP) for about 13 of its 26 years\, si
 nce I joined the sponsoring club\, the York County Astronomical Society (Y
 CAS)\, in 1993.  \n\nSince the club has decided to cease all support for t
 his activity last year\, and the officers have withheld support for it for
  the last 4 years\, I decided to create the York County Star Party (YCSP)\
 , in the same location and with the same volunteers.  You can verify this 
 by going to <a href="www.masondixonstarparty.org">www.masondixonstarparty.
 org</a> which now says it is on sabbatical.  \n\nAttached is a flyer about
  the new star party that I ask you to consider sharing with your club memb
 ers\, and any other contacts that might be interested in this activity.  I
 f you have a star party events list\, I ask that you please update that li
 st to replace the MDSP with this party\, and send me a link to your list f
 or future reference.\n\nAnything you could do to help get this party off t
 he ground would be greatly appreciated.  Be sure to check out the website 
 to see the speakers and other facets of the party.\n\nThank you very much 
 for your time\, and please let me know if you decide to attend the party. 
  I would like to thank you personally!\n\nSincerely\,\nPhil De Rosa\nYCSP 
 chair\n\nEmail: <a href="info@yorkcountystarparty.org">info@yorkcountystar
 party.org</a>\n\nWebsite: <a href="www.yorkcountystarparty.org">www.yorkco
 untystarparty.org</a>\n\nJOIN THE YAHOO GROUP! - <a href="ycsp-subscribe@y
 ahoogroups.com">ycsp-subscribe@yahoogroups.com</a>\n\nJOIN US ON FACEBOOK!
  - <a href="https://www.facebook.com/MasonDixonStarParty/?notif_t=page_use
 r_activity">https://www.facebook.com/MasonDixonStarParty/?notif_t=page_use
 r_activity</a>\n\nKD 5/15/2016
LOCATION:Shreveport North Airport\, 370 Kralltown Rd\, Wellsville\, PA 1736
 5\, United States
END:VEVENT
