DESCRIPTION:9du69dtl2ou8j86gue04ti65bk@google.com\n May 10 - Astronomy Day 
 Part 1. Astronomy Day is an annual event intended to provide a means of in
 teraction between the general public and various astronomy enthusiasts\, g
 roups and professionals. The theme of Astronomy Day is "Bringing Astronomy
  to the People\," and on this day astronomy and stargazing clubs and other
  organizations around the world will plan special events. You can find out
  about special local events by contacting your local astronomy club or pla
 netarium. You can also find more about Astronomy Day by checking the Web s
 ite for the Astronomical League.  http://www.seasky.org/astronomy/astronom
 y-calendar-2014.html\n\nKD 12/22/2013
LOCATION:None
