DTEND:20151003T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194023Z
UID:a92805b2-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:3hieaaoi2gksvpem80u4cfnjn4@google.com\nUpdate  of October 2\, 2
 015  - Cancellation\n\nTonights Pleasant Hills Library Star Party has been
  cancelled because of the weather\, not to mention the clouds and more clo
 uds. Did I mention clouds?\n\n\nAt this time there is no rain or make-up d
 ate planned.\n\n\nWe will try again next year and have discussed moving th
 e star party date back into the July / August / September time frame.\n\n\
 nA big thank you to those who were going to participate.\n\n\n\n\nAAAPer\n
 Tim Kelly\n\n__._\,_.___\n\n\nUPDATE: September 9\, 2015\n\n\n\n\nChange o
 f Venue for Pleasant Hills Library – Third Annual Star Party\n\n\n\n\nSt
 ar Party presented by the Amateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh\n\
 n\n\n\nOctober 2\, 2015 – Rain Date - Unknown at this time\n\n\n\n\nTime
  7:30 - Presentation “What YOU Can See of the Solar System” by Fred Kl
 ein. \n\n\n\n\nI have been working with the Library Activities Director a
 nd convince her to relocate the site of the Star Party. It will now be hel
 d in at Breisinger Field.  It’s a baseball field with 60% more open sky
  and much easier to get to.\n\n\n\n\nThere is only one easy way to get the
 re and that’s via Rout 51. Whether you’re traveling North or South on 
 Route 51\, you will turn on East Bruceton Road at Kmart/BP Gas Station.\n\
 n\n\n\nComing from Bethel Park/South Park\, continue on Curry Hollow Road.
  Turn right at the “Clover Leaf” and head south on Route 51. Walgreens
  is your landmark to exit onto Route 51.\n\n\n\n\nComing through West Miff
 lin on Lebannon Church Road (Rt. 885)\, make the loop and head south on Ro
 ute 51.\n\n\n\n\nOnce you are on East Bruceton Road drive up about ¼ mile
  and turn left on Winiford Drive. You can’t miss the ballpark on the lef
 t. Please pay attention to the signs as you enter the parking lot.\n\n\n\n
 \nFred will give his presentation in the Pleasant Hills Borough Building m
 eeting room which is located adjacent to the field.\n\n\n\n\nThe coordinat
 es for the center of the ballfield are 40.329954\, -79.952038\n\n\n\n\nAny
  questions please contact me.\n\n\n\n\nCoordinator:  Tim Kelly – \n__._
 \,_.___\n\nStar Party Information\n\n\nPleasant Hills Library\n\nStar Part
 y presented by the Amateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh\n\nOctobe
 r 2\, 2015 – Rain date to be determined\n\nTime 7:30 pm \n\nLocation: Th
 e corner of Old Clairton Road and West Bruceton Road\, Pleasant Hills\, PA
  15236\n\nGPS Coordinates:  Latitude      40.3337322 \n\n                 
               Longitude  -79.9614539\n\n\nPleasant Hills Library\n\nStar P
 arty presented by the Amateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh\n\nOct
 ober 2\, 2015 – Rain date to be determined\n\nTime 7:30 pm \n\nLocation:
  The corner of Old Clairton Road and West Bruceton Road\, Pleasant Hills\,
  PA 15236\n\nGPS Coordinates:  Latitude      40.3337322 \n\n              
                  Longitude  -79.9614539\n
LOCATION: Old Clairton Road and West Bruceton Road\, Pleasant Hills\, PA 15
 236 
END:VEVENT
