UID:a951beb6-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:6kd9vv45eemvc4806cf6helrpc@google.com\nJuly 11th 4:30pm-7:30pm 
 Planet Party- A Learning Party -FREE!\n\nEver find yourself dreaming of th
 e stars? Want to blast off on an outer space adventure? Join us for a Plan
 et Party\, a Learning Party on July 11th- and learn about our solar system
  and the planets beyond!  Meet space experts\, astronomers\, cosmologists\
 , physicists\, artists\, and even an ASTRONAUT! Design your space gear and
  name your own extrasolar planet! Send a postcard to Voyager 1!  Participa
 te in fun\, hands-on activities led by local makers\, scientists\, artists
 \, and technologists. Fun for kids\, friends\, and grown ups! All material
 s provided.This project supported in part by Spark\, a program of The Spro
 ut Fund.\n\nAAAPers interested in helping --  Contact Nina from Assemble P
 gh at\nassemblepgh@gmail.com.\n\n\nKD 07/3/2012 
LOCATION:5125 Penn Ave \, pittsburgh\, pa
END:VEVENT
