 e of the incoming clouds and rain.  We'll give it a try on Tuesday night.\
 n \nTomI am planning several nights for some sessions for members to come 
 up to Wagman to learn some of my observing methods and informal training o
 n the Manka scope. These dates will depend on the weather and attendance.\
 nI will conduct Starhopping Classes in September and October\, also weathe
 r permitting. Here are the dates for the observing sessions and training:\
 n \nAug 18 and 19 (Thursday and Friday)\n \nStarhopping Classes\n \nSept 1
 9 and 20\nOct 17 and 18\nMondays and Tuesdays\nEmail me at this address if
  you plan to come to any of these programs.\n \nTom Reiland
