BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CANCELLED - Murrysville Star Party
DTSTART:20180516T000000Z
DTEND:20180516T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194024Z
UID:a9872754-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:263bjh007g4pp4g564ffg7rgkl@google.com\nSunsets at&nbsp\;<span>8
 :29 PM</span><br><br>We can stay on the field as long as we wish. As this 
 is a new moon if the sky is clear we will have great observing.<br>-Bill M
 outz&nbsp\;<br><br>Directions: Enter park and continue all the way up to t
 he&nbsp\;<b>very top</b>&nbsp\;of the park. You cannot see the observing f
 ield until you drive up the hill to the top of the unpaved portion of the 
 park road. We set up on the Weistertown Rd side of the field. We drive our
  cars across the field to that spot. It is several hundreds of yards long 
 and the edge of the field overlooks the ball fields below.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;
