BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Joint SSP & AAAP Annual Meeting
DTSTART:20161019T210000Z
DTEND:20161019T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194024Z
UID:a9950108-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:8ij74sgcsat6tvfhe407urb03o@google.com\nThe Spectroscopy Society
  of Pittsburgh (SSP) and Amateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh (AA
 AP) annual joint meeting\n\nTECHNOLOGY FORUM - 5:15 PM\n“Pittcon Planeta
 rium Presentation”\nThe current planetarium was purchased in 2010 by Pit
 tcon as part of Science Week in Atlanta. The societies started offering th
 e planetarium program in 2011 to local school districts in Western Pennsyl
 vania on a first come\, first serve basis depending on the schedules of th
 e volunteer society members.\n\nTECHNOLOGY PROGRAM – 8:15 PM\nDr. Ori Fo
 x\, Research Scientist Space Telescope Science Institute presents “Now Y
 ou See Them\, Now You Don’t: Exploding Stars and the James Webb Space Te
 lescope”\n\nSupernovae are the explosions of stars that reach the ends o
 f their lifetime. These awesome events are nearly as bright as the entire 
 galaxy which hosts them. Yet the astronomical community has surprisingly f
 ew constraints on the supernova progenitor systems because it is quite dif
 ficult to identify the stars before they explode. In this talk I will prov
 ide an overview of supernova explosions\, with plenty of fantastic images 
 both before and after the stellar deaths\, highlighting both the current s
 tate of the field and the remaining mysteries. I will incorporate raw data
  from telescopes I use\, including Keck and Hubble. Finally\, I will discu
 ss the future of astronomical observations with NASA’s next flagship mis
 sion\, the James Webb Space Telescope.\n\n5:15 PM Technology Forum Speaker
 ’s Presentation – Power Center Ballroom Section C\n5:30 PM Social Hour
  – Power Center Fides Shepperson Suite\n6:45 PM Dinner – Power Center 
 Ballroom Section C\n8:00 PM Business Meeting – Power Center Ballroom Sec
 tion C\n8:15 PM Technical Program Speaker’s Presentation – Power Cente
 r Ballroom Section C\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Deadline for Dinner Reservations is W
 ednesday\, October 12\, 2016 at 12:00 noon.\n\nFor More Info: <a href="htt
 p://www.ssp-pgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/October-Meeting-Notice-2016
 .pdf">http://www.ssp-pgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/October-Meeting-No
 tice-2016.pdf</a>
LOCATION:Power Center\, 1015 Forbes Ave\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15219\, USA
END:VEVENT
