UID:a9b4da82-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:34i1m24a0jh1b78uv4d3cnsuvk@google.com\nThe Birth\, Life\, and D
 eath of Stars – a Layman’s Perspective\n \nWhere?  Mingo Creek Park Ob
 servatory in Washington County\n \nWhen? Four Tuesdays\, 7:30 PM – 9:00 
 PM\,  April 8th\, 15th\, 22nd and 29th\nTelescope observing to follow\, sk
 ies permitting\n \nLearn about how you are made of “star dust\,” how s
 tars are born\, star nurseries\, black holes\, how long stars live\, what 
 happens when they die\, and more.\n \nOpen Rain or shine\, cloudy or clear
 \n\n \n
