DESCRIPTION:hur85oqmeghnb6eh4mgfe4rqfk@google.com\nMoved the WCCC SP to Sep
 . 15\, 2011.\n\nUpdate of   2:30PM  9/8/2011\n\nRuss and I decided to move
  the WCCC SP to Sep 15.  He wants to give his students another classroom s
 ession before they come up to Wagman.\n \nTom\n \nUpdate of Sunday 9/4/201
 1 6PM\nThe star party is at Wagman Observatory\, weather permitting\, star
 ting at 7:30 PM.  I probably won't need much assistance since there be 10 
 or less students and the teacher.\n \nTom\n\nUpdate of Sunday 9/4/2011 5PM
 \nActually\, it's Russell Namie teaching the WCCC class\, not Glenn Smith.
   We won't reschedule this star party until we are certain that the condit
 ions will make it impossible to conduct any observing.  It's way too early
  to make any rash decisions.  If I would have gone by the earlier forecast
 s for this past weekend\, both nights would have been canceled.\n  \nTom\n
 \nI've tentatively scheduled a class from WCCC from Sept 8\, a Thursday st
 arting around 8 PM.  I'll have confirmation on this in a week are two.\nTh
 e Girl Scout Group that was rained out in May will at Wagman Obs on Saturd
 ay\, Oct 1.  It will start at 7:30 PM.\nLet me know if you can assist with
  either or both of these events.\nI'm certain that more will be posted lat
 er on.\nThanks in advance for your help.\n \nTom\n\n__._\,_.___
