BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Venus at Greatest Western Elongation
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20170603
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20170603
DTSTAMP:20260224T194025Z
UID:aa8fc066-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:CSVConvert470b7f69f5ffff1f25463f864cc57988\nJune 3 - Venus at G
 reatest Western Elongation. The planet Venus reaches greatest eastern elon
 gation of 45.9 degrees from the Sun. This is the best time to view Venus s
 ince it will be at its highest point above the horizon in the morning sky.
  Look for the bright planet in the eastern sky before sunrise.\n\nSource: 
 <a href="http://www.seasky.org/astronomy/astronomy-calendar-2017.html">htt
 p://www.seasky.org/astronomy/astronomy-calendar-2017.html</a>
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
