BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kunkle Star Party
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20131012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20131012
DTSTAMP:20260224T194026Z
UID:aaaa2384-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:dfq6j6ks384f9e3boip16jp8a4@google.com\nNo start time provided.\
 n\nThe following dates have been scheduled for star parties at Kunkle Park
 \, Washington Twp.\, Westmoreland County.  It’s about 5 or 6 minutes sou
 th of Apollo\, PA\, and about ½ mile off Rte. 66.  I’d guess it’s a h
 alf hour ride east of Wagman Observatory.  I’ll get directions to those 
 who are interested.\n\n \n\nFRIDAY\, May 17\, 1st quarter moon  \n\n \n\nS
 ATURDAY\, May 25\, full moon \n\n(Two May events because the weather is so
  unpredictable.  Let’s actually try to get one in for May and we never s
 how the full moon\, even though it will strongly limit what else we can se
 e that night)\n\n \n\nSATURDAY\, August 3\, near new moon (dark sky event\
 , and this is a reasonably dark site\, even with lights on the police stat
 ion)\n\n \n\nSATURDAY\, October 12\, 1st quarter moon \n\n(Possibly Washin
 gton Twp. Halloween Party night for the kids)\n\n \n\nWe could use your he
 lp.  We’ve been advertising the events more the past year or so and our 
 attendance is slowly growing.  Last summer we got more than 50 people on a
  crummy night.\n\n \n\nPlease let me know if and what dates you can help.\
 n\n \n\nThanks a million.\n\n \n\nTerry\n\n \n\n\n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
