BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fern Hollow- Cancelled
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20081028
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20081028
DTSTAMP:20260224T194026Z
UID:aad8ecc8-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:elvdnqr26gi52sti9qa76gploc@google.com\nWith  skies of solid clo
 uds and rain expected for Tuesday and Wednesday\, we\nhave talked with the
  Nature Center and are sorry to have  to cancel the Fern\nHollow Star Part
 y.\n\nThe Center is still enthusiastic about future start parties and woul
 d like\nto have us come again in the Spring.\n\nMeanwhile\, AAAP club memb
 ers are welcome to bring their scopes onto the Fern\nHollow Nature Center 
 grounds any night for independent viewing.  This\nSewickley Heights locati
 on is a great spot for those of us who live West and\nNorth of the city.  
 To avoid conflicts\, check the "events" section of their\nweb site before 
 heading out\, where you'll also find directions:\nhttp://www.fhnc.org/\n\n
 Dave and Alison\n\nHi Kathy\,\n\nHere are 4 calendar entries.\n\nThanks\,\
 n\nAlison \n\n---------------------------------------------\n\nNov. 14 mem
 bership meeting entry\, please add\n\nThe 2008 Brunelle Astrophotography C
 ontest\nSee contest rules and past winners at http://www.3ap.org/brunelle.
 shtml\n...................................................................
 ....................\n\nNovember 4\nSubmission Deadline for the 2008 Brune
 lle Astrophotography Contest\nSee contest rules and past winners at http:/
 /www.3ap.org/brunelle.shtml\n\n...........................................
 ...........................................\n\nTues. October 28\nStar part
 y at the Fern Hollow Nature Center in Sewickley\n7:30p to 11:30p\nIf you b
 ring a scope\, you can drive onto the field and set up as early as\n6p.\nT
 he Fern Hollow Nature Center has a very nice\, flat\, open high plateau in
 \nthe middle of the countryside.\nDirections at http://www.fhnc.org/direct
 ions.html\n\n.............................................................
 ...................................\nWed. Oct. 29 - 7:30 p to 11:30 p\nFer
 n Hollow back up date in case of clouds or rain\nSee details on Oct. 28.
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
