DESCRIPTION:phqu1ecc5r0h5tgb41841guk08@google.com\nIf clear\, ( <a href="ht
 tp://www.cleardarksky.com/c/PittsburghPAkey.html?1">http://www.cleardarksk
 y.com/c/PittsburghPAkey.html?1</a> )\, join us for views of the heavens th
 rough a telescope. Emerald View Park is a large municipal park in Pittsbur
 gh\, Pennsylvania. It encircles the neighborhoods of Mt. Washington\, Duqu
 esne Heights\, and Allentown and offers scenic views of the city that draw
  more than 1 million visitors annually.\n\nThere is no real address for Sk
 ookum Field (WH Athletic Association). It is located off of Greenleaf St o
 n Bradley St and Lizardi Way. The coordinates are: 40°26'23"N   80°1'43"
 W.\n\nThe event is scheduled for Wednesday\, August 10\, 2016 (Cloud/Rain 
 Date is August 17 or 18). Sunset: 8:23 pm.\n\nThis event is free and open 
 to the public. \n\nMore Info: \n<a href="http://mwcdc.org/park/">http://mw
 cdc.org/park/</a>\nor\n<a href="http://www.3ap.org">http://www.3ap.org</a>
 \nor\n<a href="https://www.facebook.com/Amateur-Astronomers-Association-of
 -Pittsburgh-114188205266611/">https://www.facebook.com/Amateur-Astronomers
 -Association-of-Pittsburgh-114188205266611/</a>\n\n\nPark Map Website: <a 
 href="http://mwcdc.org/evphistory/">http://mwcdc.org/evphistory/ </a>\nor\
 nPark Map PDF: <a href="http://mwcdc.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/Web_EV
 PMap_2015.pdf">http://mwcdc.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/Web_EVPMap_2015
 .pdf</a>\n\nPhone: (412) 255-2539 \n\nPlease contact Kathy Desantis for in
 formation or to volunteer. Can also contact Diane\, Judy\, or Fred for mor
 e information.\n
LOCATION:40°26'23"N 80°1'43"W
END:VEVENT
