DESCRIPTION:d9hse4ad5eu40kucj54d8rgjvc@google.com\nCANCELLED\n\n4PM - No Ne
 w Updates Issued.\n2PM Update:The weather for tonight’s star parties is 
 indicating 100% Cloud Cover. Our telescopes do not see through the clouds.
  It would be typical for the Wagman Star Party to cancel under these circu
 mstances. The Mingo Planetarium can run indoor programming and is more lik
 ely not to be cancelled. Please check back for updates. This should be upd
 ated again by 4 PM.\n\n\n2015 Kunkle Park Star Party Dates Set\n\n2015 Kun
 kle Park Star Party Dates Set by Township Supervisors\nAAAP members should
  email vicepresident@3ap.org to volunteer for these public Kunkle Park Sta
 r Parties events.\n\nSaturday\, May 23:  Crescent Moon\, Venus\, Jupiter\,
  Saturn\, Star Clusters\nSaturday\, June 27\, Gibbous Moon\, Venus\, Jupit
 er\, Saturn\, MAYBE some deep sky objects but the moon will be pretty brig
 ht\n\nSaturday\, August 8\, Dark Sky – Saturn\, Clusters\, Nebulas and G
 alaxies\n\nSaturday\, October 3\, Dark Sky – Clusters\, Nebulas and Gala
 xies\n\nhttp://www.meetup.com/www-3ap-org/pages/Map_of_Kunkle_Park_Star_Pa
 rty_Site/\n\nKD2/4/2015\n\n\n
LOCATION:Elbert N. Kunkle Park\, 285 Pine Run Church Road.\, Apollo\, PA 15
 613\, United States
