DESCRIPTION:5q7dd7f0fmr7u7ugnh8trap4f8@google.com\nBetter Observing Techniq
 ues Classes will be held at Wagman Observatory on Sep 11\, Sept 13\, Oct 9
 \, and Oct 11. They will start about 7 or 7:30 PM and will end when the la
