  bit early to set out food and door prizes can show up as early as 5:00 pm
 .\n\nDownload the December GS for more information\, at www.3ap.org.\n\nKD
  12/3/2013\n\nHoliday Party/meeting at Shaler Villa VFD\nSaturday Dec 14 f
 or the AAAP Meeting/party.\n\nShaler Villa Vol. Fire Dept. Hall \nAAAP Hol
 iday Party 12/11/09 Doors open at 6:30. Meeting starts 7:30PM. Shaler Vill
 a Fire Dept Hall\, 960 Saxonburg Blvd\, Glenshaw\, PA 15116 Directions to 
 Shaler Fire Hall From the South Route 28 to Route 8 through Etna and make 
 a right turn at the first light after leaving Etna. That's Saxonburg Blvd.
  Go about 1/4 of a mile and it's on the left. From North Route 8\,and turn
  left onto Saxonburg or Saxonburg going south from either Route 228\, Rout
 e 910 or Harts Run Road. \nAddress: 960 Saxonburg Blvd\, Glenshaw\, PA 151
 16\nGlenshaw\, PA 15116 \n\n\n\nKD 7/18/2013
