 oordinates:  Lat: 40-17’51” N   Long: 079-55’48” W\nMap: <a href="
 http://mapq.st/1S9f6x3">http://mapq.st/1S9f6x3</a>\n\nRescheduled from Aug
 ust 16 to Rain date August 23\, 2016 - Event will take place at the Jeffer
