DESCRIPTION:raas6p4di4i051b37vqp5ol23k@google.com\n\nMonroeville Star Party
 \n\nFriday\, August 15\, 2014\, for the Star Party at Ramsey Elementary Sc
 hool\, 2200 Ramsey Rd\, Monroeville\, 15146.\n\nThe party is on the baseba
 ll field in Beechwood park which is reached by entering the school parking
  lot.  For those setting up scopes\, proceed to the end of the basketball 
 court to the barrier to unload\, then park in the marked spaces in the lot
 .\n\n\n\nFred K.\n\n\nKD 8/14/2014\n\n\n\nMonroeville Library star party i
 s confirmed as Friday August 15 with Saturday August 16 as the rain date s
 tarting at 9 PM.  It will be at Monroeville’s Beechwood Park which is en
 tered through the parking lot behind Ramsey School at 2200 Ramsey Rd in Mo
 nroeville.  The party is for the summer reading program for middle schoole
 rs\, parents and others.  They are thinking of up to 50 people. \n\n \n\nI
  am asking for two volunteers to help me with this star party.  Please let
  me know if you can help.\n\n \n\nFred K\n\n\nKD 6/30/2014 updated
