  for more information.\n\n- Sept. 12\, 2014 (CSC) - Ken Kobus: “Stars in
  the Making: The Brilliant and Largely Unrecognized Early Role Played by W
 omen in Astrophysics.”\n- Oct. 17\, 2014 (CSC) – Terry Trees: “Sky T
