 - Dec. 13\, 2014 – AAAP Holiday Party at Buffalo Inn\, South Park\n- Jan
 . 9. 2015 (CSC) – Eric Fischer: “Where Have All the Astronauts Gone?
 ”\n- Feb. 13\, 2015 (CSC) - Annual Buhl Planetarium Sky Show\n- March 13
