DESCRIPTION:dfk79ccjd1i79df4r1l410vhlc@google.com\nReservations for the pub
 lic opened August 1. Reservations are free but they are limited and are ma
 de directly through Allegheny Obsevatory: <a href="http://www.pitt.edu/~ao
 bsvtry/">http://www.pitt.edu/~aobsvtry/</a> Both of the 30-inch Thaw Refra
 ctor and the 13-inch Fitz-Clark Refractor are set up for public use\, and 
 members of the Amateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh set up additi
 onal telescopes on the front lawn.  \n\nAAAP volunteers make arrangements 
 with Lou C. by email. Those wishing to reserve tickets should call the obs
 ervatory at 412-321-2400 between 1:00p.m. and 5:00p.m. Monday through Frid
 ay. \n\n\nKD 8/9/2016 
