DESCRIPTION:u9u8m6dbei5b0aoi7dmf65igk0@google.com\n\n\n"The 2014 Perseid me
 teor shower will peak between August 10 and August 13. A waning Gibbous Mo
 on (the Moon's phase after a full moon) may make it harder for observers t
 o see the shower. Despite this\, astronomers suggest that observers try th
 eir luck to catch some Perseids before dawn on August 11\, 12 and 13." htt
 p://www.timeanddate.com/astronomy/meteor-shower/perseid.html\n\n\n\nKD 7/1
 7/2014
