BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:VenusTransit
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20120605
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20120605
DTSTAMP:20260224T194033Z
UID:af19c564-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:cug97vffp73de7g6qor4rb2i6o@google.com\nTuesday\, June 5\, 2012 
 when the last Transit of Venus of our lifetime will take place.  The NASA 
 Night Sky Network will be celebrating and supporting your Venus Transit ou
 treach events with a ToolKit on the Sun and heliophysics. Scheduled for re
 lease next year\, the ToolKit will include resources to address what can b
 e seen on the Sun\, how the magnetic fields generate these observable feat
 ures\, and the impact of solar storms on Earth.  We're looking for a name 
 for the ToolKit.\, so send us your suggestions!\n\nKD June2011\n\nUpdate J
 une 2\, 2012\n  We at Wagman Obs are open to the public that evening\, wea
 ther permitting from the start until sunset.  Publicity has been sent out 
 to the media and it's been on facebook as well.  We'll be open at 6 PM for
  the public. First contact for us\, depending on whose estimate you believ
 e\, will be somewhere between 6:04 and 6:09.\n    By the way\, I don't thi
 nk that we'll need to put up the parking lights only signs.  : )\n \nTom\n
 \n&\n\nAt Mingo we will view the transit from its beginning (6:04PM EDST) 
 until 7:30 – 7:45 PM when the sun will be behind some trees.\n\n \n\nBil
 l \n\n-------------------------------\n\n\n\nTransit of Venus\n\nTuesday\,
  June 5\, 2012\n\nhttp://www.transitofvenus.org/\n\nLook for possible upda
 tes for viewing options sponsored by AAAP.\n\n \n\n\n\nProtect your eyes. 
 \n\nThere are several safe ways to watch Venus transit the sun.  \n\n•Re
 ar projection screen\n\n•Solar filtered telescope\n\n•#14 or greater w
 elding glass\n\n•Disposable "eclipse shades"\n\n•Live webcasts\, http:
 //www.transitofvenus.org/\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nClear western horizon\, evenin
 g of June 5. \n\nTimes (Mingo Observatory):\n\ningress exterior\n\nJun 5\n
 18:04:05\n\ningress interior\n\nJun 5\n18:21:35\n\ntransit center\n\nJun 5
 \n21:27:30\n\negress interior\n\nJun 6\n00:33:02\n\negress exterior\n\nJun
  6\n00:50:55\n\n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
