DESCRIPTION:o60p8t13sta3jom23q84o9gm54@google.com\n4PM - No New Updates Iss
 ued.\n2PM Update:The weather for tonight’s star parties is indicating 10
 0% Cloud Cover. Our telescopes do not see through the clouds. It would be 
