 gheny County\, PA\nMarch 27\, 28\nApril 24\, 25\nMay 22\, 23\nJune 19\, 20
 \nJuly 24\, 25\nAugust 21\, 22\nSept 5 (Dark Sky)\,19\, 27(Sunday Lunar Ec
 lipse)\nOct 3 (Dark Sky)\, 17\nNov 7 Mid-Autumn Star Party\n\nMingo Creek 
 Park Observatory\nMingo Creek County Park\, Washington County\, PA\nMarch 
 27\, 28\nApril 24\, 25\nMay 22\, 23\nJune 19\, 20\nJuly 24\, 25\nAugust 14
