 oonset: 14:37\nSunset: 20:34\n\nFor more information\, please visit our St
 ar Party link at: \n<a href="http://wp.3ap.org/resources/star-parties-2/">
 http://wp.3ap.org/resources/star-parties-2/</a>
LOCATION:Mingo Creek Park Observatory\, Little Mingo Rd\, Venetia\, PA 1536
 7\, United States
