UID:b0aaa9f2-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:3s7u64kqrl1851mcp08lv9ta4q@google.com\nDue to rain and clouds\,
  this event has been cancelled.  \n\nIt will be at the model airplane fi
 eld as before.  This is on top of a hill with clear viewing in all directi
 ons. (Directions below). There will be a young moon early and Saturn and J
 upiter will be high in the sky.\n\n---------------------------------------
 ----------------------------------------------------------------\nDirectio
 ns to Hillman SP's Radio Control Airport/Airfield\n\nFrom the North (Beave
 r)\n\nTake PA-18 south\nTurn Left at Light in Florence onto Steubenville P
 ike Continue 1.5 miles on\nSteubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Contin
 ue 1.7 miles on Haul Road\n(Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer 
 Road (Gravel Road) Continue\n0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into e
 ntrance of Hillman State Park's\nModel Airfield Follow gravel road to airf
 ield at top of hill.\n\n**Please note that once you enter Hillman State Pa
 rk\, follow signage for\nRadio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State
  Park's Model Airfield.\n\nFrom the South (Burgettstown and Washington)\n\
 nTake PA-18 north\nTurn Right at Light in Florence onto Steubenville Pike 
 Continue 1.5 miles\non Steubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1
 .7 miles on Haul\nRoad (Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road
  (Gravel Road)\nContinue 0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entra
 nce of Hillman\nState Park's Model Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield
  at top of hill.\n\n**Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\,
  follow signage for\nRadio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Par
 k's Model Airfield.\n\nFrom East (Pittsburgh)\n\nTake US-22 West\nTake the
  PA-18 exit for Florence/Burgettstown Turn Left at Light onto\nPA-18 North
  Turn Right at Light onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles\non Steuben
 ville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul\nRoad (Gravel
  and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Road)\nContinue 0.7 m
 iles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillman\nState Park's M
 odel Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top of hill.\n\n**Please n
 ote that once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for\nRadio Con
 trol Model Airport to find Hillman State Park's Model Airfield.\n\nFrom We
 st (Weirton and Steubenville)\n\nTake US-22 East\nTake the PA-18 exit for 
 Florence/Burgettstown Turn Left onto PA-18 North\nTurn Right at Light onto
  Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles on\nSteubenville Pike Turn Left on H
 aul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul Road\n(Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn R
 ight on Kramer Road (Gravel Road) Continue\n0.7 miles on Kramer Road and t
 urn left into entrance of Hillman State Park's\nModel Airfield Follow grav
 el road to airfield at top of hill.\n\n**Please note that once you enter H
 illman State Park\, follow signage for\nRadio Control Model Airport to fin
 d Hillman State Park's Model Airfield.
LOCATION:Hillman State Park\, Burgettstown\, PA 15021\, USA - Radio Control
  Airfield
END:VEVENT
