 ntil dawn.\n\nWhere: look toward the NE horizon at the constellation Perse
 us rising in the northeast sky. \n\nWhat to bring: lawn chair\, bottled wa
 ter\, camera\, tripod.\n\nFull moon Aug. 13\, 2011\n \n
