UID:b0ea62cc-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:2kinuhs9024clgcfe6fscb2put@google.com\nOn May 11th\, I'll be se
 tting up my gear at Mingo and inviting anyone interested in learning how t
 o find targets to join me.  This is weather permitting\, of course.  \n\
 nIf you have questions about your gear this will be a good night to bring 
 it down as it's not a star party night.  Again\, I stress\, I am not a ph
 otographer and I will be of little help on the AP side of things.  Even i
 f you don't care about star hopping\, bring your gear and observe with oth
 er members\, or just show up and look through others' eyepieces.\n\nI'm no
 t trained on the observatory scopes yet\, so I won't be opening the roofs.
   Just me\, my dob\, an atlas and the stars.  Like a beer commercial 
 😁
LOCATION:Mingo Creek Park Observatory\, 1 Shelter 10 Road\, Finleyville\, P
 A 15332\, USA
END:VEVENT
