 nset.  There's a members' and their family and friends only star party aft
 er the picnic at Wagman Observatory\, weather permitting.  This event will
  be a few days after the 80th Anniversary of the founding of the AAAP. \nT
 here's no alcohol at our picnics because we get drunk on celestial photons
 . :)\nMembers bring their own food and drink and usually swap with each ot
