BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Astrobiology Telecon 9P
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20110728
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20110728
DTSTAMP:20260224T194037Z
UID:b190117c-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:nmosurfa5bt58cmtg0knkin0k0@google.com\nAstrobiology Telecon 9P\
 nThursday\, July 28th Astrobiology Telecon with Dr. David Morrison. \nYou 
 won't want to miss it! \nhttp://nightsky.jpl.nasa.gov/club/news-display.cf
 m?News_ID=430 \n\nTelecons for your calendar    \nIn celebration with the 
 release of our latest ToolKit\, Life in the Universe:\nAre We Alone?\, the
  NSN is pleased to engage you with Dr. David Morrison\, presenting his pas
 sion for astrobiology. Dr. Morrison is the senior scientist at the NASA As
 trobiology Institute\, NASA Ames Research Center at Moffett Field in Calif
 ornia:  http://nightsky.jpl.nasa.gov/club/news-display.cfm?News_ID=430\n\n
 To log into the Telecon on Thursday\, July 28th between 5:45 - 6:00pm (Pac
 ific Time):\nUse the toll-free conference call line: 1-888-455-9236\nAn op
 erator will answer and:\n            • You will be asked for the passcod
 e: NIGHT SKY NETWORK\n            • You will be asked to give your NAME 
 and the CLUB you belong to\, and number of people listening with you.\n\nF
 ind the PowerPoint and other download links here soon:  http://nightsky.jp
 l.nasa.gov/download-view.cfm?Doc_ID=476\n\nNext upcoming telecons are:\nTh
 ursday\, August 18th: Brooke Hsu\, for bonus telecon on International Obse
 rve the Moon Night (InOMN)\nThursday\, September 22nd: Exploring the Dark 
 Side of the Solar System with WISE featuring Dr. Ned Wright Thursday\, Nov
 ember 17th: Citizen Science and the LADEE Mission with Brian Day
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
