DESCRIPTION:r1grfbjuhumlpa8vp7skr388jc@google.com\n\nCANCELLED- RAIN\nI've 
 chosen Monday September 27 and Tuesday the 28th for this year's Starhoppin
 g and learning the constellations classes.  The start time will be 7:30 an
 d there is no fee.  They will last until the last student quits for the ev
 ening.\nThe classes are weather permitting.  If you need assistance with y
 our telescope (no goto scopes here) feel free to bring it.  I suggest that
  you bring binoculars if you own a pair.  Please email me if you plan to a
 ttend either or both sessions.  Some observing will be done on the Manka 2
 1" scope.\n \nTom 
