DESCRIPTION:54pmedv1tqt0ankc2tskd27ct9@google.com\nJoin 3AP members for an 
 astronomy presentation followed by a night of observing through member&#39
 \;s telescopes!  It will be at the model airplane field as before.  This 
 is on top of a hill with clear viewing in all directions. (Directions belo
 w). There will be a young moon early and Saturn and Jupiter will be high i
 n the sky.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------
 -------------------------------------------\nDirections to Hillman SP&#39\
 ;s Radio Control Airport/Airfield\n\nFrom the North (Beaver)\n\nTake PA-18
  south\nTurn Left at Light in Florence onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5
  miles on\nSteubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on 
 Haul Road\n(Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Roa
 d) Continue\n0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillm
 an State Park&#39\;s\nModel Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top
  of hill.\n\n**Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow
  signage for\nRadio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park&#39\;
 s Model Airfield.\n\nFrom the South (Burgettstown and Washington)\n\nTake 
 PA-18 north\nTurn Right at Light in Florence onto Steubenville Pike Contin
 ue 1.5 miles\non Steubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 mil
 es on Haul\nRoad (Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Grav
 el Road)\nContinue 0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of
  Hillman\nState Park&#39\;s Model Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield 
 at top of hill.\n\n**Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, 
 follow signage for\nRadio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park
 &#39\;s Model Airfield.\n\nFrom East (Pittsburgh)\n\nTake US-22 West\nTake
  the PA-18 exit for Florence/Burgettstown Turn Left at Light onto\nPA-18 N
 orth Turn Right at Light onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles\non Ste
 ubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul\nRoad (Gr
 avel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Road)\nContinue 0
 .7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillman\nState Park
 &#39\;s Model Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top of hill.\n\n*
 *Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for\n
 Radio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park&#39\;s Model Airfie
 ld.\n\nFrom West (Weirton and Steubenville)\n\nTake US-22 East\nTake the P
 A-18 exit for Florence/Burgettstown Turn Left onto PA-18 North\nTurn Right
  at Light onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles on\nSteubenville Pike 
 Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul Road\n(Gravel and Asphal
 t Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Road) Continue\n0.7 miles on Kra
 mer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillman State Park&#39\;s\nModel A
 irfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top of hill.\n\n**Please note th
 at once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for\nRadio Control M
 odel Airport to find Hillman State Park&#39\;s Model Airfield.
LOCATION:Hillman State Park\, Burgettstown\, PA 15021\, USA - Radio Control
  Airfield
