BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Members only - How to Star Hop
DTSTART:20240302T200000Z
DTEND:20240302T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194037Z
UID:b1c7ecdc-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:516s88f4hc56su99cqi6pi0b7f@google.com\nThis will be sort of a &
 quot\;preparing to starhop&quot\; seminar.  We&#39\;ll talk about the too
 ls you need\, how to use apps\, star charts and planispheres.  We will ke
 ep it at a beginner level\, talking about the basics\, focusing on the Mes
 sier list\, and using the planetarium with Stellarium to simulate the nigh
 t sky and practice a few hops in Sagittarius.  After this class\, you&#39
 \;ll be able to go out and start finding targets on your own.  As you pra
 ctice\, you&#39\;ll be able to locate more challenging targets.
LOCATION:Mingo Creek Park Observatory\, 1 Shelter 10 Road\, Finleyville\, P
 A 15332\, USA
END:VEVENT
