UID:b1dc40b0-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:4dv9klh0inra3m7qr34md3lroo@google.com\nThis is an early heads u
 p - I intend to set up for sidewalk astronomy Saturday night\, if the curr
 ent weather forcasts hold. \n\nI will be at 19th St and E. Carson by Prima
 nti's on the south Side from about 7:30 to 10:30 or so on Saturday Sept. 1
 8. \n\nMy target will be the moon at about 80% phase then Jupiter when it 
 rises over the yard-arm.\n\nFeel free to join me with your scope or binos 
 or visit or just wave driving by. I'll post an update early Saturdy confir
 ming or canceling based on the weather.\n\nFred 
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
