DESCRIPTION:cqtqjn0cdn6ruis5k81gn1q54k@google.com\nMars Telecon on March 26
 th: You might win a Mars Atlas!\n   \nWhile she is briefly back on Earth T
 ime at the end of March\, Dr. Aileen Yingst\, senior research scientist\, 
 will update us with the latest from the Mars Curiosity Rover. \n\nMark you
 r calendar for this exclusive Night Sky Network Telecon and join us:\nTues
 day\, March 26th at 6:00 pm PDT (9:00 pm EDT)\,\nNSN Club members are invi
 ted to join the live telecon by calling the toll-free line:\n1-888-455-923
 6\nCall up to 15 minutes before the telecon begins. An operator will answe
 r and:\n- You will be asked for the passcode: NIGHT SKY NETWORK\n- You wil
 l be asked to give your NAME and the CLUB you belong to\, and number of pe
 ople listening with you.\n \nPowerPoint slides will be available here by M
 arch 15th.
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
