  University.  We will be holding a special screening of the documentary\, 
 “UNDAUNTED:  The Forgotten Giants of the Allegheny Observatory” hosted
  by director\, producer\, and writer\, Dr. Dan Handley of Science Media LL
 C. \nPlease note the agenda change: \nSocial Hour    5:00PM \nDinner    6:
 00PM \nBusiness Meeting     7:15PM \nFilm Showing      7:30PM \n**All agen
 da items occurr in the Power Center Ballroom. The deadline for dinner rese
 rvations is Monday\, October 8\, 2012.  Online reservations http://pittcon
 .org/ssp-dinner-rsvp/ or call 412-825-3220 ext. 212.   A map indicating th
 e location of the ballroom at Duquesne University is at http://www.duq.edu
 /about/campus/map-and-directions .   \nKind regards\, \nSSP www-ssp-pgh.or
 g 
LOCATION:None
