BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mingo SP
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20110806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20110806
DTSTAMP:20260224T194040Z
UID:b3121ed2-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:qp1svfpeb6m55t2td0hgaeuta4@google.com\n<p>Having a Vesta Fiesta
 ?\nNASA's Dawn spacecraft is closing in on the asteroid Vesta. On August 6
 th\, Vesta is in opposition so your star party event can take advantage of
  the view. \n\nAny of your Public Night Sky Network Calendar events schedu
 led for August 5\, 6\, and 7 will also be featured on Dawn's Vesta Fiesta 
 map under "Attend an Event"\nhttp://dawn.jpl.nasa.gov/news/vesta_fiesta.as
 p\n\nJoin the celebration and tune into Bill Nye and Mission Scientists Li
 ve on <b>Streaming Video: \nhttp://dawn.jpl.nasa.gov/news/vesta_fiesta_daw
 n_ps.asp</b></p><p>2011 Mingo Public Star Parties April 8&9 May 6&7 June 3
