BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wagman Star Party
DTSTART:20240713T010000Z
DTEND:20240713T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194041Z
UID:b3c0f6fa-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:1i5fmmo9ujd7anufov0ivi9l39@google.com\nCome join the Amateur As
 tronomers Association of Pittsburgh for a night of looking at the stars th
 rough either the observatory&#39\;s Brashear 11&quot\; refractor telescope
  or the 21&quot\; Manka Memorial reflector telescope.  Visitors of all ag
 es are welcome to tour the observatory\, view the stars on the observatory
