BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Butler Outdoor Club Extravaganza
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20110527
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20110527
DTSTAMP:20260224T194041Z
UID:b40a00de-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:0idnkkto27h66uanvojsh76e4g@google.com\n<p>Butler Outdoor Club E
 xtravaganza(Weekend Event requesting AAAP members assistance</p>\n\n<p>Pos
 ted January 12\, 2011 - Check with <a href="http://www.butleroutdoorclub.o
 rg/">Butler Outdoor Club</a> \, http://www.butleroutdoorclub.org/ for more
  info.</p>\n\n<p>AAAP members interested in organizing/volunteering in a s
 tar party please contact Bill M.  Find their emails in the the AAAPgh Yaho
 o User Group archive of Jan. 12\, 2011..</p>\n\n\n<p>The Butler Outdoor Cl
 ub Extravaganza is held over Memorial Day at the Breakneck Campground at C
 heesman Farms (http://breakneckcampground.com/).\nThere is a large\, open 
 area near the barn that would be good for observing. The Campground is at 
 the end of Cheeseman Road\, off Rt. 19 in Portersville. I-79 to Portersvil
 le/Prospect Exit. Turn left onto Rt. 488. Go 0.5 miles. Turn right onto Rt
 . 19N. Go less than 1 mile\, turn left onto Cheeseman Road. Campground on 
 left after barn. The campground borders McConnell's Mill State Park\, but 
 is a privately owned farm..</p>\n\n\n<p>Anyone interested in volunteering 
 for a star party or astronomy talk :\nAAAP members interested in organizin
 g/volunteering in a star party during Butler Outdoor Club Extravaganz plea
 se contact Bill and Maureen M.\,.  Find their emails in the the AAAPgh Yah
 oo User Group archive of Jan. 12\, 2011..</p>\n\n\n<p>Even a tentative com
 mitment would be greatly appreciated..</p>\n\n\n
LOCATION:Campground at Cheesman Farms
END:VEVENT
