BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Telecon:LADEE
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20111117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20111117
DTSTAMP:20260224T194043Z
UID:b52893ae-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:vg8vn71u84m20v3e8qdovk7gos@google.com\nTelecon: Brian Day and t
 he LADEE Mission \nOn Thursday\, November 17\, 2011\, Brian Day will prese
 nt the LADEE Mission and Lunar Citizen Science program. \nLunar Atmosphere
  and Dust Environment Explorer (LADEE) is a NASA mission that will orbit t
 he Moon and its main objective is to characterize the atmosphere and lunar
  dust environment. \n\nThe Big Questions for LADEE are: How did the solar 
 system evolve to its current diverse state? \nand \nHow did the sun's fami
 ly of planets and minor bodies originate? \n \nDate: Thursday\, 11/17/2011
   \nTime: 9:00 PM - 10:00 PM  \n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
