UID:b68c10c2-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:h35iaqunkoj3duu7mcm5s2quhk@google.com\nBest guess for Neptune D
 ate of discovery is September 23\, 1846.As the first direct observation of
  the blue-green gas giant was made on Sept. 23\, 1846\, Neptune will arriv
 e back in approximately the same spot as where it was first spotted on Jul
 y 12\, 2011.
LOCATION:None
