BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CANCELLEDAudobon/Telescopes
DTSTART:20131008T000000Z
DTEND:20131008T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194046Z
UID:b6be40a6-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:a52ipfvnqg24l0b92lhtapc5tc@google.com\nRyan Stauffer from the A
 udubon Society is cancelling tonight's night\nhike and star party at the S
 uccop Conservancy in Butler due to lack of\nregistered participants.\n\n\n
 ----------------\nWe used to have folks from Amateur Astronomers come out 
 for our programs in years past\, but I think a long series of very cloudy 
 nights caused those to trail off. \n\nWe would love to rekindle that relat
 ionship with you. We are having a night hike/star gazing program on Octobe
 r 7th at our Succop Conservancy in Butler\, and October 8th at our Beechwo
 od Farms location in Fox Chapel.  Both programs are from 8-10 pm. Our idea
  was to have a hike led by our naturalists\, and also allow time for folks
  to do some star gazing\, and learn more about the night sky. \n\nAAAPers 
 please contact Gabi:\n\nGabi Hughes | Environmental Educator\n\nAudubon So
 ciety of Western Pennsylvania\n\n614 Dorseyville Road\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15
 238\n\n412-963-6100 x21  | aswp.org\n\n \n\n\n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
