BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:GAN Telecon 9P
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20110120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20110120
DTSTAMP:20260224T194046Z
UID:b6f2e0d6-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:6injtqromkmutm5nsl6uqqj0d0@google.com\nGAN Telecon 9P\n2011 GLO
 BE at Night Telecon January 20th and the Dark Skies Ranger Program\n\nOne-
 third of outdoor lighting escapes unused into space. Such over-illuminatio
 n incurs substantial costs\, has consequences to energy consumption\, huma
 n health and the habits and habitats of wildlife. \n  \nJoin us on January
  20th\, 6 pm Pacific (9 pm Eastern) when Dr. Connie Walker of the National
  Optical Astronomy Observatory discusses ways you can interest others in y
 our community to seek local solutions to the global problem of light pollu
 tion. http://spie.org/x42167.xml?highlight=x2408&ArticleID=x42167\n\nTo jo
 in the Night Sky Network Teleconference on Thursday\, January 20th at 9:00
  pm Eastern Standard Time simply call the toll-free conference line: 1-888
 -455-9236 \nCall anytime after 5:45 pm Pacific the evening of the telecon.
  An operator will answer and:\n- You will be asked for the passcode: NIGHT
  SKY NETWORK \n- You will be asked to give your NAME and the CLUB name\, A
 mateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh\, and number of people listen
 ing with you. \n\nA PowerPoint to accompany the teleconference will be ava
 ilable by January 19th for you to download or view online.  Link to it on 
 the Night Sky Network Featured News (Accessible after you log into Night S
 ky Network).  \n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
