BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Earth Hour8:30PM
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20090328
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20090328
DTSTAMP:20260224T194046Z
UID:b7028608-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:9veu1e4d7idb4h097dfk3mtp50@google.com\nEarth Hour is upon us \n
 \nYour light switch is your vote on March 28. Turn off the lights from 8:3
 0 p.m. until 9:30 p.m. and you’ll be “voting” for the earth in the f
 ight against global warming. A whopping 370 cities in 35 countries partici
 pated in Earth Hour in 2008 and already 680 cities and 77 countries have c
 ommitted for 2009. The goal is to have one billion people flip the switch 
 in 1\,000 cities worldwide. Will you be one in a billion? Learn more at ww
 w.earthhour.org. \n\nKD \n\n\n\n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
