BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jazz
DTSTART:20120805T160100Z
DTEND:20120805T170100Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194047Z
UID:b75661d8-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:h5bd5b3l36ko9u9hnqb9h22th0@google.com\nWashington County Wine\,
  Jazz and Pops Festival Returns August 4-5\, 2012.\n\n\n\nThe Washington W
 ine Jazz and Pops festival is a joint fundraiser for the Washington Sympho
 ny Orchestra and the Mental Health Association.\n\n\n\nBigger and Better t
 han Ever in 2012! \n\nWashington County Wine\, Jazz and Pops Festival\nAug
 ust 4-5\, 2012\n\n\n"A great success!" . . "Something new and different fo
 r Washington County--fantastic wine\, food and sound" . . . "Can we have t
 he same location next year?" . . . "This is impressive--the first wine fes
 tival I have been to with a full orchestra!" \n\nThese are only a few of t
 he wonderful comments and compliments the organizers of the First Annual W
 ashington Wine Jazz and Pops Festival received. The festival provided deli
 cious food\, a variety of wines to suit all palates\, handmade jewelry and
  exciting entertainment. \n\nWe're sure that you'll find this year's Wine 
 Jazz and Pops Festival\, held the first weekend in August at Mingo Creek C
 ounty Park in Washington County\, PA\, even more entertaining and enjoyabl
 e than last year's event! Once again\, we're bringing you the finest in Ja
 zz and Pops music\, together with wonderful wine samplings from regional w
 ineries\, and delicious food selections from premier area restaurants. Thi
 s year\, we've also expanded our offerings from local craft merchants who 
 will be offering high-quality items for sale throughout the festival.\n\nT
 he Washington Wine Jazz and Pops festival is a joint fundraiser for the Wa
 shington Symphony Orchestra and the Mental Health Association.\n\nPlease b
 rowse our website to learn more about this year's festival. We've also pos
 ted some photos of last year's event here.\n\nTHE FESTIVAL WILL BE HELD RA
 IN OR SHINE!\nContact us: winejazzpops@washsym.org\n\n\n\n\n\nWashington W
 ine\, Jazz & Pops Festival\nSaturday\, Aug 4 12:00p to 7:00p\natMingo Cree
 k Park - Washington County\,Finleyville\,PA\nThe Washington Wine\, Jazz & 
 Pops Festival features a day of jazz and wine-tasting\, and a day of pops 
 and wine-tastings. Plus great food vendors and fun for all. Great music\, 
 good wine\, and a variety of foods to make a unique summer festival in Was
 hington County - Mingo Creek Park!\n\nPrice: $20 per person in advance or 
 $25 per person at the gate\nPhone: (724) 225-2061\nAge Suitability:None Sp
 ecified\nTags:music\, jazz\, festival\, wine-tasting\, pops\nThe Washingto
 n Wine\, Jazz & Pops Festival features a day of jazz and wine-tasting\, an
 d a day of pops and wine-tastings. Plus great food vendors and fun for all
 . Great music\, good wine\, and a variety of foods to make a unique summer
  festival in Washington County - Mingo Creek Park!\n\nEvent Website\nCateg
 ories:Music\, Wine\nCreator: Washington Symphony Orchestra\nCreator: Washi
 ngton Symphony Orchestra
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
