DESCRIPTION:omkj1vnkom955hkbh0mk68ns3g@google.com\nThe Planets\nOrchestral 
 Concert\n\nhttp://www.pittsburghsymphony.org/pghsymph.nsf/concert+listings
 /56888DA088A0ECA385257546004E5060?opendocument\n\n"Composer Gustav Holst w
 as fascinated by astrology. The Planets is as much about the astrological 
 gods as it is about the physical planets. Come and enjoy displays about th
 is popular work from both the perspective of the scientific side as well a
 s the astrological deity side. There will be different stations around Hei
 nz Hall where audiences may learn more about the solar system\, have their
  tarot cards read and hear about recent scientific advancements\, such as 
 space travel!"\n\nThe Planets \nLocation: Heinz Hall \nFriday\, March 19\,
  2010 at 8:00 PM \nSaturday\, March 20\, 2010 at 8:00 PM \nSunday\, March 
 21\, 2010 at 2:30 PM \n\nKD 11/14/09\n \n \n
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
