BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Off-Site Town of McCandless
DTSTART:20260814T003000Z
DTEND:20260814T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194050Z
UID:b9310d96-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:4miil311u8ffc7g4plptidnsrb@google.com\nCome enjoy the night sky
  with members of the Amateur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh.  We&#
 39\;ll start the evening with a short\, astronomy themed presentation\, an
 d then attendees will be invited to look through member&#39\;s telescopes 
 and observe star clusters\, nebulae and even galaxies.\n\nDo you have a te
 lescope\, but aren&#39\;t sure how to use it?  Bring it along and one of 
 our members will answer questions and help you get it set up.\n\nThis is t
 he peak of the Perseid meteor shower\, so bring a blanket or chair\, sit b
 ack and look for shooting stars!
LOCATION:Wall Park\, Sloop Rd\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15237\, USA
END:VEVENT
