BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tom'sClass
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20110819
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20110819
DTSTAMP:20260224T194051Z
UID:b9a3471c-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:lhadjqm7t81u7jkkpf3pg77flg@google.com\nUpdate of Tues. 8/16\n\n
 \nJust a reminder about the sessions for this week at Wagman Obs.\n \nAug 
 18 and 19 (Thursday and Friday) starting around sunset\, weather permittin
 g.  If it's raining or mostly cloudy\, stay home or go out and support you
 r favorite bands and restaurants.\n \nI received four or five replies from
  members who plan to attend.  Let me know if you will be there.\n \nTom R\
 n\nStarHopClass\nI am planning several nights for some sessions for member
 s to come up to Wagman to learn some of my observing methods informal trai
 ning on the Manka scope.  These will depend on the weather and attendance.
 \nI will conduct Starhopping Classes in September and October\, also weath
 er permitting.  Here are the dates for the observing sessions and training
 :\n \nJuly 19 and 20 (Tuesday and Wednesday)\nAug 18 and 19 (Thursday and 
 Friday)\n \nStarhopping Classes\nSept 19 and 20\nOct 17 and 18\nMondays an
 d Tuesdays\n \nEmail me at this address if you plan to come to any of thes
 e programs.\n \nTom
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MDSP
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20101008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20101008
DTSTAMP:20260224T194051Z
UID:b9a8145e-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:m399vam1m20oq78tk5idkl0ffc@google.com\nMDSP\n\n \n\nHi all you 
 crazy star gazers\,\n\nJust a quick reminder that the Summer Mason Dixon S
 tar Party is July 9\,10 and 11th.  The Fall (no frills)  Mason Dixon Star 
 Party is October 8\,9 and 10th.  You are more than welcome to come early a
 nd stay late and just pay the camping fees for the extra days.  More info 
 is on the website at www.masondixonstarparty.org . If you would be so kind
  as to put this announcement on your website and/or newsletter\, we are al
 l to happy to do the same for you.  Just let me know.  Thanks in advance a
 nd keep looking up.\n\n>p>Cindy Tavares\nYCAS Secretary\n2007-2008-2009-20
 10 Mason Dixon Chairperson\nwww.ycas.orgwww.masondixonstarparty.org
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
