BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cub Scouts 7P
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20111020
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20111020
DTSTAMP:20260224T194053Z
UID:bb2976ce-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:q7tcqvjq57ok86th6d0fo7bkf8@google.com\n\n3PM Update:\n\nI calle
 d the leader of the scout group scheduled for Thursday to tell them that t
 here's little or no chance that we'll be able to conduct their SP.  Unless
  a miracle clearing moves in\, just stay home and watch the hockey game or
  World Series.  Aside from the public star parties and June through August
 \, the observing conditions this year have been awful.  We're paying the p
 rice for the past three or four years now.\n \nTomToni from Arnold contact
 ed me about a private star party for their cub scouts sometime in November
 .  Because we do not conduct SPs after Oct 30 at Wagman Obs and we will be
  sending out the mirrors and working on other improvements at that time\, 
 I suggested they try a date in October.  We worked it out and even set up 
 a possible rain date.  It was so nice to be able to work something so easi
 ly for all parties and she was very satisfied with the arrangements.\nThe 
 date is Thursday\, Oct 13 starting at 7 PM with Oct 20 as the rain date. \
 n \nTom\n\nKD 10/19/2011
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
