 \, January 29th at 6:00 pm PDT (9:00 pm EDT)\,\nNSN Club members call the 
 toll-free line:\n1-888-455-9236\nCall up to 15 minutes before the telecon 
 begins. An operator will answer and:\n- You will be asked for the passcode
 : NIGHT SKY NETWORK\n- Give your NAME and CLUB name\, AMATEUR ASTRONOMERS 
 ASSOCIATION OF PITTSBURGH\, and # of listeners.\n\nPowerPoint slides will 
 be available for download by January 16th here:\nhttp://nightsky.jpl.nasa.
 gov/download-view.cfm?Doc_ID=507
