DESCRIPTION:7n3m6mafuhlm46u9irrkiam6j7@google.com\nJoin 3AP members for an 
 astronomy presentation followed by a night of observing through member's t
 elescopes!  It will be at the model airplane field as before.  This is on
  top of a hill with clear viewing in all directions. (Directions below). T
 here will be a young moon early and Saturn and Jupiter will be high in the
  sky.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------
 --------------------------------------\nDirections to Hillman SP's Radio C
 ontrol Airport/Airfield\n\nFrom the North (Beaver)\n\nTake PA-18 south\nTu
 rn Left at Light in Florence onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles on\
 nSteubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul Road\
 n(Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Road) Continu
 e\n0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillman State P
 ark's\nModel Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top of hill.\n\n**
 Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for\nR
 adio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park's Model Airfield.\n\
 nFrom the South (Burgettstown and Washington)\n\nTake PA-18 north\nTurn Ri
 ght at Light in Florence onto Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles\non Ste
 ubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul\nRoad (Gr
 avel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Gravel Road)\nContinue 0
 .7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of Hillman\nState Park
 's Model Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top of hill.\n\n**Plea
 se note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow signage for\nRadio
  Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park's Model Airfield.\n\nFro
 m East (Pittsburgh)\n\nTake US-22 West\nTake the PA-18 exit for Florence/B
 urgettstown Turn Left at Light onto\nPA-18 North Turn Right at Light onto 
 Steubenville Pike Continue 1.5 miles\non Steubenville Pike Turn Left on Ha
 ul Road Continue 1.7 miles on Haul\nRoad (Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Ri
 ght on Kramer Road (Gravel Road)\nContinue 0.7 miles on Kramer Road and tu
 rn left into entrance of Hillman\nState Park's Model Airfield Follow grave
 l road to airfield at top of hill.\n\n**Please note that once you enter Hi
 llman State Park\, follow signage for\nRadio Control Model Airport to find
  Hillman State Park's Model Airfield.\n\nFrom West (Weirton and Steubenvil
 le)\n\nTake US-22 East\nTake the PA-18 exit for Florence/Burgettstown Turn
  Left onto PA-18 North\nTurn Right at Light onto Steubenville Pike Continu
 e 1.5 miles on\nSteubenville Pike Turn Left on Haul Road Continue 1.7 mile
 s on Haul Road\n(Gravel and Asphalt Road) Turn Right on Kramer Road (Grave
 l Road) Continue\n0.7 miles on Kramer Road and turn left into entrance of 
 Hillman State Park's\nModel Airfield Follow gravel road to airfield at top
  of hill.\n\n**Please note that once you enter Hillman State Park\, follow
  signage for\nRadio Control Model Airport to find Hillman State Park's Mod
 el Airfield.
LOCATION:Hillman State Park\, Burgettstown\, PA 15021\, USA - Radio Control
  Airfield
