BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SP-Marshall Twp. Park
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20090718
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20090718
DTSTAMP:20260224T194055Z
UID:bc89794c-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:24k8p07hp5nah5qfotqhutou2g@google.com\nSee Bill or List\, Dec. 
 15\, 2008\, for more info.\nVolunteer members of The Amateur Astronomers A
 ssociation of Pittsburgh and The Kiski \nAstronomy Group invite the public
  to a free Star Party at Marshall Twp park July 18\, 2009 \nwith a rain da
 te July 19\, 2009\, 8:30 p.m. to 12:00 a.m. There will be a short PowerPoi
 nt \nintroduction to the night sky followed by questions from the public a
 nd viewing the heavens \nthrough various telescopes. All ages welcome. The
  public must not smoke within 100 feet of \nany telescope. Please\, no whi
 te flashlights\; however\, red flashlights are OK (White light ruins \none
 's night vision). Hopefully\, all the park's overhead lights will be turne
 d off during the \nevent. \n
LOCATION:Marshall Twp Park 
END:VEVENT
