DTEND:20110819T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260224T194056Z
UID:bc918c72-11b8-11f1-ab09-766b39882e0f
DESCRIPTION:snpp1pi624k3bjeqf901e9kf7c@google.com\nTelecons for your calend
 ar    \nIn celebration with the release of our latest ToolKit\, Life in th
 e Universe:\nAre We Alone?\, the NSN is pleased to engage you with Dr. Dav
 id Morrison\, presenting his passion for astrobiology. Dr. Morrison is the
  senior scientist at the NASA Astrobiology Institute\, NASA Ames Research 
 Center at Moffett Field in California:  http://nightsky.jpl.nasa.gov/club/
 news-display.cfm?News_ID=430\n\nTo log into the Telecon on Thursday\, July
  28th between 5:45 - 6:00pm (Pacific Time):\nUse the toll-free conference 
 call line: 1-888-455-9236\nAn operator will answer and:\n            • Y
 ou will be asked for the passcode: NIGHT SKY NETWORK\n            • You 
 will be asked to give your NAME and the CLUB you belong to\, and number of
  people listening with you.\n\nFind the PowerPoint and other download link
 s here soon:  http://nightsky.jpl.nasa.gov/download-view.cfm?Doc_ID=476\n\
 nNext upcoming telecons are:\nThursday\, August 18th: Brooke Hsu\, for bon
 us telecon on International Observe the Moon Night (InOMN)\nThursday\, Sep
 tember 22nd: Exploring the Dark Side of the Solar System with WISE featuri
 ng Dr. Ned Wright Thursday\, November 17th: Citizen Science and the LADEE 
 Mission with Brian Day
LOCATION:None
END:VEVENT
