 pace Out! Astronomy Weekend</a></p>\n\n<p>Fellow AAAPer's\,</p>Time to sav
 e the dates of Sat.-Sun. March 26-27 for Carnegie Science Center's annual<
 a href="www.carnegiesciencecenter.org/calendar/events_detail.php?eventID=2
 25\n"> Space Out! Astronomy Weekend</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The regulars know the p
 rogram. Newbies are encouraged to attend.</p><p>Talk about astronomy and A
 AAP. Demonstrate your telescope/binoculars to guests.>/p><p>Get to know ot
 her AAAP members.</p>\n\n\n<p>Enjoy the CSC Astronomy Weekend Program.</p>
 \n\n<p>Saturday special presentations include:\n\n<p>1 pm  Dr. Andrew Zent
 ner\, University of Pittsburgh</p>\n<p>2 pm  Dr. Christopher House\, Direc
 tor of Penn State Astrobiology Research Center\n         “Studying life 
 in extreme environments in preparation for the search for microbial life\n
