DESCRIPTION:372ae3m2k09lql84erqqnrnvuc@google.com\nTuesday\, August 25\, 20
 09 at 8:00pm\nNOVA: Monster of the Milky Way\nAstronomers are closing in o
 n the proof they've sought for years that one of the most destructive obje
