DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/queer-sports-party-march-14-2026-6714
 32\n 🎾 Play the field at QUEER SPORTS PARTY 🏒  We’re celebrating g
 ay love (and rivalry) with a dance party homage to queer sports cinema and
  TV.   We’ve partnered with Stonewall Sports for a night of nonstop danc
 ing\, themed drinks\, a photo area and MORE! We're donating proceeds of th
 e ticket sales and themed drinks to support queer athletics within the cit
 y of Pittsburgh.  Dance to music inspired by the soundtracks of CHALLENGER
 S\, HEATED RIVALRY\, and YELLOWJACKETS as well as queer club anthems.  Fea
 turing two stellar DJs….  -MARZ -TIZA  Bring your team\, your number one
  opponent\, or meet someone here!  Stonewall Sports – Pittsburgh is an L
 GBTQ & Ally not-for-profit adult sports league. Our primary goal is to cre
 ate an increasingly connected and diverse LGBTQ community by providing add
 itional spaces for people to meet and socialize: namely through organized 
 competition and associated social and fundraising events. 
