BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Garcia Project
DTSTART:20260516T000000Z
DTEND:20260516T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260303T160143Z
UID:45b841ce-171a-11f1-95f5-e61865c824ca
DESCRIPTION:https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/event/the-garcia-project-2/thu
 nderbird-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\n\nTHE GARCIA PROJECT:
  recreating full\, classic Jerry Garcia Band shows from 1976-1995Friday\,
  May 15\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, Pittsburgh\, PADo
 ors @ 7PMShow @ 8PMAGE RESTRICTION: 21+https://www.thegarciaproject.com/\n
 The Garcia Project – 2026 USA Tour\nCelebrating the music and spirit of 
 the classic Jerry Garcia Band\n \nFor over a decade\, The Garcia Project 
 has faithfully recreated full\, classic Jerry Garcia Band concert experien
 ces — capturing not just the songs\, but the feeling\, warmth\, and impr
 ovisational spirit that made those performances so deeply meaningful.\n \
 nMore than a concert\, this is an evening centered around healing tone\, m
 usical connection\, and community — where audiences gather to experience
  the timeless soul of Jerry Garcia Band music performed with authenticity\
 , reverence\, and joy.\n \nAs part of their 2026 USA Tour\, The Garcia Pr
 oject continues their mission of bringing these beloved performances back 
 to life\, recreating setlists spanning 1976–1995 with period-accurate ar
 rangements and instrumentation.\n \nFans across the country have embraced
  the project not simply as a tribute\, but as a shared musical experience 
 — one that invites listeners to reconnect with the music\, each other\, 
 and the moment.\n \n“They remind me of what it felt like to sing these 
 beautiful songs with Jerry Garcia.”\n— Jacklyn LaBranch\, Singer for T
 he Jerry Garcia Band 1982–1995\n \nCome experience the sound\, the feel
 ing\, and the community that continue to keep this music alive.\n \n\n\nF
 ans of Jerry Garcia Band\, Grateful Dead\, soulful improvisation\, and liv
 e musical journeys will feel right at home.\n\n\nTicket Tier Info:General 
 Admission Tickets – Standing Room Only\nThere are no additional entry 
 protocols at this time. Entry requirements are subject to change. By purch
 asing tickets to this event you agree to abide by entry requirements in ef
 fect at the time of the event. Check the venue website leading up to yo
 ur event for the latest protocols. Please visit https://thunderbirdmusicha
 ll.com/safety/ for more information on Covid-19 Safety. All sales are fin
 al.\n 
LOCATION:Thunderbird Music Hall
END:VEVENT
