 New York City and was featured at Just For Laughs in Montreal as a ‘New 
 Face.’ Geoffrey has opened for Dave Attell\, Mark Normand\, Dan Soder\, 
 Fortune Feimster\, Sam Morrill\, and Daniel Sloss among others. He headlin
 es comedy clubs nationwide\, and starting to sell out his shows! In 2021 h
 is debut album “Prodigal Little Bitch” went to #1 on iTunes.    Why'd 
 We Book It? Geoffrey just put out his special on Youtube\, which is 63 Min
 utes of Great Comedy. He has been all over my tiktok page since being on o
 ur stage last\, making me laugh at purple m&m's and thinking on what my fa
 vorite era of history is.   For Fans Of... John Mulaney\, Sam Morril\, Ror
 y Scovel   Extended Bio: Geoffrey also records the weekly “You’re An I
 diot” podcast with Alex Dragicevich. More recently\, Geoffrey has found 
 success growing his social media platforms with his unfiltered stand up cl
 ips\, and has a recorded an hour special!     Seating/Show Information: Li
