 eality Show by the UCBurgh Faculty & Friends!  We're not here to bore you 
 with a whole season of reality TV - we're skipping straight to the messies
 t part\; the Reunion Episode. Flashback to all the juciest moments of the 
 season\, hear from the hero's\, get the villians side of the story\, and w
 atch the host be as catty as possible - all inspired by suggestions from t
 he audience and brought to life on the spot by the finest improvisors at U
 CB Pittsburgh.  In honor of its 50th season\, join us for this SURVIVOR Ed
 ition and see a full seasons worth of Outwitting\, Outplaying\, and Outlas
 ting\, and Jeff Probst (and his puka shell) necklace telling us to DIG DEE
 P - all crammed into rough an hour of improv. In the end\; the tribe will 
 have spoken\, as YOU pick the Sole Survivor who takes home the prize of a 
 million dollars*  *one free drink\, probably  PLUS a special opening set b
 y more UCBurgh Faculty & Friends - performing the Harold! 
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
