DESCRIPTION:https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/event/varials/thunderbird-cafe
 -music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nThunderbird and Drusky Entertainme
 nt Present\nVARIALSwith UnityTX\, HEAVY//HITTER\, BOLTCUTTERTuesday April 
 7\, 2025Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, Pittsburgh\, PADoors @ 
 6pmShow @ 7pmALL AGES\nVarials channel hardcore intensity and nu-metal gro
 ove into something unapologetically human. Formed in Philadelphia\, the ba
 nd built its reputation on unflinching honesty across Pain Again\, In Dark
 ness\, and Scars for You to Remember.\n \nTheir fourth album\, WHERE THE 
 LIGHT LEAVES (Fearless Records\, 2025)\, marks a rebirth—four musicians 
 tearing everything down to rebuild stronger. Produced by Josh Schroeder (
 Lorna Shore\, Dayseeker)\, the record captures Varials at their most insti
 nctive and unfiltered. Imperfect takes\, emotional performances\, and new 
 melodic textures create a sound that’s both crushing and alive.\n \nOns
 tage\, the lineup (Skyler Conder\, Mike Foley\, Sean Rauchut\, and Shane L
 yons) continues to prove why Varials remain one of heavy music’s most ca
 thartic and commanding live acts.\n\n \nTicket Tier Info:General Admissio
 n Tickets – Standing Room Only\nThere are no additional entry protocol
 s at this time. Entry requirements are subject to change. By purchasing ti
 ckets to this event you agree to abide by entry requirements in effect at
  the time of the event. Check the venue website leading up to your event
  for the latest protocols. Please visit https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/s
 afety/ for more information on Covid-19 Safety. All sales are final. 
LOCATION:Thunderbird Music Hall
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TWIRL
DTSTART:20260405T010000Z
DTEND:20260405T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260309T210320Z
UID:671047f0-1bfb-11f1-b090-164c458b1e40
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/twirl-april-04-2026-679970\n  Your fa
 vorite dance party for house music in Pittsburgh is SOOO BACK. ✨  And th
 is time... TWIRL is bringing all of the drama and ferocity somewhere we ha
 ve never been before… BOTTLEROCKET! 🚀 I know. We’re excited too.   
 This fierce + retro inspired + kitschy venue located in Pittsburgh’s All
 entown neighborhood is THE perfect location for our cutesy lil house music
  function. 🪩  This is honestly a really special occasion for us. Theref
 ore\, we have no choice but to BRING IT with the lineup. 👏🏽  Joining
  us are TWO house music divas\, from TWO sates\, BOTH slaying the house do
 wn BEWTS in their cities:  🎧 Mark Holcomb (NYC) 🎧 b_x_r_n_x_r_d (DC)
  🎧 And of course\, the MUTHA of our house\, ROJO (PGH)  Tickets? Those 
 are available on Opendate. 🔗INK IN 🪶IO. 🎟️ Presale $10 🎟️ 
 Door $15  Send this to everyone you know. Scratch that. Send this to every
  cool person you know who brings good vibes to the function\, loves house 
 music and is BS free (a lil messy and a lil shady is okay I guess). See yo
 u on the floor 😉  🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️🤎🖤 Brought to you
  by Twirlville\, a QBIPOC run music + events collective\, TWIRL isn’t ju
 st a dance party. It’s a tribute to house music\, underground dance cult
 ure and its roots. Our function gives BIPOC\, LGBTQ+ individuals\, and all
 ies a sacred space for self expression\, freedom of movement\, and flamboy
 ance. NO hate 🚫 NO judgement 🚫 NO BS 🚫 on our dance floor.       
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
