BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MATTE BLVCK X HAUNT ME
DTSTART:20260504T000000Z
DTEND:20260504T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260310T150458Z
UID:813b110e-1c92-11f1-b090-164c458b1e40
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/matte-blvck-x-haunt-me/\nMatte Blvc
 k (or Matte Blvck) is a San Diego-based Darkwave/industrial trio formed by
  Alex Gonzales\, Bidi Cobra\, and Daniel Corrales. Emerging in 2020\, they
  deliver a cinematic\, mechanical-tinged sound featuring lush dark-synth\,
  gritty industrial anthems\, and techno influences.Haunt Me is a San Anton
 io\, Texas-based post-punk/darkwave trio formed in 2021 by vocalist/multi-
 instrumentalist Darius Davila. Known for a moody\, nostalgic sound blendin
 g indie-goth with shimmering guitars\, they have released albums like The 
 Sadness Never Ends and Watch You Bleed\, drawing influences from The Cure\
 , Interpol\, and Depeche Mode.This Event Is All AgesAll Sales Are Final.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dylan LeBlanc
DTSTART:20260613T000000Z
DTEND:20260613T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260310T150458Z
UID:81413b2e-1c92-11f1-b090-164c458b1e40
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/dylan-leblanc/\nDylan LeBlanc is a 
 singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist who often finds himself flirti
 ng with the edge — or “dancing on a razor\,” as he calls it — as i
 t is all he has ever known. A verdict vagabond since he was a little boy t
 ossed between Texas\, Louisiana and Alabama\, LeBlanc thrives on the preci
 pice\, never staying in one place for too long. It is that nomadic spirit 
 that drew him not only to a life as a touring musician\, but also to the b
 east that titles his newest record: ‘Coyote.’LeBlanc says he has alway
 s related to the insatiable\, scavenging nature of the wily coyote. Much l
 ike the animal\, LeBlanc is a wanderer who knows when to trust his instinc
 ts\, musically and otherwise. It is a spiritual kinship that runs deep\, b
 ut he credits one particularly hair-raising face-to-face instance with sol
 idifying his bond with the animal.This Event Is All AgesAll Sales Are Fina
 l.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
