 costs! \nTrombone Shorty is heading out on the North American roads once m
 ore\, keen and ready to light them up with musical lumens like you’ve ne
 ver or heard before! It’s a musical journey exploding with energy\; pump
 ing with the best mixture of jazz\, funk\, and soul\; oozing with musician
 ship that will drop jaws - and it’s coming to your neck of the woods! \n
 That’s right\, Pittsburgh\, Trombone Shorty & Orleans Avenue are coming 
 to the Stage AE on 24 June 2026 with their ‘Let’s Go Get ‘Em Tour’
  alongside special guest Dumpstaphunk! \nTickets are on sale now from as l
 ow as $67 and are selling at a crazy speed\, so click on the ‘Get Ticket
 s’ link to get your hands on yours now before they’re all sold-out in 
 proper Trombone Shorty style!
LOCATION:Stage AE
