BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:YouTubers: the Drag Show
DTSTART:20260411T003000Z
DTEND:20260411T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260321T020219Z
UID:fdf2718a-24c9-11f1-9e18-d2591aeff2e8
DESCRIPTION:5jk4ljtv102p64bdnfsn1k1hev@google.com\nEff N Odd Productions pr
 esents YouTubers: the Drag Show\n\nIt’s 2015. You come home from school 
 \, open your family laptop and type “YouTube.com” into the URL bar. Ju
 stin Biebers carpool karaoke is the top trending video.  You type “ Dan 
 and Phil” into the search bar. The first video suggestion is new\, “Ph
 il is not on fire 7” from YouTuber amazingphil. You click on the link. T
 he whiskering begins.\nDoes this feel familiar to you? Did your subscripti
 ons including markiplier and pewdiepie\, or is it j*ffery st*r music video
 s and Shane Dawson conspiracy videos from before… well\, yunno…. \nJoi
 n us while we celebrate and reminisce on all the cringiest things YouTube 
 has ever had to offer!\n\n$10 tickets in advance\n $15 at the door\n\nDoo
 r is at 8:30 \nShow at 9:30\n\nDrink special is Cancelled Cocktail
LOCATION:Harold's Haunt\, 142 Grant Ave\, Millvale\, PA 15209\, USA
END:VEVENT
