DTEND:20260408T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260321T020219Z
UID:fdf7b46a-24c9-11f1-9e18-d2591aeff2e8
DESCRIPTION:6oom6eb2clij8bb46crjcb9kckrmabb2ckrj4b9k6sqm6cr575h30e1ock@goog
 le.com\n🕊️✨ Postcards for Peace is a free\, drop-in event inspired 
 by #ProjectMailstorm.\n\nNo speeches\, no protests. Just pens\, postcards\
 , and quiet conviction.\n\n📮 We'll gather in community across the city 
 to craft handwritten postcards to government agencies\, calling for peace\
 , justice\, and people-first policies.\n\nI’ll bring:\n✍️ Postcards\
 , pens\, prompts\, stamps\nYou bring:\n💌 Your voice\, your truth\, your
  heart\n\nThe vibe is low-key & reflective. But your righteous anger is we
 lcome too. Grief\, rage\, hope — it all belongs here. 💔🔥
LOCATION:Harold's Haunt\, 142 Grant Ave\, Millvale\, PA 15209\, USA
END:VEVENT
