DTSTAMP:20260329T030412Z
UID:f675ac26-2b1b-11f1-acf4-6a63d21f6d0e
DESCRIPTION:https://www.poetrymillvale.com/event/stop-the-presses-the-write
 -up/\nStop the Presses is reggae\, steady\, ska from Brooklyn\, NY.   \
 nOriginally formed in 2010 by Ali Culotta and Danny Portilla\, Stop the Pr
 esses blends traditional ska and reggae with new wave\, pop\, and punk in
 fluences. The band\, which has a strong East Coast ska/reggae sound\, is 
 known for its 60s girl group influences and 4-part vocal harmonies.  \nTh
 ey gained international attention with their 2019 album\, “Money in the
  Bank” produced by Agent Jay of The Slackers\, and has since released t
 heir follow-up album ” Got It” in 2022 through Jump Up Records\, once 
 again produced by Agent Jay.  \nThey are delighted to have contributed to
  benefit albums such as “SKA CARES”\, and performed internationally 
 at the Supernova Ska Festival\, Victoria Ska & Reggae Festival\, Freedom S
 ounds Festival\, Pouzza Fest\, and Manchester Punk Festival.  \nFor more 
 info on their touring schedule\, please visit stopthepressesmusic.com. 
LOCATION:Poetry Lounge
END:VEVENT
