 ho was recently passed at the world- famous Comedy Cellar\, was named a Co
 mic To Watch at 2024s New York Comedy Festival\, and with his playful\, ab
 surd\, and hilarious sketches\, he has become a rising star on social medi
 a. He has opened for Eddie Pepitone\, Chris Gethard\, Matt Braunger\, Jord
 an Jenson\, Kal Penn\, and Kumail Nanjiani and has guested on the podcast 
 Mindful Metal Jacket w/ Joe List\, and You Know What Dude w/ Robert Kelly.
    Why'd We Book It? Keegan is an up and coming alternative sketch creator
  that has been on our feed for awhile. You have probably seen him and his 
 friends do hilariously obscure content all from the comfort of their apart
 ment. We are excited to see what he will be bringing to the stage - with h
 is straight face humor\, we just hope we can tell what is a joke and what 
 isnt!   For Fans Of... Veronika Slowikowska\, Zach Galifianakis\, Tim Robi
 nson    Seating/Show Information: This show will have theater seating. Sea
