 of J.R. Jones is the stage name of Jonathon Linaberry\, a New York-based r
 oots noir artist. Starting in punk bands\, he pivoted to a one-man band pr
 oject in 2012\, blending blues\, Americana\, and soul. Linaberry writes\, 
 records\, and performs everything himself\, crafting a "haunting stomp blu
 es" sound often featured in TV shows like Suits and Daredevil.This Event I
 s All AgesAll Sales Are Final.
