 g show!" said the O.C. Register.\n\n“The most unique tribute show in dec
 ades\,” said the L.A. Times.\n\n“The crowd was on their feet screaming
  the entire time!” said the Idaho Statesman.\n\n“If you missed The Bea
 tles and The Rolling Stones live\, here is your second chance\," said the 
