DTEND:20260523T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260409T150420Z
UID:6315aae0-3425-11f1-82f4-8e85771ff2ca
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/world-goth-day/\nWorld Goth Day is 
 observed annually on May 22nd to promote the goth subculture. Originating 
 in the UK in 2009\, this international day encourages people to express th
 eir "inner darkness.”This year’s celebration of Pittsburgh Goth featur
 es live performances by bands Take Me With You (post-punk / synthpop) and 
 MILLIE DREAD (cybergothic antipop)\, as well as dancing with DJs Erica Sca
 ry\, KellyA\, and Bedlamboy.The evening also includes a listening party fo
 r lowsunday’s The Black EP\; video projection of music videos from dark 
 Pittsburgh bands\; vending by Pittsburgh record labels Play Alone Records 
 and Distortion Productions\; a gothic fashion show\; and a dark art displa
 y.This Event Is All AgesAll Sales Are Final.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
