DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/bottlerocket-prom-dance-through-the-d
 ecades-may-09-2026-669183\n WE'RE THROWING IT BACK...TO MULTIPLE DECADES! 
 IT'S TIME FOR THE ANNUAL BOTTLEROCKET PROM!   Dust off those big ball gown
 s and pale blue tuxedos- it's time for a musical time warp that'll have yo
 u dancing through the decades!! Every hour we move forward another decade 
 with a new DJ\, playing nothing but prom night dance floor fillers.  Reliv
 e the best night of your high school years (or make up for the worst) - th
 ere's a spot to take awkward photos\, spiked punch that actually tastes go
 od\, and absolutely no parental supervision! The best dressed couples may 
 even find themselves on the illustrious Prom Court\, an honor so incredibl
 e it may end up being looked upon as a peak of your life several years lat
 er when you contemplate where it all went wrong. But that's for later you 
 to worry about - for now just focus on the MOST IMPORTANT NIGHT OF YOUR LI
 FE! PROM!  There's something for everybody\, and fun for all!  Prom and Ho
 mecoming have always sold out\, so get your tickets in advance!  DJ LINEUP
 :  8-9pm / 60s w/ DJ Easy Ed  9-10pm / 70s w/ DJ MB  10-11pm / 80s w/ DJ R
 ODEO STARR  11-12am / 90s w/ MARZ  12-1am / 00s w/ DISCONAP 
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
