DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/eric-roberson-improv-sessi
 ons-d095vv\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Eric Roberson Improv Sessions 
 live on Thursday\, April 16th\, at 7:30 PM!Experience the brilliance of GR
 AMMY-nominated artist Eric Roberson in a captivating new format — an imp
 rov show that blurs the lines between concert\, theater\, and creative con
 versations.In Eric Roberson - The Improv Sessions\, Eric takes the audienc
 e inside his creative universe through live improvisations\, unrehearsed f
 reestyles\, and soulful performances of both new and classic songs. Betwee
 n melodies\, he’ll share readings from his forthcoming book Beautifully 
 All Over The Place\, revealing the stories and lessons that shaped his art
 istry and life.With special guests joining along the way\, each night prom
 ises to be unique — a living\, breathing expression of “The Process”
  that fans have come to love.Part concert\, part conversation\, and comple
 tely authentic — this is Eric Roberson\, beautifully all over the place.
