DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/jake-shimabukuro-xjszx0\nC
 ity Winery Pittsburgh presents Jake Shimabukuro live on Thursday\, April 2
 3rd\, at 7:30 PM!\n\nInternationally celebrated as one of the most innovat
 ive musicians of his generation\, Jake Shimabukuro has redefined the ukule
 le for the modern era with breathtaking technique\, fearless creativity\, 
 and deeply expressive performances. Often described as the “Jimi Hendrix
  of the ukulele\,” his music fluidly blends jazz\, rock\, classical\, bl
 ues\, folk\, and traditional Hawaiian influences into a sound that feels b
 oth adventurous and emotionally resonant.Born and raised in Honolulu\, Jak
 e began playing at just four years old\, quickly developing a style that p
 ushed far beyond the instrument’s traditional role. His career reached a
  global audience after his stunning rendition of George Harrison’s “Wh
 ile My Guitar Gently Weeps” went viral\, introducing millions to the uku
 lele’s boundless possibilities. Since then\, he has released numerous ac
 claimed albums\, collaborated with legendary artists\, and performed at ic
 onic venues around the world.Whether delivering a solo performance or shar
 ing stories between songs\, Shimabukuro creates an atmosphere that is inti
 mate\, joyful\, and inspiring. Join us at City Winery Pittsburgh for a nig
 ht of virtuosic musicianship\, heartfelt storytelling\, and unforgettable 
 sound\, all paired with exceptional wine and dining. Reserve your seats no
 w for a truly special live music experience.Dine At Your Show(opens in a n
 ew tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service directly to your tabl
 e in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relaxed experience\, ar
