DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/stick-men-7tsu8u\nCity Win
 ery Pittsburgh presents Stick Men live on Tuesday\, April 28th\, at 7:30 P
 M(opens in a new tab)!\n\nStick Men is coming to City Winery Pittsburgh\, 
 bringing an electrifying night of progressive rock led by three legendary 
 musicians whose collective careers have shaped modern music.This powerhous
 e trio features Tony Levin\, Pat Mastelotto\, and Markus Reuter\, artists 
 whose combined work has contributed to more than 100 million records sold 
 worldwide. Their sound is bold\, experimental\, and deeply immersive\, ble
 nding progressive rock\, art rock\, and forward thinking improvisation int
 o something truly unique.Tony Levin\, known for his iconic work with Peter
  Gabriel and King Crimson\, is among the most recorded bass players in mus
 ic history. Using the Chapman Stick\, he seamlessly covers bass and guitar
  parts at the same time. Drummer Pat Mastelotto\, also of King Crimson fam
 e and chart topping success with Mr. Mister\, fuses acoustic drums with el
 ectronic elements to create richly layered rhythms. Completing the trio\, 
 Markus Reuter performs on his custom touch style guitar\, pushing the boun
 daries of what a stringed instrument can do.Stick Men’s live shows are a
 dventurous and unpredictable\, featuring extended jams\, jaw dropping musi
 cianship\, and select nods to their King Crimson roots. Join us at City Wi
 nery Pittsburgh for an unforgettable evening of live music\, wine\, and di
 ning in our intimate setting. Secure your seats now for a night that progr
 essive rock fans will be talking about long after the final note.Dine At Y
 our Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service 
