DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/nurses-night-out-0hl7of\nC
 ity Winery Pittsburgh presents  Nurse's Night Out live on Monday\, May 4th
 \, at 7:30 PM!\nArmy Veteran and Neonatal ICU Nurse Greg “G” Williams 
 has been saving lives since 1998 and delivering punchlines since 2007. A n
 ationally headlining comic\, Greg created Nurse’s Night Out in 2013 as a
  comedy tour dedicated to the everyday heroes of the medical field. What s
 tarted in San Jose has grown into a worldwide celebration of healthcare pr
 ofessionals\, blending sharp storytelling with high-energy stand-up that r
 esonates far beyond the hospital halls.Greg’s unique perspective\, shape
 d by years on the front lines of both the military and the NICU\, fuels a 
 performance that is heartfelt\, relatable\, and outrageously funny. He has
  shared the stage with comedy standouts like Bruce-Bruce\, Brad Williams\,
  Vir Das\, Sammy Obied\, and Taylor Tomlinson\, proving he can hold his ow
 n with the best in the business.Whether you work in scrubs or just appreci
 ate a great night of laughter\, this is your prescription for fun. Join us
  at City Winery Pittsburgh for an unforgettable evening of comedy\, wine\,
  and dining. Grab your seats now and let laughter be the best medicine.Din
