BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AJ Ghent and His Singing Guitar
DTSTART:20260509T230000Z
DTEND:20260510T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260412T180150Z
UID:ae1573e2-3699-11f1-887f-fef293e589ee
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/aj-ghent-and-his-singing-g
 uitar-kn8hxd\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents AJ Ghent and His Singing Gui
 tar live on Saturday\, May 9th\, at 7:00PM!Viral influencer\, singer\, son
 gwriter\, and sonic innovator AJ Ghent is captivating audiences nationwide
  with his live performances\, showcasing the therapeutic power of his “S
 inging Guitar.” By creating soundscapes that deeply resonate with listen
 ers\, Ghent is redefining the concert experience\, transforming each show 
 into an immersive\, healing journey. Known for his visionary approach\, AJ
  Ghent blends rhythmic patterns with soulful melodies to pioneer his uniqu
 e “Singing Guitar” style\, a sound where every note feels alive\, expr
 essive\, and emotionally charged. With viral hits like “Singing Guitar V
 ibes\,” “Let the Guitar Sing\,” and “Peace of Mind\,” he demonst
 rates the emotional power of sound\, reaching millions through viral video
 s on TikTok and Instagram.His artistry has also been recognized in Starbuc
 ks’ national campaign and on the official Game of Thrones Spotify playli
 st. AJ’s live performances are celebrated for their emotional depth and 
 transformative energy\, making his concerts a must see. His “Singing Gui
 tar” goes beyond being just an instrument\, it becomes a tool for connec
 tion and healing\, delivering a revitalizing sonic journey infused with ra
 w emotion and dynamic energy. With multiple sold out shows\, Ghent’s tou
 r has garnered widespread acclaim for its profound emotional impact. Audie
 nces often describe his performances as spiritual\, offering comfort and j
 oy through his music. Each AJ Ghent show is more than a performance\, it
 ’s a deeply transformative experience that leaves a lasting impression l
