UID:ae37915c-3699-11f1-887f-fef293e589ee
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/stephen-lynch-the-me-tour-
 tlt51q\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Stephen Lynch: The Me Tour live on
  Saturday\, May 16th\, at 7:30 PM!\n\nStephen Lynch is coming to City Wine
 ry Pittsburgh for a night of razor-sharp wit\, outrageous songs\, and laug
 h-out-loud musical comedy.A self-described “musician trapped in the body
  of a comedian\,” Stephen Lynch has built a career on blending smart son
 gwriting with fearless humor. Whether he is skewering modern relationships
 \, poking fun at lifestyle changes\, or delivering hilariously inappropria
 te ballads\, Lynch’s performances are equal parts stand-up comedy and li
 ve concert. His unique approach has earned him fiercely loyal fans\, sold-
 out shows around the world\, six best-selling albums\, a Gold-certified DV
 D\, and multiple top-rated Comedy Central specials.After moving to New Yor
 k in the late 1990s\, Lynch quickly rose from underground clubs to nationa
 l recognition\, recording one of Comedy Central’s highest-rated specials
  for a then-unknown performer. His talents also carried him to Broadway\, 
 where his starring role in The Wedding Singer earned nominations from the 
 Drama League\, Drama Desk\, and the Tony Awards.With hundreds of thousands
  of albums sold and tours spanning the US\, Australia\, and Europe\, Steph
 en Lynch continues to prove that clever songwriting and fearless comedy ar
 e a powerful combination. Join us at City Winery Pittsburgh for an unforge
 ttable evening of live music\, bold laughs\, and great wine in an intimate
  setting. Grab your seats now for a night that is guaranteed to be wildly 
 entertaining.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food
  and beverage service directly to your table in the venue. Or\, for an exp
 anded menu and more relaxed experience\, arrive early and enjoy a meal in 
 our restaurant before the show. When dining in the restaurant\, reservatio
 ns are encouraged and can be made via Resy starting one month before the s
 how. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens in a new tab)Wine At Your Table(o
