UID:ae430b7c-3699-11f1-887f-fef293e589ee
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/corinne-stories-in-pink-fm
 nrjw\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Corinne: Stories in Pink live on Wed
 nesday\, May 20th\, at 7:30 PM(opens in a new tab)!Corinne performs sophis
 ticated pop music with jazz DNA. Cinematic\, timeless\, and unapologetical
 ly romantic\, her sound moves from bossa rhythms to lush ballads with hook
 s built to last.Rooted in '60s and '70s songcraft but written for now\, Co
 rinne’s music is equally elegant\, edgy\, and glamorous.After releasing 
 three critically acclaimed jazz albums and earning praise from All About J
 azz as “sheer genius\,” Corinne began expanding her sound beyond jazz.
  She partnered with songwriter/producer and music industry executive\, Eri
 c Todd\, forming a modern composer–vocalist collaboration.The result is 
 Stories in Pink\, a concept album about romance - nine immersive songs tra
 cing the intoxicating turns of love. Lushly orchestrated and cinematically
  imagined\, the album reflects a commitment to songs written to stand the 
 test of time.Described as a “master of coquettish storytelling” (JW Vi
 be)\, Corinne performs Stories in Pink live with a world-class band. Dress
  to the nines. Pink is encouraged\, and everyone can be part of the experi
 ence. Part concert\, part night out\, all vibe.Corinne has headlined stage
 s from Birdland to City Winery\, Jazz Forum\, and Gregory’s in Rome. She
  has shared bills with Casey Abrams\, Haley Reinhart\, Cyrille Aimée\, St
 acey Kent\, Peter Noone\, and Emmet Cohen\, and has become a seasonal stap
 le on Sirius XM’s Real Jazz Holiday channel.Born and raised in the Phill
 y suburbs\, Corinne is now based in New York City.Sophisticated yet playfu
 l\, romantic yet modern\, Corinne is reclaiming classic pop craft for a ne
 w generation.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food
