DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/josie-sal-4ji3kj\nCity Win
 ery Pittsburgh presents Josie Sal: Backroads & Ballads Tour live on Sunday
 \, May 24th\, at 7:30 PM(opens in a new tab)!Josie Sal brings her Backroad
 s & Ballads Tour to City Winery Pittsburgh for special acoustic night of s
 ongs and storytelling.  Blending heartfelt originals with the stories behi
 nd them\, the show offers fans an up-close look at Josie Sal’s songwriti
 ng and musical journey.Joined by Nashville songwriter Kelli Johnson on gui
 tar and harmony\, the evening highlights Josie’s original music in an in
 timate setting designed for true music lovers. Josie Sal is a rising count
 ry artist with a voice\, presence\, and authenticity far beyond her years.
  Rooted in classic country storytelling and delivered with a fearless mode
 rn edge\, her music blends grit\, heart\, and honesty — staying true to 
 the genre while speaking to a new generation of fans.Raised on the sounds 
 of country legends that played through her grandfather’s home\, Josie le
 arned early that great country music is built on truth and storytelling. N
 ow based in Nashville\, she has released multiple original songs and surpa
 ssed 900\,000 total streams on Spotify\, quickly establishing herself as a
 n artist to watch. Her breakout track “Redneck Weekend” gained nationa
 l attention and was highlighted by American Songwriter\, while her momentu
 m was further solidified when Holler named her one of its Top 10 Artists t
 o Watch.Josie’s live performances set her apart. She has supported and s
 hared the stage with nationally touring artists including Justin Moore\, M
 itchell Tenpenny\, Gavin Adcock\, Julia Cole\, and Tyler Rich\, and has pe
 rformed in front of crowds as large as 26\,000 people.At just 14 years old
 \, Josie Sal is not chasing a moment — she is building a lasting career 
 rooted in authenticity\, storytelling\, and undeniable talent.Dine At Your
  Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service dir
 ectly to your table in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relax
