DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/vicki-peterson-and-john-co
 wsill-with-special-gue-9djs3s\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Vicki Peter
 son and John Cowsill with Special Guest Jill's Jagoffs live on Tuesday\, J
 une 2nd\, at 7:30 PM(opens in a new tab)!Vicki Peterson & John Cowsill bri
 ng their rich musical legacies to City Winery Pittsburgh in support of the
 ir debut duo album\, Long After The Fire. Peterson\, a founding member of 
 The Bangles and the voice behind iconic hits like “Walk Like an Egyptian
 ” and “Eternal Flame\,” joins forces with Cowsill\, longtime drummer
  and vocalist for The Beach Boys and member of the famed family group\, Th
 e Cowsills.Together\, they deliver a heartfelt and harmonious live experie
 nce\, centered around songs written by John’s late brothers\, Barry and 
 Bill Cowsill. Blending polished pop\, Americana roots\, and decades of tou
 ring and recording experience\, the duo creates an intimate and deeply per
 sonal performance that honors both their histories and shared musical bond
 .With careers that include collaborations with legends like Bob Dylan\, To
 m Petty\, and Chuck Berry\, and appearances on stages and screens around t
 he world\, Peterson and Cowsill offer a rare chance to witness two accompl
 ished artists in a uniquely stripped-down setting.Join us for an unforgett
 able evening of storytelling\, harmony\, and exceptional musicianship\, pa
 ired with City Winery’s signature wine and dining experience. Secure you
 r seats now for this special night of music and connection.Dine At Your Sh
