BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Caligula Blushed: Smiths/Morrissey Tribute
DTSTART:20260603T233000Z
DTEND:20260604T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260412T180151Z
UID:ae7992be-3699-11f1-887f-fef293e589ee
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/caligula-blushed-smiths-mo
 rrissey-tribute-e71don\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Caligula Blushed: 
 Smiths/Morrissey Tribute live on Wednesday\, June 3rd\, at 7:30 PM!Caligul
 a Blushed brings the unmistakable sound and spirit of The Smiths and Morri
 ssey to life at City Winery Pittsburgh. Widely regarded as the most authen
 tic and only dedicated Smiths and Morrissey tribute touring the U.S. today
 \, this powerhouse group delivers a passionate\, faithful recreation of th
 e music that defined a generation.Fronted by Quinn\, who channels Morrisse
 y’s voice\, wit\, and iconic stage presence with uncanny precision\, the
  band is rounded out by guitarist Craig Gildner\, a true Johnny Marr devot
 ee\, along with a tight rhythm section that captures every shimmer\, jangl
 e\, and driving beat. Expect to hear beloved classics like “This Charmin
 g Man\,” “How Soon Is Now?\,” “Everyday Is Like Sunday\,” “Sue
 dehead\,” “Ask\,” “Bigmouth Strikes Again\,” and “First of the
  Gang to Die\,” plus fan-favorite deep cuts that true devotees will appr
 eciate.Praised as “absolutely phenomenal” and hailed as a magical expe
 rience for Smiths and Moz fans\, this is more than a tribute show\, it is 
 a visceral celebration of timeless music. Join us at City Winery Pittsburg
 h for an unforgettable evening of live music\, wine\, and dining. Secure y
 our seats now and relive the songs that still resonate.\nDine At Your Show
