 lo-and-luke-bergman-nk8nq7\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Bill Frisell w
 ith Tim Angulo and Luke Bergman live on Friday\, June 5th\, at 7:30 PM(ope
 ns in a new tab)!Bill Frisell celebrates an extraordinary milestone with a
  special 75th birthday tour\, bringing his unmistakable sound and visionar
 y artistry to the stage. With a career spanning more than four decades\, F
 risell has shaped the landscape of modern jazz and American music\, earnin
 g widespread acclaim and a catalog hailed by DownBeat as among the finest 
 of its era.This performance highlights music from his forthcoming Blue Not
 e release\, In My Dreams\, featuring a remarkable ensemble of longtime col
 laborators including Jenny Scheinman\, Eyvind Kang\, Hank Roberts\, Thomas
  Morgan\, and Rudy Royston. Together\, they present a deeply expressive pr
 ogram of original compositions and newly arranged works\, blending rich te
 xtures\, improvisation\, and emotional depth in a way only Frisell can.Joi
 ning the bill are acclaimed artists Luke Bergman and Timothy Angulo\, whos
 e dynamic musicianship adds even more dimension to an already compelling e
 vening.Join us in our intimate setting for a night of boundary-pushing mus
 ic\, exceptional artistry\, and inspired collaboration. Reserve your seats
