BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seasoned Dialogue with Lisa Marie Lovett
DTSTART:20260617T233000Z
DTEND:20260618T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260412T180151Z
UID:ae979e1c-3699-11f1-887f-fef293e589ee
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/seasoned-dialogue-with-lis
 a-marie-lovett-fcvbw3\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Seasoned Dialogue w
 ith Lisa Marie Lovett live on Wednesday\, June 17th\, at 7:30 PM(opens in 
 a new tab)!Lisa Marie Lovett invites audiences into a powerful evening of
  spoken word\, reflection\, and connection through her signature series\,
  Seasoned Dialogue. A Georgia based poet and creator\, Lovett is known fo
 r crafting deeply personal performances centered on healing\, self worth\,
  and emotional renewal.Blending vulnerability\, warmth\, and truth\, her w
 ork creates a welcoming space where listeners are encouraged to slow down\
 , reflect\, and feel genuinely seen. Each performance unfolds like a share
 d meal\, drawing the audience into thoughtful conversations about love\, b
 oundaries\, faith\, and the ongoing journey toward wholeness. With careful
 ly chosen words and intentional storytelling\, Lovett transforms the stage
  into a place of openness\, connection\, and quiet revelation.Her presence
  is both grounding and uplifting\, offering an experience that resonates l
 ong after the final lines are spoken. Join us for an evening where poetry 
 meets purpose\, and where every guest is invited to listen\, reflect\, and
  be part of the dialogue.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We 
