 c-of-rem-krs10u\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents A Night in Athens: The Mu
 sic of R.E.M. live on Saturday\, June 20th\, at 7:30 PM(opens in a new tab
 )!A high-energy tribute to the music of R.E.M. and The B-52’s!Get ready 
 to step into the vibrant\, offbeat world of Athens\, Georgia\, as “One N
 ight in Athens” brings together two electrifying tribute acts for an unf
 orgettable evening of music\, nostalgia\, and pure alternative spirit.Feat
 uring The Reckoning\, a dynamic tribute to R.E.M.\, and The Re-52’s\, a 
 high-octane celebration of The B-52’s\, this one-night-only event captur
 es the sound and soul of two of the most influential bands to emerge from 
 the same iconic college town.From the jangly guitars and poetic introspect
 ion of R.E.M. to the quirky\, danceable new wave energy of The B-52’s\, 
 you can expect crowd favorites and deep cuts alike!“Athens in the late 
 ’70s and ’80s was lightning in a bottle\,” says  Re-52's frontman Ti
 m Pollock. “These bands didn’t just make music—they created a moveme
 nt. ‘One Night in Athens’ is about reliving that moment and celebratin
 g the sound that changed everything.”The Reckoning faithfully recreates 
 R.E.M.’s signature sound and emotional depth and energy\, while The Re-5
 2’s deliver a vibrant\, costume-filled performance that captures the fun
 \, eccentricity\, and party atmosphere of The B-52’s at their peak.Dine 
