 \, from intimate solo renditions to full-band interpretations with Soul Ca
 rnival. Fans can expect favorites alongside the rich\, evolving sound that
  has defined his decades-long career\, including hits like “Beautiful Wr
 eck” and “Shimmer.”A master collaborator and songwriter\, Mullins’
  work spans genres and generations\, from co-writing Zac Brown Band’s ch
