 ard-skynyrd-southern-r-k5t73w\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents High Noon: 
 A Tribute to Lynyrd Skynyrd & Southern Rock live on Friday\, July 24th\,\,
  at 7:30 PM!HIGH NOON brings the spirit of Southern rock roaring to life a
 t City Winery Pittsburgh as the East Coast’s premier tribute to Lynyrd S
 kynyrd and the legends who defined a generation. With a deep reverence for
  the music and the era\, HIGH NOON delivers an electrifying performance pa
 cked with the grit\, soul\, and swagger that made these songs timeless.The
  band performs the classic hits of Lynyrd Skynyrd\, The Allman Brothers Ba
 nd\, Molly Hatchet\, The Outlaws\, 38 Special\, and The Marshall Tucker Ba
 nd\, recreating the raw power and soaring guitar harmonies that shaped Sou
 thern rock. From iconic anthems to fan favorites\, every note is delivered
  with authenticity and heart\, transporting audiences back to the golden a
 ge of live music.Get ready to sing along\, raise a glass\, and relive the 
 soundtrack of a movement. Join us at City Winery Pittsburgh for an unforge
 ttable night of live music\, wine\, and dining in an intimate setting that
