 30 PM(opens in a new tab)!Mohini Dey brings her electrifying talent and gl
 obal acclaim to City Winery Pittsburgh for an unforgettable night of genre
 -defying musicianship. A virtuoso bassist\, composer\, and producer\, Mohi
 ni has captivated audiences worldwide with her dynamic stage presence\, te
 chnical mastery\, and fearless musical expression.Hailing from Mumbai\, In
 dia\, and already a two-decade veteran of the music industry at just 29\, 
 Mohini has performed alongside some of the world’s most celebrated artis
 ts\, including Steve Vai\, Quincy Jones\, A.R. Rahman\, and Willow Smith\,
  with whom she currently tours. Her sound blends jazz\, funk\, fusion\, an
 d world music influences into a high-energy performance that is both deepl
 y musical and visually thrilling.Recognized by Forbes India as one of the 
 most successful musicians under 30 and ranked among the top bassists of th
 e 21st century\, Mohini continues to push boundaries with every performanc
 e. Join us for an inspiring evening of cutting-edge artistry\, exceptional
