DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/bria-skonberg-v27k7t\nCity
  Winery Pittsburgh Presents Bria Skonberg live on Sunday\, August 30th\, a
 t 7:30 PM!Bria Skonberg brings her electrifying blend of trumpet virtuosit
 y\, expressive vocals\, and modern jazz spirit to City Winery Pittsburgh f
 or an unforgettable night of music. A Juno Award winning artist and 10 tim
 e DownBeat Rising Star\, Skonberg has earned international acclaim for her
  fresh\, vibrant take on classic American jazz traditions.Praised by The N
 ew York Times as the “shining hope of hot jazz” and hailed by The Wall
  Street Journal as “one of the most versatile and imposing musicians of 
 her generation\,” Skonberg seamlessly blends classic swing\, New Orleans
  influences\, and contemporary songwriting into performances that are both
  timeless and exhilarating. Her debut album on Sony Masterworks climbed to
  #5 on the Billboard Jazz charts\, while her seventh studio album What It 
 Means\, recorded in New Orleans\, earned a rare five star DownBeat review.
  With more than 25 million streams worldwide and appearances at renowned s
 tages including Carnegie Hall and the Newport\, Monterey\, and Montreal Ja
 zz Festivals\, she continues to captivate audiences across the globe.Join 
 us at City Winery Pittsburgh for an evening of world class jazz\, fine win
 e\, and unforgettable live music as Bria Skonberg takes the stage. Reserve
  your seats now and experience one of jazz’s most dynamic performers in 
 an intimate setting.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provi
