DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/lyfe-jennings-qjeqmg\nCity
  Winery Pittsburgh presents Lyfe Jennings live on Friday\, October 30th\, 
 at 6:30 PM\, part of a multi-show series. View all their Pittsburgh dates 
 and times here!(opens in a new tab)Lyfe Jennings brings his unmistakable v
 oice and deeply personal songwriting to City Winery Pittsburgh for an unfo
 rgettable night of soul\, honesty\, and connection.Known for his gritty de
 livery and raw storytelling\, Lyfe Jennings blends classic R&B with elemen
 ts of soul\, gospel\, and hip hop\, creating music that feels both intimat
 e and powerful. Often performing with live instrumentation including guita
 r\, bass\, and piano\, his shows capture the emotional weight of his songs
  while keeping the energy grounded and authentic.Rising to prominence with
  his acclaimed debut album Lyfe 268-192\, named after his former prison id
 entification number\, Jennings made an immediate impact with standout trac
 ks like “Must Be Nice” and “Stick Up Kid.” He followed that succes
 s with The Phoenix\, a Gold certified release\, and Lyfe Change\, further 
 cementing his reputation as one of R&B’s most socially conscious and emo
 tionally honest voices. His music draws directly from lived experience\, o
 ffering reflections on love\, redemption\, struggle\, and growth.Join us f
 or an intimate evening where powerful stories meet soulful melodies\, pair
 ed with City Winery’s signature wine and dining experience. This is a ra
 re chance to see Lyfe Jennings up close in a setting designed for true mus
 ic lovers. Reserve your seats early and be part of a night that promises d
 epth\, passion\, and unforgettable performances.Dine At Your Show(opens in
  a new tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service directly to your 
 table in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relaxed experience\
 , arrive early and enjoy a meal in our restaurant before the show. When di
 ning in the restaurant\, reservations are encouraged and can be made via R
 esy starting one month before the show. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(open
 s in a new tab)Wine At Your Table(opens in a new tab)Reserve your preferre
 d wine by filling out this form(opens in a new tab) and have a bottle wait
 ing at your table when you arrive at your show. No more waiting for your f
 irst drink! We will save your wine preference and have a bottle at your ta
 ble for all future shows. When you want to change your wine\, come back to
  this form and update your preference.2-item Per Person Minimum🎶  Kindl
 y note there is a 2-item per person food & beverage minimum in the concert
  venue. Food and beverages ordered in the restaurant also count towards th
 e minimum.(opens in a new tab)Become a Vinofile Member(opens in a new tab)
 🍷  Members get 48 hour early access to new shows\, pay no ticket fees\,
  and earn points to exchange for complimentary tickets. Vinofile Plus memb
 ers also receive many wine benefits. Add a membership to your cart during 
 checkout to start saving now. Already a member? Make sure you are signed i
 n to access your benefits. Become a Vinofile Member and enjoy the benefits
