BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sensory Friendly Open Studio Night (18+)
DTSTART:20260515T220000Z
DTEND:20260515T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260412T180152Z
UID:af59f688-3699-11f1-887f-fef293e589ee
DESCRIPTION:10000012-1778868000-1778875200@www.warhol.org\nJoin us for a se
 nsory-friendly open studio night designed to support the creativity of adu
 lts with autism spectrum disorders and those with sensory sensitivities. T
 his program for ages 18+ offers an adapted museum experience including des
 ignated quiet areas\, lower lighting levels in the studio\, and access to 
 fidgets & noise-cancelling headphones. \nRegistrants will be able to submi
 t their own drawings\, photographs\, or other images to our staff to be tr
 anslated into silkscreen prints. These designs can be used to make t-shirt
 s\, posters\, and other custom art pieces during the event. Registration i
 s limited to 20 participants and caregivers. Reach out to access@warhol.or
 g with any accessibility needs or questions.
LOCATION:The Factory\, 117 Sandusky Street\, Pittsburgh\, PA\, 15212\, Unit
 ed States
END:VEVENT
