 om!\n*No presale tickets for this event ~ a $5 live music charge will be a
 dded to your bill. \n\nDOORS AT 4PM | SHOW AT 5PM | 21 AND OVER\n*This is
  a general admission event. There is plenty of seating available. But it i
 s first come\, first serve and is therefore not guaranteed. \n\n \nAbout
  Trinity Wiseman:WEBSITE | FACEBOOK | INSTAGRAM | LISTEN\nTrinity Wiseman 
 is a 24 year old Pittsburgh native who lives in Nashville. Working as a mu
 sician full time\, she can be seen playing shows all around Nashville. Tri
 nity recently had her debut at Whiskey Jam and The Bluebird Cafe. She has 
 won numerous accolades in Pittsburgh and Nashville which most recently inc
 luded winning the 2023 Recording Academy’s Grammy U Songwriter competiti
 on. Her original music is a fusion of moody pop and atmospheric electronic
  folk\, with lyrics inspired by her own self discovery and navigating rela
 tionships in the modern world. \n\n
