DESCRIPTION:https://pittsburghwinery.com/event/samjamwich/\n\n\n\nThe Origi
 nal Pittsburgh Winery Presents: SamJAMwich!\nDoors at 6PM | Show at 7PM |
  21 and over\n$15 Advance / $20 Day of show   ** Face value ticket price 
 does not include tax/fees\n\n*This is a general admission event. There is 
 plenty of seating available. But it is first come\, first serve and is the
 refore not guaranteed. \nAbout SamJAMwich:FACEBOOK | INSTAGRAM | LISTEN\n
 Formed in summer 2021\, SamJAMwich garnered attention from crowds across t
 he region. Using hometown venues such as Mr. Smalls Funhouse\, Bloom Brew 
 and Thunderbird Music Hall to showcase their driving & active approach to 
 playing music\, they have also been featured in festival line-ups in West 
 Virginia\, New York and Northwest Pennsylvania. SamJAMwich has shared the 
 stage with other favorites such as Rasta Rafiki\, ekoostik hookah\, The Mo
 tet and DirtWire. 2024 finds SamJAMwich performing their 100th show and pl
 aying venues such as Club Cafe and City Winery. Combining the ethos of the
  Grateful Dead and the punk scene of the 80s\, SamJAMwich brings together 
 musical elements of all genres in a DIY approach to being a JAM band.\n\n\
 n
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Winery
END:VEVENT
