 le. But it is first come\, first serve and is therefore not guaranteed. \
 n\nAbout Mike Minda’s Be Free:\nBe Free is a project curated by Mike Min
 da (The Commonheart\, Randy Baumann’s Ramble Band\, Colin Southfield and
  the Mushroom Country Band). Performing songs from Eric Clapton\, Jimi Hen
 drix\, Pink Floyd\, Santana and more\, Be Free is a tribute to late 60’s
  and early 70’s guitar rock. Get ready for fiery guitar solos\, latin-ro
 ck percussion beats\, and turn of the 70’s grooves that make you want to
  have “just one more”! Mike Minda’s Be Free features Mike Minda on l
 ead guitar and vocals\, Dave Minda (Erin Burkett & the Mean Reds\, Sweet J
 udy’s) on guitar and vocals\, Michael Berger on bass (The Clock Reads\, 
 Chalk Dinosaur)\, Randy Baumann on keyboards and vocals (Randy Baumann’s
  Ramble Band\, WDVE Morning Show)\, Steve Ippolito on drums (Norside Organ
  Trio\, The Clock Reads)\, and David Glover on percussion (Slippery Rock U
 niversity Percussion Professor).\n
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Winery
