BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Big Shrimp w/ Neon Belly
DTSTART:20260515T010000Z
DTEND:20260515T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260413T190558Z
UID:ce5fcdd2-376b-11f1-839d-aec7dd95e29b
DESCRIPTION:https://pittsburghwinery.com/event/big-shrimp-w-neon-belly/\n\n
 The Original Pittsburgh Winery Presents: Big Shrimp w/ special guests Neon
  Belly!DOORS AT 7PM | SHOW AT 8PM | 21 AND OVER\n$15.00 in Advance // $20.
 00 Day of show [+Tax/Fees]\n*This is a general admission event. There is p
 lenty of seating available. But it is first come\, first serve and is ther
 efore not guaranteed. \n\nAbout Big Shrimp:WEBSITE | INSTAGRAM | LISTEN\n
 Big Shrimp is a high-octane progressive improv rock quartet formed in 2024
  in Bridgeport\, CT\, blending danceable funk\, exploratory rock\, and fea
 rless improvisation into an intricate yet infectious sound built on collab
 orative songwriting from all four members. Their adventurous live shows—
 balancing tight originals with playful\, unexpected covers—have earned t
 hem national attention\, including placement on Spotify’s Modern Jam Ban
 d playlist\, a spot on Grateful Web’s “Top 12 Upcoming Jam Bands to Wa
 tch in 2026\,” and a rapidly growing fanbase known as The Prawn Stars. F
 ollowing the release of their third live album\, The Prawno Tapes\, Vol. 3
 \, highlights from a summer and fall tour featuring festival appearances a
 nd major support slots\, the band headlined a sold-out Phish After Party i
 n NYC and continued building momentum with viral TikTok clips\, packed roo
 ms nationwide\, and a theatrical annual Halloween Extravaganza. Now in the
  midst of an expansive 2026 Winter Tour—including Colorado debuts and a 
 Cervantes’ headline—Big Shrimp has also released their debut single 
 “Rex\,” the first glimpse of their forthcoming studio album\, as they 
 charge full steam into a breakout year.\n
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Winery
END:VEVENT
