 underbird-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nAx and the Hatchetme
 n\nThursday\, July 17\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, Pit
 tsburgh\, PADoors @ 7PMShow @ 8PMAGE RESTRICTION: ALL AGES\n \n\nAx and t
 he Hatchetmen came here to party. The Chicago based indie rock band\, led 
 by singer and guitarist Axel Ellis\, have been headlining tours and releas
 ing music since 2018. Rounding out the rest of the band are the Hatchetmen
 - made up of Salvatore Defilippis\, Hunter Olshefke\, Phil Pistone\, Quinn
  Dolan and Chaandmon Croft. Their debut LP “So Much To Tell You” was r
 eleased in the fall of 2025 on Arista Records. They plan on touring and re
 leasing music for the foreseeable future. They also will party. \n\nTicke
 t Tier Info:General Admission Tickets – Standing Room Only\nThere are no
