BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Leftover Crack
DTSTART:20260621T233000Z
DTEND:20260622T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260414T180616Z
UID:a168399c-382c-11f1-b3f9-e2b237397ae8
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/leftover-crack-2/\nLeftöver Crack 
 is an American punk rock band formed in 1998 following the breakup of its\
 npredecessor Choking Victim\, sharing band members Stza Crack & Alec Baill
 ie until Alec’s tragic\ndeath in November of 2021. The band has created 
 the new record label RECIDIVIST BIBLE\nCAMP & Is co-releasing a 7” singl
 e with Austria’s SBAM records featuring the new song “White\nGuilt Atr
 ocity Quilt” accompanied by a major motion music video. The song is also
  slated to be\nincluded on the as yet untitled 4th full length album from 
 this New York City based Punk Band.\nThe B side to this new single is an u
 nreleased track from the 2014 “Constructs of the State”\nrecord titled
  “Brad Sabbath”\, featuring the classic Leftöver Crack line-up of Stz
 a\, Baillie\, Brad\nLogan\, Donny Morris\; Chris Mann with the more recent
  addition of singer Tibbie X\, formerly of\nthe NYC bands X-Possibles &\; 
 Kissy Kamikaze as well as the Philly based band GASH. Along\nwith this new
  single\, Leftöver Crack are also in the works of reissuing all of their 
 previous\nalbums\, with the exception of “Mediocre Generica” (which re
 mains on Hellcat/Epitaph Records)\nthrough the partnership of RECIDIVIST &
  SBAM.This Event Is All AgesAll Sales Are Final.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
