DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/revenge-of-the-sixth-a-sta
 r-wars-trivia-night-zypiss\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Revenge of the
  Sixth: A Star Wars Trivia Night live on Wednesday\, May 6th at 7:00 PM(op
 ens in a new tab)!Get ready to celebrate a galaxy far\, far away- just 2 d
 ays late\, but twice as fun! Join us at City Winery Pittsburgh on May 6th 
 for “Revenge of the Sixth: A Star Wars Trivia Night”\, where the Force
  is strong and the drinks are even stronger.From the original trilogy to t
 he sequels\, prequels\, and beyond\, we’re covering everything- includin
 g deep cuts from animated series\, expanded universe lore\, and fan-favori
 te moments across the entire Star Wars saga. Whether you’re a Jedi Maste
 r of knowledge or just here for the vibes\, there’s something for every 
 level of fan.Kick back and enjoy a fun-filled test of your intergalactic k
 nowledge\, or come dressed as your favorite character\, because costumes a
 re highly encouraged. Who knows? There might even be a prize for the best 
