DTEND:20260524T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260414T190149Z
UID:63f772a0-3834-11f1-b3f9-e2b237397ae8
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/lolecroix-presents-killer-
 queens-rock-n-roll-dra-bum36v\nCity Winery & Lola LeCroix present Killer Q
 ueens Rock N' Roll Drag Brunch on Sunday\, May 24th\, at 12:00pm!Grab the 
 Aqua-Net\, turn it up and let it rip -- Killer Queens are taking over City
  Winery Pittsburgh for a drag brunch that’s loud\, unapologetic\, and dr
 ipping in rock ’n roll attitude!Hosted by Lola LeCroix\, this high-volta
 ge brunch channels the women who defined rock rebellion -- from Joan Jett 
 and Pat Benatar to Stevie Nicks\, Debbie Harry\, Heart\, Alanis Morissette
 \, Avril Lavigne\, and beyond. Expect performances that’ll have you decl
 aring “I Love Rock ’n Roll\,” living on the “Edge of Seventeen\,
 ” and daring anyone to “Hit Me With Your Best Shot.”One minute you
 ’re swept into a little rock fantasy\, the next you’re raising a glass
  like a true “Barracuda\,” shouting along to “Cherry Bomb\,” and f
 ully embracing your “Bad Reputation.” Because at this brunch\, the ene
 rgy is electric\, the hair is BIGGER\, and the queens are here to remind y
 ou that rock has always belonged to the girls!So grab your crew\, order an
 other round\, and get ready to brunch like a rockstar. Because at Killer Q
 ueens Drag Brunch\, the amps are loud\, the heels are higher\, and the onl
 y rule is simple: don’t stop until the whole room is ready to sing along
 !!À la carte brunch is not included in the ticket price and is a separate
  charge.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food and 
 beverage service directly to your table in the venue. Or\, for an expanded
  menu and more relaxed experience\, arrive early and enjoy a meal in our r
 estaurant before the show. When dining in the restaurant\, reservations ar
 e encouraged and can be made via Resy starting one month before the show. 
 View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens in a new tab)Wine At Your Table(opens 
 in a new tab)Reserve your preferred wine by filling out this form(opens in
  a new tab) and have a bottle waiting at your table when you arrive at you
 r show. No more waiting for your first drink! We will save your wine prefe
 rence and have a bottle at your table for all future shows. When you want 
 to change your wine\, come back to this form and update your preference.2-
 item Per Person Minimum🎶  Kindly note there is a 2-item per person food
  & beverage minimum in the concert venue. Food and beverages ordered in th
 e restaurant also count towards the minimum.(opens in a new tab)Become a V
 inofile Member(opens in a new tab)🍷  Members get 48 hour early access t
 o new shows\, pay no ticket fees\, and earn points to exchange for complim
 entary tickets. Vinofile Plus members also receive many wine benefits. Add
