UID:63fb5136-3834-11f1-b3f9-e2b237397ae8
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/hip-hop-and-rb-bingo-with-
 tom-swoope-2163v1\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Hip Hop and R&B Bingo w
 ith Tom Swoope live on Sunday\, May 31st\, at 12:00 PM\, part of a multi-s
 how series. View all their Pittsburgh dates and times here!(opens in a new
  tab)Pittsburgh\, get ready for one of the most entertaining brunch experi
 ences in the country! Hip Hop and R&B Bingo with Tom Swoope returns to Cit
 y Winery Pittsburgh for a special Memorial Day Weekend double show! Hosted
  by Tom Swoope\, A.K.A. Mr. Story Time\, this nationally-touring event has
  sold out more than 250+ shows across the United States. This is not your 
 grandmother’s bingo. Instead of numbers\, players listen to classic hip 
 hop and R&B hits from the 90s and early 2000s while marking songs on their
  bingo boards. The result is a high-energy mix of music\, comedy\, competi
 tion\, and nonstop sing-alongs. Expect wild crowd interaction\, hilarious 
 commentary from Tom Swoope\, prizes throughout the show\, and a room full 
 of people singing along to the songs that defined an era. Perfect for birt
 hdays\, groups\, date nights\, and anyone who loves 90s R&B and hip hop.Ci
 ty Winery Pittsburgh provides the perfect setting in the historic Strip Di
 strict with a beautiful concert venue\, full service restaurant\, craft co
 cktails\, and award-winning wines served right to your table. Guests can e
 njoy a chef-driven brunch menu while experiencing one of the most unique l
 ive entertainment shows touring today! Each ticket includes 8 bingo boards
  and entry into the full interactive show experience.IMPORTANT INFORMATION
 :Food and beverages are not included with the ticket and will be available
  for purchase inside the venue.Two-item food or beverage minimum per perso
 n.Follow@TomSwoopeEvents@FirstOffInMyOpinionTo stay in the loop text Hey T
 om to 216-284-3444Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide
  food and beverage service directly to your table in the venue. Or\, for a
 n expanded menu and more relaxed experience\, arrive early and enjoy a mea
 l in our restaurant before the show. When dining in the restaurant\, reser
 vations are encouraged and can be made via Resy starting one month before 
 the show. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens in a new tab)Wine At Your Ta
