 y Pittsburgh with a performance that is as relatable as it is unforgettabl
 e. Known for his razor-sharp wit and high-energy delivery\, Rodia turns th
 e chaos of everyday life into comedy gold\, blending stories of family\, c
 ulture\, and modern relationships into a set that feels both personal and 
 universally hilarious.Rising to fame through his viral social media sketch
 es\, including his beloved character “Uncle Vinny\,” Rodia has built a
  massive and loyal fanbase drawn to his honest\, no-filter humor. His brea
 kout Amazon special Totally Relatable introduced his comedic voice to a gl
 obal audience\, while his hit tours have continued to sell out venues acro
 ss the country.Now\, with his brand-new “Insanely Funny” tour\, Rodia 
 delivers fresh material\, quick-fire improvisation\, and sharp takes on ad
 ulthood\, parenting\, and cultural identity. His dynamic stage presence an
 d genuine connection with audiences make every show feel like a night out 
 with your funniest friend.Join us for an unforgettable evening of comedy\,
