UID:e9018a04-3c5c-11f1-bd6e-769216b470c5
DESCRIPTION:59lqj54h8ldi7relj4bvvkkd2o@google.com\nOak Hollow Park Under th
 e Stars - Stargazing with Norwin High School&#39\;s Astronomy Club\n\nEnjo
 y the park after dark!  Join us for an evening of stargazing as we explor
 e the Moon\, bright planets\, star clusters and some of the spring and sum
 mer constellations.  Telescopes will be available for guests to look thro
 ugh\, offering close up views of objects often mistaken for ordinary brigh
 t stars.\n\nStudents from Norwin High School\, with support from the Amate
 ur Astronomers Association of Pittsburgh (AAAP) are excited to share their
  passion for the universe.  They will be on hand throughout the evening t
 o answer questions\, guide beginners\, and help you learn your way around 
 the night sky.  Sunset is around 9 p.m.\, and the best viewing begins as 
 the sky grows darker.  Feel free to bring blankets or lawn chairs for a c
 omfortable night under the stars.\n\nThis event is family friendly\, and n
 o prior astronomy experience is needed.  Registration is encouraged\, but
  walk ins are welcome.
LOCATION:2130 Timothy Dr\, Irwin\, PA 15642\, USA
END:VEVENT
