 rs-day-edition-gv6vi6\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Spring Wine Showcas
 e- Mothers Day Edition live on  Sunday\, May 10th\, at 11:00 AM(opens in a
  new tab)!Spring Wine Showcase\, Mother’s Day Edition invites you to cel
 ebrate Mom with a festive and interactive tasting experience at City Winer
 y Pittsburgh. Gather with friends and loved ones for an afternoon dedicate
 d to spring flavors\, fresh blooms\, and the joy of sharing great wine tog
 ether.Guests will enjoy a curated selection of seasonal wines\, each thoug
 htfully paired with a beautiful flower\, allowing you to create your own c
 ustom bouquet to take home. As you sip and explore\, discover new favorite
 s and take advantage of exclusive bottle discounts available only to atten
 dees. Plus\, one lucky guest will win a special wine prize to continue the
  celebration at home.Set in our warm and inviting space\, this Mother’s 
 Day event blends wine\, creativity\, and connection into one memorable exp
 erience. Treat Mom\, or yourself\, to a unique outing filled with flavor\,
  fun\, and a touch of springtime magic.Join us for a delightful Mother’s
  Day celebration of wine\, flowers\, and togetherness\, reserve your ticke
 ts today.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food and
