  the New Jack Swing era\, Williams rose to prominence with his velvety voc
 als and polished sound\, helping shape the evolution of modern R&B.Hailing
  from the Bronx and carrying the legacy of his aunt\, jazz icon Ella Fitzg
 erald\, Christopher Williams blends heritage and star power into every per
 formance. He achieved widespread acclaim with his gold-certified hit “Dr
 eamin’\,” featured in the classic film New Jack City\, where he also a
 ppeared on screen. Over a career spanning more than three decades\, he has
  continued to captivate audiences as both a multi-platinum recording artis
 t and a seasoned actor\, with credits across stage and television includin
 g New York Undercover.Join us at City Winery Pittsburgh for an unforgettab
