 end of music\, dance\, and storytelling drawn from cultures across the glo
 be.\n\nIn one unforgettable evening\, more than two dozen talented student
  performers transport audiences through the rhythms\, costumes\, and tradi
 tions of Eastern and Western Europe and beyond. With dazzling choreography
 \, live music\, and breathtaking costumes\, the show delivers the energy o
 f a concert\, the spectacle of a dance production\, and the beauty of worl
 d culturesâmaking it a perfect night out whether youâre a longti
 me fan or discovering The Tamburitzans for the first time.\n\nEven more in
 spiring\, every performer you see on stage is a full-time college student 
