 that has captivated audiences for generations.\n\nJoin us as we close our 
 89th season with a vibrant celebration of music\, movement\, and global he
 ritage.\n\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, May 16\, 2026\n\nTime: 7:00 P
 M\n\nLocation: Pittsburgh Playhouse â PNC Theatre\n\nEvent: The Tambu
 ritzans 89th Season Finale\n\n        				        				        	           
              				                                               \n    \nBu
 y Tickets
