 -woman-tour-837mf2\nCity Winery Pittsburgh Presents Rita Wilson: The Sound
  of a Woman Tour with Pete Muller live on Tuesday\, June 9th\, at 7:30 PM!
 PLEASE NOTE: For this event\, only beverage service will be permitted duri
 ng the show. To order food\, please arrive early to dine before the show i
 n the venue or in our restaurant. Rita Wilson brings her acclaimed live sh
 ow to City Winery Pittsburgh as she tours behind her newest album\, Sound 
 of a Woman. Known for her expressive vocals and storytelling songwriting\,
  Wilson’s music moves effortlessly between pop\, Americana\, and singer-
 songwriter traditions.Her celebrated discography includes five studio albu
 ms\, including Rita Wilson Now & Forever: Duets\, which features collabora
 tions with Willie Nelson\, Smokey Robinson\, Jackson Browne\, Tim McGraw\,
  Elvis Costello\, Keith Urban\, Leslie Odom Jr.\, Josh Groban\, Vince Gill
 \, and Jimmie Allen. She also recorded the Academy Award–shortlisted son
 g “Til You’re Home” with Latin GRAMMY winner Sebastián Yatra for A 
 Man Called Otto.Wilson’s live performances have graced some of the world
 ’s most respected stages\, including Disney Concert Hall and the Sydney 
 Opera House. Experience her captivating performance up close at City Winer
 y Pittsburgh.Join us for an unforgettable evening of live music\, wine\, a
 nd dining in an intimate setting that brings you closer to the music.Dine 
 At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage serv
 ice directly to your table in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and mor
 e relaxed experience\, arrive early and enjoy a meal in our restaurant bef
 ore the show. When dining in the restaurant\, reservations are encouraged 
 and can be made via Resy starting one month before the show. View Our Conc
 ert Dining Menu.(opens in a new tab)Wine At Your Table(opens in a new tab)
 Reserve your preferred wine by filling out this form(opens in a new tab) a
 nd have a bottle waiting at your table when you arrive at your show. No mo
 re waiting for your first drink! We will save your wine preference and hav
 e a bottle at your table for all future shows. When you want to change you
 r wine\, come back to this form and update your preference.2-item Per Pers
 on Minimum🎶  Kindly note there is a 2-item per person food & beverage m
 inimum in the concert venue. Food and beverages ordered in the restaurant 
 also count towards the minimum.(opens in a new tab)Become a Vinofile Membe
 r(opens in a new tab)🍷  Members get 48 hour early access to new shows\,
  pay no ticket fees\, and earn points to exchange for complimentary ticket
 s. Vinofile Plus members also receive many wine benefits. Add a membership
  to your cart during checkout to start saving now. Already a member? Make 
 sure you are signed in to access your benefits. Become a Vinofile Member a
 nd enjoy the benefits today.(opens in a new tab)(opens in a new tab)(opens
  in a new tab)DateJun09Doors Open6:00 PMLocationCity Winery Pittsburgh1627
  Smallman StreetPittsburgh 15222United States(opens in a new tab)
LOCATION:City Winery Pittsburgh
