DTEND:20260820T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260428T120520Z
UID:8750ad54-42fa-11f1-a54a-1a0cede2bd1d
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/kyle-smith/\nVIP includes: GA\, Pri
 vate Acoustic Set (2-3 songs)\, Signed Poster\, VIP Laminate\, KS Bag\, St
 ickers\, Koozie & Photo with Kyle. Limit of 15.Kyle Smith from Ventura\, C
 A has been known to push the limits of the "Cali Reggae" sound with influe
 nces of Hip-Hop\, Punk Rock\, and Pop that make it impossible for his styl
 e to be defined. He's known for his tracks about mistakes\, imperfections\
 , addictions\, and struggles combined with hooks everybody can sing. Kyle'
 s high energy performances with the band and relentless work ethic are bot
 h contributing factors to a rapidly growing fanbase of outcasts all over N
 orth America.In 2021\, Lost Cause debuted at #2 Reggae Albums on iTunes. I
 n 2024\, Bad For Business debuted at #13 Alternative Albums on iTunes\, al
 ong with consistently dropping new music and a non-stop tour schedule. Top
