DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/acousticafe-songwriter-series-13/\n
 Jennie Kay Snyder - Jennie Kay Snyder is an award-winning songwriter and v
 eteran of the Los Angeles and Austin music scenes\, and appeared on bills 
 with Townes Van Zandt\, Victoria Williams\, Deke Dickerson\, Rosie Flores\
 , Timbuk 3\, Big Bad Voodoo Daddy and many others. She moved to Pittsburgh
  in 2007 to be near the Allegheny Forest\, where she grew up. She performs
  solo and in various groups throughout the region\, and appears on dozens 
 of live and studio recordings as principal and backing vocalist.Bob August
 ine - Bob Augustine (aka Folk-IndieBob) is a singer\, songwriter based in 
