 c lyrics and acoustic guitar accompaniment. He has been featured at folk e
 vents\, festivals\, concerts and poetry readings and has received much pos
 itive feedback as people enjoy his insightful writing\, soulful voice\, an
 d original sound.Matt Eddy - Matt Eddy is a songwriter from Tampa Bay\, cu
 rrently residing in the Pittsburgh area. His gentle and wide-ranging voice
  and sensitive approach to the acoustic guitar provide an intimate atmosph
 ere that enable his poetic lyrics to resonate with the listener.This Event
  Is All Ages
