 es guests into a space where art\, music\, and meaningful conversation col
 lide. Think traditional game night reinvented\, into a guided conversation
  and craft experience.Attendees will design a custom sneaker sole replica 
 inspired by their personal stories\, prompted by the thought-provoking que
 stions from the SoleTies card game. As R&B fills the room\, guests will re
 flect\, share\, and connect in ways that are creative\, soulful\, and deep
 ly human.SoleTies is a conversation card game rooted in emotional wellness
  and artistic expression\, designed to help people bond through storytelli
 ng and creativity. This live experience brings it to life offering a night
  of community\, vulnerability\, and lasting memories\, with everyone walki
 ng away with their own personal keepsake.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new 
