DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/improv-with-suzi-barrett-and-ryan-ros
 enberg-june-24-2026-680075\n From the podcast "Yes\, also" the highly skil
 led Suzi Barrett and Ryan Rosenberg are coming to Bottlerocket to show you
  some twoprov! If you’re a student of improv\, you need to catch this sh
 ow. If you’re a superfan of improv\, you’ll love this show. If you’v
 e never heard of improv… well\, everybody get in here anyway.   Why'd We
  Book It? The Yes\, Also podcast is a love letter to improv comedy\, Suzi 
 Barrett deep dives with veteran improvisers about their journeys through i
 mprov. As comedy lovers\, we are subscribers! As UCB fans\, we love to hea
 r from past and present iprovisers about their experience working in this 
 field. Suzi is extremely knowledgeable and has a way of keeping the podcas
 t insightful\, but of course\, hilarious. We are more than excited to see 
 them put all the improv talk into action on our stage! 
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
