BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:PRIDE BINGO: THE BABADOOK
DTSTART:20260602T233000Z
DTEND:20260603T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260511T150203Z
UID:5e6b5ea2-4d4a-11f1-a990-965b266af961
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/pride-bingo-the-babadook-june-02-2026
 -703625\n Get ready to be BABA-SHOOK at our PRIDE MONTH DRAG CHARITY BINGO
  featuring Horror's most unlikely pride month icon.   You might be asking\
 , "What does the Babadook have to do with Pride?"  In 2017\, Netflix mista
 kenly placed the horror movie under the "LGBTQ+ PRIDE MONTH" category. Wha
 t ensued was a deluge of memes and frankly... a very fun time to be on the
  internet. Now\, almost a decade later\, we've teamed up with our favorite
  drag queen\, INDI SKIES\, to bring you the most unhinged celebrity pride 
 bingo concept in the city.  Play several rounds of BABADOOK THEMED PRIDE B
 INGO\, Win free drinks\, prizes from our random prize bin\, and even $100 
 CASH courtesy of our wonderful sponsors at ABIDING MISSIONS!   So dig out 
 your top hat and glitter\, show us your best BABA-LOOK\, because this June
  the BABADOOK IS COMING OUT!  
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
