DESCRIPTION:https://citytheatre.culturaldistrict.org/event/31854-2026/etta-
 cox\nETTA COX is originally from St. Joseph\, Missouri. Her credits range 
 from the Broadway stage to movies\, television and night clubs. She has re
 ceived numerous awards and honors for her jazz vocals\, as well as being v
 oted one of the “Most Powerful Women in Pittsburgh” and Performer of t
 he Year by the Pittsburgh Post-Gazette.  Ms. Cox has hosted and emceed th
 e Ladies of Jazz at The Oaks in Oakmont for the past several years\; an ev
 ent that introduces audiences to upcoming and established jazz vocalists i
 n the area. She and her band soon will be live streaming on “Oh! Jazz\,
 ” from Con Alma Restaurant and Jazz Bar. Ms. Cox also taught at the Pitt
 sburgh C.A.P.A. school from 2007 through 2024.Ms. Cox is a very proud memb
 er of Bidwell Presbyterian Church under the leadership of Rev. B. De Neice
  Welch.Presented in partnership with MCG Jazz.\nRead More
LOCATION:Arts Landing
END:VEVENT
