DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/change-of-heart-tom-petty-
 tribute-tu2ylw\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Change of Heart: Tom Petty
  Tribute live on Friday\, Mary 22nd\, at 7:30 PM(opens in a new tab)!Chang
 e of Heart: A Tribute to Tom Petty brings the timeless music of Tom Petty 
 to life with a powerful live performance celebrating one of rock’s most 
 beloved songwriters. Based in Pittsburgh\, this talented tribute band is m
 ade up of five seasoned veterans of the local music scene who share a deep
  passion for Petty’s iconic catalog.From chart-topping classics with Tom
  Petty and the Heartbreakers to favorites from The Traveling Wilburys\, Ch
 ange of Heart delivers an authentic concert experience that spans every er
 a of Petty’s legendary career. Audiences can expect a night filled with 
 unforgettable melodies\, heartfelt storytelling\, and the unmistakable sou
 nd that defined generations of American rock and roll.Join us for an unfor
 gettable evening of live music\, wine\, and dining as Change of Heart hono
 rs the enduring legacy of Tom Petty. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or di
 scovering the music for the first time\, this is a celebration you won’t
  want to miss.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide foo
 d and beverage service directly to your table in the venue. Or\, for an ex
