 -amy-winehouse-d8aev4\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Back to Black: The 
 Music of Amy Winehouse live on Thursday\, July 23rd\, at 7:30 PM(opens in 
 a new tab)!Back To Black: The Music of Amy Winehouse brings the unforgetta
 ble sound\, soul\, and story of Amy Winehouse to the stage in a powerful l
 ive tribute experience. Performed by internationally acclaimed UK artist R
 eine Beau\, this celebrated production has captivated audiences across thr
 ee continents with sold-out performances and standing ovations worldwide.M
 ore than a tribute concert\, Back To Black takes audiences on a heartfelt 
 journey through Amy’s music\, influences\, and enduring cultural legacy.
  With soulful vocals\, passionate storytelling\, and a deep emotional conn
 ection to the material\, Reine Beau captures the raw honesty\, jazz-infuse
 d sound\, and magnetic spirit that made Winehouse one of the most iconic v
 oices of her generation.Featuring beloved hits including “Back To Black\
 ,” “Valerie\,” “Rehab\,” “Me & Mr Jones\,” and more\, this i
 mmersive production from Night Owl Shows blends live music with rich story
 telling for an unforgettable evening. Join us for a night of live music\, 
 wine\, and dining as we celebrate the artistry and legacy of Amy Winehouse
  in an intimate concert setting.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽
