DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/travis-malloy-and-urban-wo
 rship-collective-live--wvcfov\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Travis Mall
 oy and Urban Worship Collective Live at City Winery on Sunday\, August 9th
 \, at 5:30 PM(opens in a new tab)\, part of a multi-show series. View all 
 Pittsburgh dates and times here!(opens in a new tab)Join Travis Malloy and
  Urban Worship Collective for a powerful live concert experience at City W
 inery. Featuring soulful vocals\, inspiring music\, and high-energy perfor
 mances\, this unforgettable evening blends worship\, culture\, and connect
 ion in an intimate concert setting designed to uplift and inspire audience
 s of all backgrounds. Led by Grammy-nominated songwriter and producer Trav
 is Malloy\, Urban Worship Collective is a dynamic faith-driven music group
 . Blending gospel\, contemporary worship\, and R&B soul\, the collective c
 reates powerful\, uplifting music designed to inspire\, heal\, and bring p
 eople closer to purpose. Known for their heartfelt vocals\, live energy\, 
 and message of hope\, Urban Worship Collective is more than a group—it
 ’s a movement rooted in faith\, unity\, and transformation.Their latest 
 album made a powerful impact\, debuting at #1 on the iTunes Christian Albu
 m Chart\, #5 on the Apple Music Christian Streaming Chart\, and #28 across
  all genres\, marking a major independent milestone and a testament to the
  support of their growing global audience.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new
  tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service directly to your table 
 in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relaxed experience\, arri
 ve early and enjoy a meal in our restaurant before the show. When dining i
 n the restaurant\, reservations are encouraged and can be made via Resy st
 arting one month before the show. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens in a
  new tab)Wine At Your Table(opens in a new tab)Reserve your preferred wine
