 try performances and poetic brilliance! \n\n\nExperience a captivating ble
 nd of poetry and burlesque\, celebrating iconic spoken word artists and wi
 ldly enticing dancers. \n\n\nIndulge in an artistic evening honoring the c
 reative Pens\, belonging to spoken word artists who inspire and breath lif
 e into Chai. \n\n\nA delicious festive atmosphere with live DJ music and t
 antalizing offerings. \n\n\nJoin Me for a unique celebration where art and
