 fall as hard as I did for every talented Soul in the room. Think stage pla
 y and poetry… Idle Wild and Harlem Nights… gyratin’ somewhere in Jam
 aica. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin us for Chai’s Favo
 rite Pens 2\, an enchanting evening celebrating Chiina Bloodmire’s 3033r
