UID:cb8a2274-526e-11f1-b83e-4e0f19fff5ec
DESCRIPTION:https://www.poetrymillvale.com/event/haikunika/\n7 pm. $12 adva
 nce\, $15 door.\nTickets online at Humanitix\nhttps://events.humanitix.com
 /haikunika-millie-dread-and-swampwalk-at-poetry-lounge\nand at Jerry’s R
 ecords\, Caliban Books and Government Center.\nSophisticated synthpop from
  the south of Spain\n(aka Agent Triplex from the band Operation Re-Informa
 tion)\nHAIKUNIKA\nhttps://haikunika.com/\nhttps://haikunika.bandcamp.com/\
 nwith special guests\nMillie Dread https://milliedread.bandcamp.com/\nand
  Swampwalk https://swampwalkin.bandcamp.com/\nHaikunika is a musician\, p
 roducer\, and vocalist currently based in the south of Spain. Her work ble
 nds downtempo electronica with ambient\, pop\, and experimental elements\,
  often exploring themes of human consciousness\, inner transformation\, an
 d our relationship to the cosmos and the natural world.\nOriginally connec
 ted to the Pittsburgh music scene through earlier projects\, including the
  laptronica pioneer band Operation Re-Information\, this performance marks
  a return to a city that shaped part of her artistic path. She is currentl
 y working with Protomaterial Records on a new album to be released in fall
  2026.
LOCATION:Poetry Lounge
END:VEVENT
