 ueerly-beloved-a-love-letter-to-ourselves/thunderbird-cafe-music-hall/pitt
 sburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nFirewall Dance Theater Presents \nQueerly Beloved
 : A Love Letter to Ourselves\n \nSaturday\, June 27\, 2026\nThunderbird M
 usic Hall 4053 Butler St. Pittsburgh\, PA 15201Doors @ 7pmShow @ 8pmAge Re
 striction: 18+ or with legal guardianQueerly Beloved – a love letter to 
 ourselves.A Pride burlesque cabaret devoted to pleasure\, power\, freedom\
 , and the delicious art of taking up space. Drenched in glitter\, sweat\, 
 and self-expression\, “Queerly Beloved” celebrates our favorite holida
 y the only way we know how…loudly\, proudly\, and just a little bit filt
 hy.A night for the lovers and the loners\, the heartbreakers and the hopel
 ess romantics\, and anyone still learning how to love themselves out loud.
