DESCRIPTION:https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/event/death-from-above-1979/th
 underbird-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nDEATH FROM ABOVE 197
 9\nPrivate Lives Tour\nSunday\, December 6\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall405
 3 Butler Street\, Pittsburgh\, PADoors @ 7PMShow @ 8PMAGE RESTRICTION: 18+
  or with legal guardian\n \nBorn from the womb of Y2K techno paranoia\, d
 ance-punk mega duo DEATH FROM ABOVE 1979 have been a cathartic through-li
 ne since 2001. Every now and then they come to fly their jumbo jet sound 
 into the skyscrapers that the zeitgeist has erected. You’re a Woman\, I
 ’m a Machine (2004)\, The Physical World (2014)\, Outrage! Is Now (2017
 ) and Is 4 Lovers (2021)\, now in 2026 they once again blast off celebrati
 ng their 25th anniversary with a fifth LP\, Private Lives\, slated for a f
 all release. They’ve survived CDs\, MP3s\, pirating\, streaming and AI s
 lop undeterred and have delivered nothing but musky power-cock riffs\, psy
 cho tenor wails and frenetic juvenile delinquent rhythms. Will you join th
 em on tour? Will you submit yourselves to the all-natural sound? Honk once
  for YES\, honk twice for HELL YES.\nTicket Tier Info:General Admission Ti
 ckets – Standing Room Only\nFor accommodated seating\, please email cont
 act@thunderbirdmusichall.com in advance after ticket purchase. All sales 
 are final. 
LOCATION:Thunderbird Music Hall
