DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/the-seven-wonders-a-tribut
 e-to-fleetwood-mac-isecjf\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents The Seven Wonde
 rs: A Tribute to Fleetwood Mac live on Saturday\, August 1st\, at 7:30 PM(
 opens in a new tab)\, part of a multi-show series. View all their Pittsbur
 gh dates and times here!(opens in a new tab)(opens in a new tab)The Seven 
 Wonders: A Tribute to Fleetwood Mac & Stevie Nicks celebrates the timeless
  music of Fleetwood Mac and Stevie Nicks with powerful performances and un
 forgettable energy. Named after the Fleetwood Mac classic “Seven Wonders
 \,” this talented tribute band delivers authentic renditions of beloved 
 hits including “Dreams\,” “Go Your Own Way\,” “Rhiannon\,” “
 Landslide\,” “Gypsy\,” and “Edge of Seventeen.”With passionate m
 usicianship and spot-on harmonies\, The Seven Wonders reconnect audiences 
 with the songs that defined generations. Join us for an unforgettable even
 ing of live music\, wine\, and dining as the magic of Fleetwood Mac comes 
 to life on stage.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide 
