 7\n It's a special PRIDE edition of DOLLAR MONDAY!  The show is still free
 \, The beer is still $1*\, just like we do the first Monday of every month
 \, but this time we've got three local drag queens performing for you on s
 tage!  featuring TESS TICKLES ZION GRINDR SHELLY LONGLEGS  SPONSORED BY HE
