BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Coven
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260611T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260611T200000
DTSTAMP:20260520T180314Z
UID:2c2adf34-5476-11f1-b83e-4e0f19fff5ec
DESCRIPTION:t8b5qidlbjqs4ma91iq943ojac_R20251212T000000@google.com\nJoin th
 e Queer Witches for their monthly meet-up! This month they'll be talking a
 bout protection magick. Check the discord server to see where the meet-up 
 is happening! \n\nEvery 2nd Thursday we gather\, share our ups and downs 
 from the previous month and what we're looking forward to\, and learn a ne
 w skill together! \nThis event is 21+\n\nThis is a program by the Queer R
 esource Center\, Millvale\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.co
