DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/rick-sebak-50-s-anniversary-screening
 -july-07-2026-703569\nPittsburgh legend and longtime Friend of Bottlerocke
 t RICK SEBAK is celebrating 50 years in public television this summer\, an
 d we are so honored to celebrate him this July with a career spanning cele
 bration of his work - featuring clips\, outtakes\, stories\, and more with
