BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Solya — POSTPONED
DTSTART:20260606T000000Z
DTEND:20260606T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260523T000151Z
UID:99a75cb6-563a-11f1-ab40-6a4e58fe1824
DESCRIPTION:https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/event/solya-postponed/thunderb
 ird-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nSolya\nwith Tele Novella 
 A message from Solya: \n \nI am so sorry but my ‘queen of north americ
 a’ tour is being rescheduled due to unforeseen medical issues. we though
 t I’d recover in time\, and I was trying to push through for y’all\, b
 ut I ended up in the hospital again. the doctors have told me I can’t pe
 rform right now because I’m very weak and my throat is swollen to the po
 int where I’m physically unable to sing.We’re already working on new d
 ates for august/september. if you already bought tickets\, please hold ont
 o them for now while we sort everything out with the new dates and venues.
  we’ll have updated information for you next week. and of course\, if yo
 u can’t make the new dates\, refunds will be available at your original 
 point of purchase.Thank you for being patient with me. I’m so sorry for 
 letting you down. I can’t wait to be back and sing with you all once I
 ’ve healed. I love you so much and I promise I’ll make it up to you wh
 en I’m back.-Solya 
LOCATION:Thunderbird Music Hall
END:VEVENT
