BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SoleTies Live: The R&B Conversation & Crafts Experience
DTSTART:20260918T233000Z
DTEND:20260919T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260526T200612Z
UID:57c31752-593e-11f1-ab40-6a4e58fe1824
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/soleties-live-the-rb-conve
 rsation-crafts-experie-ucady9\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents SoleTies Li
 ve: The R&B Conversation & Crafts Experience live on Friday\, September 18
 th\, at 7:30 PM(opens in a new tab)!After two sold-out nights\, SoleTies L
 ive is returning to Pittsburgh. Guided by the SoleTies card game\, SoleTie
 s Live is an immersive experience that blends the soulful atmosphere of a 
 classic R&B night with the intimacy of a “paint and sip\,” this event 
 invites guests into a space where art\, music\, and meaningful conversatio
 n collide. Think traditional game night reinvented\, into a guided convers
 ation and craft experience.Attendees will design a custom sneaker sole rep
 lica inspired by their personal stories\, prompted by the thought-provokin
 g questions from the SoleTies card game. As R&B fills the room\, guests wi
 ll reflect\, share\, and connect in ways that are creative\, soulful\, and
  deeply human.SoleTies is a conversation card game rooted in emotional wel
 lness and artistic expression\, designed to help people bond through story
 telling and creativity. This live experience brings it to life offering a 
 night of community\, vulnerability\, and lasting memories\, with everyone 
 walking away with their own personal keepsake.Dine At Your Show(opens in a
  new tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service directly to your ta
 ble in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relaxed experience\, 
 arrive early and enjoy a meal in our restaurant before the show. When dini
 ng in the restaurant\, reservations are encouraged and can be made via Res
 y starting one month before the show. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens 
 in a new tab)Wine At Your Table(opens in a new tab)Reserve your preferred 
 wine by filling out this form(opens in a new tab) and have a bottle waitin
 g at your table when you arrive at your show. No more waiting for your fir
 st drink! We will save your wine preference and have a bottle at your tabl
 e for all future shows. When you want to change your wine\, come back to t
 his form and update your preference.2-item Per Person Encouraged(opens in 
 a new tab)🎶  While we do not require a two-item food or beverage minimu
 m\, we strongly encourage it. Most ticket revenue goes directly to the art
 ist and production costs\, so food and drink purchases help support the st
