BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Acousticafe Songwriter Series
DTSTART:20260717T230000Z
DTEND:20260718T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260526T210153Z
UID:1f81fe64-5946-11f1-ab40-6a4e58fe1824
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/acousticafe-songwriter-series-14/\n
 Kylie Koch and the Troubadour of Good Trouble (Art D) will join together o
 n Friday\, July 17th to celebrate the Troubadour’s LXX birthday - Yikes!
  The celebration starts at 7 PM and will include several surprise guests 
 …. Stay tuned!!!Kylie Koch is a Pittsburgh based indie-folk artist whose
  music combines Americana\, singer-songwriter\, blues and rock influences.
  Her work pairs storytelling lyrics with haunting melodies to paint pictur
 es of the tales that have inspired her work. Her debut EP is currently in 
 progress and is set to launch within the next year.Troubadour of Good Trou
 ble is a Pittsburgh based singer-songwriter who presents a combination of 
 original social justice topical tunes and introspective\, narrative lyrics
  reflecting his nearly seven decades of life on the planet. The Troubadour
 ’s earliest musical influences include Bob Dylan\, Pete Seeger\, Joan Ba
 ez\, Woody Guthrie and John Prine offered with a modern edge.This Event Is
  All Ages
LOCATION:Mr. Smalls Cafe
END:VEVENT
