 ith a whole season of reality TV - we're skipping straight to the messiest
  part\; the Reunion Episode. Flashback to all the juciest moments of the s
 eason\, hear from the hero's\, get the villians side of the story\, and wa
 tch the host be as catty as possible - all inspired by suggestions from th
 e audience and brought to life on the spot by the finest improvisors at UC
 B Pittsburgh.  The villa is open\, Join us for this LOVE ISLAND Edition an
 d see the season reunion before the season has really started - full of lo
 ve\, lust\, and lots of drama - all crammed into roughly an hour of improv
 .   PLUS a special opening set by more UCBurgh Faculty & Friends - perform
 ing the Harold! 
