 n-jazz-party-brunch-9qoeav\nCity Winery Pittsburgh & MCG Jazz present Hugo
  Cruz and Caminos: Cuban Jazz Party Brunch live on Saturday\, July 11th\, 
 at 12:00 PM(opens in a new tab)!Hugo Cruz & Caminos deliver a vibrant and 
 contemporary celebration of Afro-Cuban music\, blending the rhythms and me
 lodies of Cuba with jazz\, funk\, rock\, R&B\, and more. Led by Cuban-born
 \, award-winning drummer\, composer\, and educator Hugo Cruz\, the ensembl
 e creates an original sound that honors traditional Cuban forms while push
 ing them into exciting new territory.A graduate of Cuba’s prestigious In
 stituto Superior de Artes\, Cruz has performed around the world and earned
  recognition for his dynamic musicianship\, including being named Best Dru
 mmer at Havana’s Festival del Tambor Guillermo Barreto in Memoriam. His 
 group\, Caminos\, has appeared at notable venues and festivals including t
 he Smithsonian Museum\, Pittsburgh International Jazz Festival\, Carnegie 
 Museum\, and Fábrica de Artes in Havana.Drawing from their acclaimed reco
 rdings Punto de Partida and Figure It Out\, Hugo Cruz & Caminos bring audi
 ences an energetic and immersive live experience filled with infectious rh
 ythms\, exceptional musicianship\, and the rich cultural traditions of Cub
 a. Join us for an unforgettable evening of live music\, wine\, and dining 
 as Caminos takes you on a musical journey without borders.À la carte brun
 ch is not included in the ticket price and is a separate charge.Dine At Yo
