 ings Joni’s timeless catalog to life with passion\, authenticity\, and m
 usical depth.Fronted by the expressive vocals of Teresa Lorenço\, the ban
 d captures the beauty\, emotion\, and nuance that have made Mitchell one o
 f the most influential songwriters of all time. More than a tribute\, Big 
 Yellow Taxi offers an immersive musical journey through some of Joni’s m
 ost beloved and powerful songs\, honoring her legacy while creating a movi
 ng live experience all their own.Join us for an unforgettable evening of l
 ive music\, wine\, and dining as Big Yellow Taxi explores the genius of Jo
 ni Mitchell through soaring vocals\, exceptional musicianship\, and songs 
