DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/mr-professor-and-friends-1
 kxllz\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Pour Decisions with The Professor- 
 Music\, Comedy and GenX consequences live on Saturday\, September 5th\, at
  9:30 PM! View all Pittsburgh dates and times here!(opens in a new tab)Wit
 h an infectious love for comedy\, music\, and connecting with people\, “
 The Professor” Nick Harrison has built a loyal following by bringing joy
 \, laughter\, and unforgettable energy everywhere he goes. Known for his l
 arger-than-life personality and feel-good performances\, Nick blends music
 \, humor\, storytelling\, and crowd interaction into an experience that’
 s as soulful as it is entertaining.Nick has appeared on NBC's Hot Wheels U
 ltimate Challenge and WWE's The Bump\, and a national comedy tour\, showca
 sing the charisma and passion that have made him a standout personality bo
 th on screen\, in-person and online. After retiring from a 15-year career 
 in education\, “The Professor” turned his focus toward creating conten
 t and live experiences designed to make people smile and bring communities
  together.From spontaneous grocery store jam sessions and singalongs in th
 e car to Gen X comedy\, wrestling-style entrances\, yacht rock vibes\, and
  soulful classics\, no two performances are ever the same. Proudly rooted 
 in Louisiana culture and hospitality\, Nick delivers a one-of-a-kind show 
 full of heart\, humor\, music\, and surprise moments audiences won’t for
 get.Welcome to Green Room Sessions with The Professor — where good music
 \, good laughs\, good vibes and good friends always take center stage.The 
 details for the upgrade add-on are still being confirmed with the artist. 
 It could take place pre-show or post-show and at this time it is also uncl
 ear how long it will be. We will provide further information here as soon 
 as we have it. If you purchase the upgrade we will email the information t
 o you as well.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide foo
