 se of optimism. The Dallas-born singer-songwriter transforms life’s defi
 ning moments\, from growing pains to unforgettable memories\, into uplifti
 ng anthems that resonate with listeners around the world.With more than 46
 6 million streams and viral hits including “see you later (ten years)\,
 ” “It Is What It Is\,” and “Roses\,” Jenna has emerged as a powe
 rful new voice in pop. Her breakout success has earned praise from major o
 utlets\, performances on national stages\, and collaborations with artists
  including Joshua Bassett and Aodhán King.Now\, as she prepares for the r
 elease of her highly anticipated debut album Jeans\, Boys & Jesus\, Jenna 
 continues to showcase the heartfelt storytelling and irresistible hooks th
 at have fueled her meteoric rise. Join us for an unforgettable evening of 
 live music\, wine\, and dining as Jenna Raine brings her uplifting songs a
 nd magnetic stage presence to City Winery.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new
  tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service directly to your table 
 in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relaxed experience\, arri
 ve early and enjoy a meal in our restaurant before the show. When dining i
 n the restaurant\, reservations are encouraged and can be made via Resy st
 arting one month before the show. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens in a
  new tab)Wine At Your Table(opens in a new tab)Reserve your preferred wine
  by filling out this form(opens in a new tab) and have a bottle waiting at
