SUMMARY:SHANNON SHAW BAND
DTSTART:20260801T000000Z
DTEND:20260801T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260603T040159Z
UID:f8695d52-5f00-11f1-84e8-8610f2635b81
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/shannon-shaw-band-july-31-2026-691749
 \n  SHANNON SHAW BAND with support from GEORGIA MAQ  $22 ADV / $25 DOS 7PM
  DOORS / 8PM MUSIC ALL AGES  for fans of... Shannon & The Clams\, La Luz\,
  Being Dead\, Nancy Sinatra  BIO: Powerhouse singer and bassist Shannon Sh
 aw released her acclaimed solo debut\, Shannon in Nashville\, in 2018 on E
 asy Eye Sound. Produced by Dan Auerbach\, the album showcased Shaw’s soa
 ring\, soul-baring vocals through a cinematic blend of vintage pop\, count
 ry soul\, and heartbreak balladry.  Since its release\, Shaw has toured in
 ternationally in support of the album\, including dates opening for John P
 rine and touring alongside Neko Case. She has also remained a constant pre
 sence onstage with her celebrated bands Shannon and the Clams and Hunx and
  His Punx.  The album was hailed by numerous publications\, with Pitchfork
  describing it as “a diamond” that “sounds like Roy Orbison and his 
 musicians lost in the Brill Building.”   
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
