 gust 14\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, Pittsburgh\, PA 
 Doors @ 7PMShow @ 8PMAGE RESTRICTION: 21+https://terrapinflyer.com\nNow ce
 lebrating over 25 years of touring\, Terrapin Flyer widely considered one 
 of the best Grateful Dead bands.  Over their history previous tours often
  included former members of the Grateful Dead and Jerry Garcia Band. Curre
 ntly they tour with the amazing lead guitarist Josh Olken.  Recently they
  performed with Derek Trucks who played Garcia’s Tiger guitar with them.
   A February Europe Tour garnered significant international attention for
  the band.  Overall\, Terrapin Flyer is a talented and highly regarded ba
 nd that has made a significant impact on the music scene.  \nTicket Tier
  Info:General Admission Tickets – Standing Room Only\nFor accessible sea
 ting accommodations\, please send an email in advance to contact@thunderbi
 rdmusichall.com after ticket purchase. All sales are final. 
