BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Frozen Movie Sing-Along Brunch
DTSTART:20260726T160000Z
DTEND:20260726T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260609T200149Z
UID:0d247960-643e-11f1-a3ea-ae4281c53881
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/frozen-movie-sing-along-br
 unch-285xkj\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents  Frozen Movie Sing-Along Brun
 ch live on Sunday\, July 26th at 12:00 PM(opens in a new tab)!Get ready to
  cool down “In Summer” at the magical Frozen Movie Sing-Along Brunch a
 t City Winery Pittsburgh!Join us for a cozy\, family-friendly morning cele
 brating Disney’s Frozen with a full sing-along screening of the film tha
 t invites everyone to belt out their favorite songs right alongside Anna\,
  Elsa\, Olaf\, Kristoff\, and Sven.Costumes are encouraged\, so come dress
 ed to impress and get ready to sing your heart out. Enjoy our delicious br
 unch while following Anna on her epic journey to find Elsa after an accide
 ntal burst of magic leaves the kingdom trapped in an eternal winter. Along
  the way\, you'll encounter lovable snowmen\, rugged ice harvesters\, rein
 deer sidekicks\, and one of Disney's most beloved stories about sisterhood
 \, courage\, and embracing who you are. With a special themed kids menu\, 
 a dance floor to groove along to the iconic songs we all know\, and fun fo
 r the whole family\, what’s not to love? So warm up those vocal cords\, 
 gather the kiddos (and kids at heart!)\, and join us for a brunch that's w
 orth melting for.No live princesses will be in attendance for this event.
 À la carte brunch is not included in the ticket price and is a separate c
 harge.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food and be
 verage service directly to your table in the venue. Or\, for an expanded m
