 l-concert-experience-oz79bk\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents  Glass Houses
 : The Billy Joel Concert Experience live on Thursday\, August 6th at 7:30 
 PM(opens in a new tab)!Glass Houses: A Tribute to Billy Joel celebrates th
 e music and legacy of one of America’s most beloved singer-songwriters\,
  Billy Joel. Named after Joel’s iconic 1980 album\, Glass Houses deliver
 s an authentic concert experience that captures the energy\, spirit\, and 
 timeless appeal of his legendary live performances.Performed by a group of
  seasoned musicians with a deep appreciation for Joel’s music\, the band
  brings beloved classics like “Piano Man\,” “Only the Good Die Young
 \,” “You May Be Right\,” and “Scenes from an Italian Restaurant”
  to life\, alongside fan-favorite deep cuts from across his celebrated cat
 alog. With exceptional musicianship and a passion for the material\, Glass
  Houses recreates the songs that have become the soundtrack to generations
 .Join us for an unforgettable evening of live music\, wine\, and dining as
  Glass Houses pays tribute to the Piano Man and the enduring songs that co
 ntinue to resonate with audiences around the world.Dine At Your Show(opens
