SUMMARY:The Wellermen
DTSTART:20260921T233000Z
DTEND:20260922T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260609T200149Z
UID:0d30871e-643e-11f1-a3ea-ae4281c53881
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/the-wellermen-p7yzfp\nCity
  Winery Pittsburgh presents The Wellermen live on Monday\, September 21st\
 , at 7:30 PM(opens in a new tab)!The Wellermen first captured global atten
 tion in 2021\, when their viral sea shanty performances helped spark the w
 orldwide “Wellerman” phenomenon\, generating billions of views and lea
 ding to appearances at The BRIT Awards and on The Late Show with Stephen C
 olbert. What began as a digital moment has since evolved into a fully real
 ised transatlantic live band with a devoted global fanbase. They mix the E
 ast Coast folk sensibilities of basses Bobby Waters and Luke Taylor (Bosto
 n and Pennsylvania) with the British musicianship of Jonny Stewart and Seb
  Payne\, and the theatrical energy of Sam Pope\, who starred in the West E
 nd. Blending American East Coast folk roots with British musicianship and 
 theatrical performance energy\, The Wellermen have expanded beyond their s
 hanty origins into a broader folk sound while maintaining the powerful fiv
 e-part harmonies that define them. Central to their identity is their rare
  dual-bass vocal foundation\, creating a depth and richness that sets them
  apart in modern folk. With their EP 1778 and upcoming original material\,
  The Wellermen are moving confidently into their next chapter — honourin
 g traditional roots music while building a contemporary folk sound centred
  on harmony\, story telling and connection.Dine At Your Show(opens in a ne
 w tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service directly to your table
  in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relaxed experience\, arr
 ive early and enjoy a meal in our restaurant before the show. When dining 
 in the restaurant\, reservations are encouraged and can be made via Resy s
 tarting one month before the show. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens in 
 a new tab)Wine At Your Table(opens in a new tab)Reserve your preferred win
 e by filling out this form(opens in a new tab) and have a bottle waiting a
