DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/yinz-might-know-w-edgar-snyder-july-3
 0-2026-715971\n Chad Medved has been interviewing notable figures througho
 ut Pittsburgh for the last 8.5 years. With over 315 episodes of I'LL CALL.
  YOU RIGHT BACK podcast\, he has made it his goal to help tell the story b
 ehind the people that make our city what it is. And now he is bringing his
  show to the stage in a new format!  ‘YINZ MIGHT KNOW’ is a live\, lon
 g-form interview show where Chad sits down with a special guest and talks 
 with them about their life and how they got to where they are today! On Ju
 ly 30th\, Chad invites you to come and enjoy a conversion with the one and
  only\, Edgar Snyder!  If you live in Western Pennsylvania\, you most like
 ly know Attorney Edgar Snyder's face from television commercials or billbo
 ards\, pointing his finger and saying\, "There's never a fee\, unless we g
 et money for you!" But what you probably don't know is how he became the m
 ost recognizable injury lawyer in the region.  Join us for an evening of s
 tories\, conversation\, and a chance to get to know the man behind one of 
 Pittsburgh’s most famous faces. 
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
