BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jimbo Jackson & Jason Caliguri
DTSTART:20260717T220000Z
DTEND:20260717T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260610T170214Z
UID:20e49cfe-64ee-11f1-a3ea-ae4281c53881
DESCRIPTION:https://pittsburghwinery.com/event/jimbo-jackson-jason-caliguri
 -5/\n\n\nThe Original Pittsburgh Winery Presents Jimbo Jackson & Jason Cal
 iguri LIVE in The Tasting Room!\nDOORS AT 4PM | SHOW AT 5PM | 21 AND OVER\
 n \nNo Presale tickets ~ A $5 Live Music Charge will be added to your bil
 l.\nAbout Jimbo Jackson: WEBSITE\nThis singer/songwriter was the longtime 
 frontman and founder of Pittsburgh’s award-winning band “Jimbo and the
  Soupbones”. Jimbo has a larger-than-life\, soulful voice and his charm
  is infectious.\nJimbo crosses musical genres without apology\, resulting 
 in a fresh\, yet familiar blend of funk\, rock\, soul and blues that exclu
 des no listener. He offers both original music and soulful\, stripped-down
  covers of the songs that you forgot you loved as well as current classics
 .\nThe show features this multi-instrumentalist and his looping system.  
 Whether the crowd needs soft acoustic tones for an intimate performance or
  craving that full band sound with a small footprint\, Jimbo is your go-to
  maestro. Passion\, charisma\, and an unwavering love for people and music
  are all woven into every note of Jimbos performance. The authentic comedy
  serves as a bonus to an already magnificent show.\nIf you’re lucky\, yo
 u’ll catch him (or bok him!) with his longtime musical brother and guita
 rist Jason Caliguri. Jason is an accomplished and award-winning guitarist 
 with touch\, feel\, tone and energy to match anything that the performance
  needs. His technical mastery of the instrument is evident\, and his quick
 -witted comebacks serve as the perfect complement to Jimbo’s\, sometimes
  off-script nature.\n\n
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Winery
END:VEVENT
