BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Max Niemann // Clear Creek SP // Reliable Child
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260805T200000
DTSTAMP:20260616T020616Z
UID:f54f23a0-6927-11f1-a576-ae4281c53881
DESCRIPTION:https://www.poetrymillvale.com/event/max-niemann/\nThere’s a 
 type of artist that doesn’t just play songs – they collect them\, test
 -drive them\, stretch them\, condense them\, and send them back out howeve
 r they’re meant to be. Max Niemann belongs in that category. \nAt the he
 art of it all is a six-string guitar\, a harmonica rack\, and a catalog of
  songs that feel lived-in – whether it’s a front porch blues or a spra
 wling piece of electric alchemy. Niemann’s lyrics hold tight to a timele
 ss human experience – broken-down characters\, doubts\, responsibilities
  – but they’re carried by dynamic arrangements. Old-time chord changes
  collide with art rock tension. It’s music that honors the lineage of Am
 erican roots while insisting that there’s more roads for it to wander do
 wn.  \nMax Niemann isn’t trying to revive anything\, he’d rather chas
 e the same spirit that animated his mentors – drawing from deep wells an
 d crossing borders in the meantime.
LOCATION:Poetry Lounge
END:VEVENT
