  Earth\, Wind & Fire a global phenomenon.Featuring soulful vocals\, dynami
 c horn arrangements\, a funky rhythm section\, and engaging crowd interact
 ion\, Let’s Groove Tonight captures the spirit of the legendary band's l
 ive performances. Audiences can expect an evening filled with timeless hit
 s\, dazzling costume changes\, and nonstop energy that will have everyone 
 singing\, dancing\, and celebrating from start to finish.Having performed 
 across the country and appeared as a featured act during Super Bowl festiv
 ities in Miami Beach\, Let’s Groove Tonight brings a world-class tribute
  experience to the stage. Join us for an unforgettable evening of live mus
