DTEND:20260808T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260616T190209Z
UID:e0417696-69b5-11f1-b066-1a6850566a13
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/roger-humphries-presents-a
 -jazz-celebration-for--0ym7hb\nCity Winery Pittsburgh & Roger Humphries pr
 esent a Jazz Celebration for Bill Strickland live on Saturday\, August 8th
 \, at 12:00 PM(opens in a new tab)!Roger Humphries: A Tribute to Bill Stri
 ckland brings together jazz excellence\, community\, and celebration for a
  truly special afternoon of music. A legendary drummer\, bandleader\, and 
 educator\, Roger Humphries has spent more than six decades shaping the sou
 nd of jazz\, performing alongside icons such as Ray Charles and Stanley Tu
 rrentine while inspiring generations of musicians through his artistry and
  mentorship.This heartfelt performance honors the life and legacy of Bill 
 Strickland\, the visionary founder of Manchester Craftsmen’s Guild and r
 ecipient of the MacArthur “Genius” Award\, whose impact on Pittsburgh
 ’s cultural landscape continues to be felt today.Backed by an all-star e
 nsemble\, Humphries will perform a selection of music inspired by some of 
 Bill’s favorite artists\, including Ahmad Jamal\, Ray Brown\, and Cal Tj
 ader. Join us for an afternoon of soul\, swing\, and remembrance as we cel
 ebrate a remarkable friendship and a legacy that continues to inspire.A la
  carte Brunch is not included in the ticket price and is a separate charge
 .Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverag
 e service directly to your table in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu a
