BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Daley
DTSTART:20260924T233000Z
DTEND:20260925T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260616T190209Z
UID:e0453c0e-69b5-11f1-b066-1a6850566a13
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/daley-s0jyje\nCity Winery 
 Pittsburgh presents Daley live on Thursday\, September 24th\, at 7:30 PM(o
 pens in a new tab)!Daley brings his unmistakable voice and deeply personal
  songwriting to City Winery Pittsburgh for an intimate evening of contempo
 rary soul. The acclaimed British singer-songwriter has earned internationa
 l recognition for his seamless blend of classic soul\, alternative R&B\, a
 nd genre-defying artistry\, establishing himself as one of the most distin
 ctive voices of his generation.With Billboard-charting releases\, Grammy r
 ecognition\, and collaborations alongside icons including Stevie Wonder an
 d Pharrell Williams\, Daley has built a career rooted in authenticity\, vu
 lnerability\, and emotional connection. He doesn’t simply perform\, he i
 nvites audiences into the stories behind the songs\, creating a live exper
 ience that feels both powerful and deeply personal.There’s no better set
 ting for that connection than City Winery Pittsburgh\, where every note\, 
 lyric\, and soaring falsetto can be experienced up close. As Daley ushers 
 in a new era with music from his highly anticipated upcoming album\, audie
 nces can expect an unforgettable night of soul\, storytelling\, and world-
 class musicianship. Pair the evening with exceptional wine and dining and 
 experience one of contemporary soul’s most compelling artists in the per
 fect setting.(opens in a new tab)Optional Add-On: Daley Meet & Greet Packa
 geEarly entry into the venueExclusive Meet & Greet with DaleyPersonal phot
 o with DaleyAccess to an intimate pre-show Q&A with DaleyExclusive lavende
