 weekend-passes/thunderbird-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nBla
 ckseed Services and Thunderbird presentsDescendants of Crom VII\nSaturday\
 , September 11 and 12th\, 2026\nThunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\,
  Pittsburgh\, PA\nAGE RESTRICTION: All Ages\n \nPresented by Blackseed Se
 rvices in partnership with Thunderbird Cafe & Music Hall\nFor nearly a dec
 ade\, Descendants of Crom has brought together fans and artists from acros
 s the heavy underground for a weekend dedicated to doom\, sludge\, psych\,
  black metal\, post-metal\, and the darker edges of heavy music.\nFounded 
