 cendants of Crom has continually sought to bring both revered underground 
 artists and emerging voices to Pittsburgh while helping foster a thriving 
 regional heavy music community.\nBuilt through a DIY spirit and presented 
 with a professional approach\, Descendants of Crom has become a destinatio
 n for those who value authenticity\, atmosphere\, and the shared experienc
 e of underground music.\nDescendants of Crom VIII returns to Thunderbird C
 afé & Music Hall on September 11 & 12\, 2026 for two days of immersive at
 mosphere\, crushing volume\, and unforgettable performances. 
LOCATION:Thunderbird Music Hall
