 1975) The second feature will remain a SECRET until June 22nd. \n\nSunda
 y\, July 26\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, Pittsburgh\, 
 PADoors @ 5pmFilms @ 6pmAGE RESTRICTION: 18+ or with legal guardian\n\nSEC
 RET SINEMA\n@Secret.sinema is celebrating summer with a screening of Steve
 n Spielberg’s JAWS (1975). Over 50 years later\, the film that made us a
 fraid to go into the water still packs a punch.Grab a ticket and enjoy thi
 s classic with a concert-venue sound system and the community of a movie c
 lub. Plus\, if you want to grab a beer halfway through the movie\, you won
 ’t even have to leave the “movie theater”.\n \nFun stuff at this ev
 ent:– Vintage Media Market featuring @vinegarsyndrome.pgh + @hit.reset.p
 gh + @steal_city_vintage\n– Free Movie Popcorn provided by Pittsburgh P
 opcorn (specialty popcorn available for purchase)– Flash tattoos availa
 ble from @sinnersandsaintstattoopgh.– Limited Edition Posters by @rudy_i
 llustrations available for purchase.– Raffle prizes provided by @3floyds
 brewing\n\n \n\n \nTicket Tier Info: General Admission Tickets Seated 
 Floor and Lower Balcony\nThere are no additional entry protocols at this
  time. Entry requirements are subject to change. By purchasing tickets to 
 this event you agree to abide by entry requirements in effect at the tim
 e of the event. Check the venue website leading up to your event for the 
 latest protocols. Please visit https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/safety/ fo
 r more information on Covid-19 Safety. All sales are final. 
LOCATION:Thunderbird Music Hall
