SUMMARY:Kaye Baron
DTSTART:20260723T220000Z
DTEND:20260723T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260621T180148Z
UID:45c1a8f4-6d9b-11f1-9da2-56cf97c794d5
DESCRIPTION:https://pittsburghwinery.com/event/kaye-baron/\n\n\nThe Origina
 l Pittsburgh Winery presents Kaye Baron LIVE in The Tasting Room!\n*No pre
 sale tickets for this event ~ a $5 live music charge will be added to your
  bill. \n\nDOORS AT 4PM | SHOW AT 5PM | 21 AND OVER\n*This is a general a
 dmission event. There is plenty of seating available. But it is first come
 \, first serve and is therefore not guaranteed. \nAbout Kaye Baron: WEBS
 ITE | INSTAGRAM | LISTEN\nKaye Baron is a Seattle-born\, Pittsburgh-based 
 singer-songwriter with an acoustic guitar-driven sound rooted in emotion\,
  melody\, and lived experience. A former U.S. Coast Guard helicopter searc
 h-and-rescue technician turned electrical engineer\, Kaye draws from the r
 aw edge of Nirvana\, the intricate musicianship of Dave Matthews Band\, an
 d the timeless melodic sense of The Beatles. His music aims to turn a full
  life of experience into songs that feel honest\, direct\, and human.\n\n
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Winery
END:VEVENT
