DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/mark-normand-thursday-early-august-27
 -2026-672850\n  Dubbed by Jerry Seinfeld as the “best young up and comin
 g comic\,” Mark Normand is quickly becoming one of the most talked about
  touring comedians on the scene. Normand’s NEW one- hour Netflix special
 \, SOUP TO NUTS\, has been a staple in the streamers’ Top Ten since its 
 July 25th premiere. This follows Normand’s self-released special\, 2020
 ’s “Out to Lunch” which amassed over 12 million views on YouTube. He
  also starred on Netflix’s Season 3 of The Stand Ups.   Why'd We Book It
 ? Excited to have the witty Mark Normand joining us this August. Mark is k
 nown for his fast talking mixed with puns\, one-liners\, and quick punchli
 nes which is why we like him. He is quick and to the point\, but still kee
 ps a high quality. From podcasts to late night appearances Mark has been i
 n the comedy world for years and has the receipts to back it up.   For Fan
 s Of... Gary Gulman\, Sam Morrill\, Nate Bargatze   Extended Bio: An extre
 mely prolific stand-up\, he previously had a one-hour and a half hour Come
 dy Central special and has made an unparalleled seven appearances on “Co
 nan\,” four appearances on “The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon\,” an
 d has also appeared on “The Late Show with Stephen Colbert.” Mark IS A
  FREQUENT GUEST ON “The Joe Rogan Experience\,” AND HOSTS his own podc
 asts “Tuesdays with Stories” and “We Might Be Drunk."    Seating/Sho
 w Information: This show will have theater seating. Seats will be assigned
