 acclaimed Showtime/A24 series ZIWE. He is currently the co-host of the Big
  Money Players podcasts StraightioLab. He has appeared on the series FANTA
 SMAS\, After Midnight\, Los Espooky’s\, Search Party\, ZIWE\, and The La
 te Show With Stephen Colbert. He voiced and created an original animated f
 eature MILLENNIAL HUNTER. Sam was selected as a member of the Comedy Centr
 al Digital Creators Program in 2020\, he performed at Comedy Central's Clu
 sterfest as part of their UpNext showcase\, and was named one of Vulture
 ’s Comics You Should and Will Know in 2021.   Why'd We Book It? Sam is a
  sweetheart on their podcast STRAIGHTIOLAB which we love for the guests an
 d for Sam's quirky hoting style bouncing off of George Civeris. There is a
 lways a laugh to be had with their guests from Caleb Hearon to D'Arcy Card
 en. If you haven't seen it - he is a totally normal guy on After Midnight 
 and we think you will love it just as much as we do. He totally can handle
