 ird-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nRend Collective\n \nWedne
 sday\, September 9\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall4053 Butler Street\, Pittsb
 urgh\, PADoors @ 7pmShow @ 8pmAGE RESTRICTION: All Ages\nhttps://rendcolle
 ctive.com/\nRend Collective is a Christian experimental\, folk rock\, wors
