BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lyndsey Smith & Big Jus w/ special guests Steeltown Horns & Deezil 
 Money
DTSTART:20260802T010000Z
DTEND:20260802T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260623T160157Z
UID:dcc3078e-6f1c-11f1-a280-9e9e635c43f9
DESCRIPTION:https://pittsburghwinery.com/event/lyndsey-smith-big-jus-w-spec
 ial-guests-steeltown-horns-deezil-money/\n\n\n\nThe Original Pittsburgh Wi
 nery Presents: Lyndsey Smith & Big Jus w/ special guests Steeltown Horns &
  Deezil Money!\n \nDoors at 7PM | Show at 8PM | 21 and over\n$30 Advance 
 / $35 Day of show [+ Tax/Fees]\n\nDOORS AT 7PM | SHOW AT 8PM | 21 AND OVER
 \n\n \nAbout Big Jus:\nFACEBOOK | INSTAGRAM | LISTEN\nJustin Short\, bett
 er known as Big Jus\, can be seen as a pioneer in the Pittsburgh area hip-
 hop scene. He had many notable releases in the 90s\, which landed him the 
 recognition of rapper Sam Sneed and eventually led him to California\, and
  a working relationship with Death Row Records. The two went on to record\
 , and create music while on the West Coast\, however business discrepancie
 s with Death Row prevented the material from seeing the light of day. Afte
 r learning a lot from the experience Big Jus decided to take a break from 
 the music industry (READ MORE).\n\n\n \nAbout Lyndsey Smith:FACEBOOK | IN
 STAGRAM | LISTEN\nIf Rock ‘n’ Roll and Soul music got together and had
  a baby\, award-winning vocalist Lyndsey Smith would be their golden child
 . Having a voice that genuinely comes from pain and triumph\, Lyndsey upli
 fts and transforms listeners’ ears and spirits alike. Rightfully dubbed 
 “The Goddaughter of Soul”\, Lyndsey pulls influence from artists like 
 Etta James\, Aretha Franklin\, Stevie Wonder\, and Whitney Houston.  Her 
 energy on stage is electric leaving each member of the audience captivated
  and yearning for more. Lyndsey Smith delivers powerhouse vocals\, sultry 
 performances\, and personality alike\, every time\, leaving a moment that 
 is never to be forgotten.\n\n
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Winery
END:VEVENT
