 nd Ben DeWitt in early 2018. In their tenure\, the group has boasted many 
 fan-favorite releases including “Keep Two-Stepping\,” their debut albu
 m Where Will the Night Take Us?\, the most recent If We’re Pretending\
 , and much\, much more.Today\, Pretoria is based in Chicago\, IL and made 
 up of friends Rob Gullett\, Ben DeWitt\, Matt Burdick\, Trevor Sharnas\, a
 nd Braeden Janes. Full of endearing personalities\, Pretoria is exactly th
 e sort of DIY gem you want to catch live.\n \nTicket Tier Info:General Ad
