 p-demon-hunters-editio-qrneni\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents K-Pop Party
  Brunch: A Superfan Celebration on Sunday\, July 19th\, at 12:00pm!Celebra
 te all things K-Pop with us at City Winery Pittsburgh! Enjoy a delicious b
 runch while putting your K-Pop knowledge to the test in an afternoon packe
 d with music\, trivia\, and unforgettable fun. Come dressed in your favori
 te K-Pop-inspired attire and get ready to sing along to your most cherishe
 d anthems. You’ll get to meet your heroes\, cheer them on as they take t
 he stage for an epic live performance\, and dance the day away at our high
 -energy K-POP dance party. From trivia and singalongs to dazzling performa
 nces and fan-worthy moments\, this is the ultimate experience for devoted 
 stans and casual listeners alike. Grab your fellow fans\, warm up those vo
 cal cords\, and prepare for a celebration worthy of an encore. The pre-sho
 w  (11:30 AM) Meet and Greet Upgrade includes a photo on stage with the ic
 onic K-Pop trio themselves!À la carte brunch is not included in the ticke
 t price and is a separate charge.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽
