 e music videos. In the words of Jack Black\, “the thing about Wolves of 
 Glendale is… they sound f*cking fantastic.”   WoG’s debut full-lengt
 h studio album\, produced by Grammy award winning producers John Spiker (T
 enacious D) and Rian Lewis (Doja Cat) is available to stream everywhere no
