DESCRIPTION:https://pittsburghwinery.com/event/thecause-3/\n\n\nThe Origina
 l Pittsburgh Winery Presents: theCAUSE!\nDoors at 7PM | Show at 8PM | 21 a
 nd over\n$15 Advance // $20 Day of show [+Tax/Fees]\n*This is a general ad
 mission event. There is plenty of seating available. But it is first come\
 , first serve and is therefore not guaranteed. \nAbout theCAUSE:WEBSITE |
  FACEBOOK | INSTAGRAM | LISTEN\ntheCAUSE is a band consisting of 5 Pittsbu
 rgh musicians who have all been around the proverbial block. Playing tunes
  from Grateful Dead\, Phish\, The Beatles\, Bob Dylan and MORE\, including
  some very tasty originals\, theCAUSE packs a punch while still paying clo
 se attention to the delicate touch. The players are Eric “Pappy” Weing
 rad on guitar and vocals (Double Dose\, Reuben’s Painted Mandolin\, The 
 Ditch)\, David Tauberg on bass and vocals (Powers Run Band\, Hard to Handl
 e\, Cherylann Hawk)\, Mike South on drums (Left for Dead\, Sticky\, West P
 ark Road) and joining us in 2008\, Pittsburgh blues veteran Jill Paone Sim
 mons brings a whole new dimension to theCAUSE on vocals and continues to r
 ock with us today. Jill also fronts the all-female Dead band Brown Eyed Wo
 men. Michael Cerveris is our permanent part time member playing keyboards 
 (when he doesn’t have commitments with his other great band the Sun Cham
 ps).\n \ntheCAUSE also has had the pleasure in 2012 and 2014 of having gu
 itarist Steve Kimock join us on stage and\, for the past several years we
 ’ve had Jeff Mattson and Lisa Mackey from Dark Star Orchestra join us fo
 r our annual D-Jam benefit concert.\n\n
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Winery
END:VEVENT
