DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/minion-rave-july-17-2026-726688\n Say
  "BELLO" to our newest dance party... the MINION RAVE!   Party with Bob an
 d Kevin as resident DJ RODEO STARR spins 2000s throwback anthems\, Nostalg
 ia-core\, and Brainrot remixes accompanied by Minions visuals. Strap on yo
 ur best overalls and polish up your goggles for the COSTUME CONTEST where 
