 , the world’s first and only Mac Miller tribute band is known for their 
 captivating live performances\, thoughtful arrangements and heartfelt dedi
 cation to honoring Mac. The focus on authenticity and attention to detail 
 ensures that every note\, every lyric\, and every moment captures the esse
 nce of Mac Miller’s unique artistry. The incredibly talented lineup incl
 udes Marco Cirigliano on drums & musical director\, Noah Fense as the emce
 e\, Ryan Bauer of guitar & vocals\, Ben Chilbert on bass & Jesse Clayton o
 n synth. \nTicket Tier Info:General Admission Tickets – Standing Room O
 nly\nFor accessible seating accommodations\, please send an email in advan
 ce to contact@thunderbirdmusichall.com after ticket purchase. All sales ar
 e final. 
LOCATION:Thunderbird Music Hall
END:VEVENT
