BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fraternal Twin X ditch
DTSTART:20260816T233000Z
DTEND:20260817T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260709T150536Z
UID:a42f104c-7ba7-11f1-83f5-ba7a2e570787
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/ft-x-ditch/\nFraternal Twin: For To
 m Christie\, patience is the greatest virtue. You can hear this in the ent
 irety of the\ndecade-plus of music he’s made as Fraternal Twin\, but esp
 ecially in the band’s current lineup\, in\nwhich he’s joined by Marco 
 Spodek (drums)\, Mariah Houston (guitar)\, and Forrest Philpot\n(bass). Fr
 aternal Twin’s new album Halo Fell Forever is a product of this patient 
 approach.\nThe songs unfurl at a tectonic pace\, every shimmering guitar a
 nd vocal melody — no\nmatter how beautiful — creeps along glacially\, 
 the low end groaning and creaking under the\nweight of Christie’s existe
 ntial musings. Eventually amid the delicate swirling of these winding\npie
 ces\, they explode into distortion and noise. But for these moments of cla
 rity and catharsis\,\nyou’re going to have to wait.ditch: ditch is an em
 erging alternative rock and post-punk band based in Brooklyn\, New York. K
 nown for their gritty\, driving NYC underground sound\, they frequently pl
 ay local independent music venues like Sleepwalk NYC\, Cassette\, and Alph
 aville.This Event Is All AgesAll Sales Are Final.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
