DESCRIPTION:https://www.poetrymillvale.com/event/sister-paul-the-ramone/\nJ
 apanese punk sensation SISTER PAUL and THE RAMONE- A ONE MAN TRIBUTE BAND 
 are returning to the US for their second tour! \nSISTER PAUL’s Susumu an
 d Mackii make big noise for a duo– proving that “the family that plays
  together stays together.” For over 20 years\, Mackii’s hard-hitting d
 rumming has laid solid ground for Susumu’s unique bass sound run through
  multilayered pedal effects for a night of unforgettable psychedelic punk 
 rock ‘n roll. Performing original material and covers in Japanese and En
 glish\, their material overcomes language barriers\, proving music is inde
 ed the universal language. \n \nTHE RAMONE- A ONE MAN TRIBUTE BAND hails f
 rom Minneapolis\, and his unique stage show covers all your favorite Ramon
 es songs– audiences are encouraged to sing along. \n \nSISTER PAUL’s U
 S return is in celebration of their brand new 7” on the heels of an Aust
 ralian tour.
