DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/billy-price-band-brunch-g7
 0x87\nCity Winery presents Billy Price Band Brunch on Saturday\, August 15
 th at 12:00pm!Billy Price Band Brunch brings Pittsburgh’s own soul and b
 lues legend to the stage for a lively afternoon of unforgettable music and
  great dining. With a career spanning decades and more than 20 acclaimed r
 eleases\, Billy Price has earned national recognition for his powerful voc
 als\, soulful delivery\, and dedication to keeping classic rhythm and blue
 s alive.A Blues Music Award winner and longtime favorite of blues and soul
  fans\, Price continues to captivate audiences with his signature blend of
  heartfelt ballads\, deep grooves\, and high-energy performances. Backed b
 y the outstanding Billy Price Band\, he delivers a rich musical experience
  rooted in soul\, blues\, and R&B traditions.Join us for a special brunch 
 filled with live music\, delicious food\, and exceptional wine as Billy Pr
 ice and his band bring their timeless sound to City Winery Pittsburgh. Whe
 ther you're a longtime fan or discovering his music for the first time\, t
 his is the perfect way to spend an afternoon celebrating one of Pittsburgh
 ’s most beloved performers.À la carte brunch is not included in the tic
 ket price and is a separate charge.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)
 🍽️  We provide food and beverage service directly to your table in th
 e venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relaxed experience\, arrive ea
 rly and enjoy a meal in our restaurant before the show. When dining in the
  restaurant\, reservations are encouraged and can be made via Resy startin
 g one month before the show. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens in a new 
 tab)Wine At Your Table(opens in a new tab)Reserve your preferred wine by f
 illing out this form(opens in a new tab) and have a bottle waiting at your
  table when you arrive at your show. No more waiting for your first drink!
  We will save your wine preference and have a bottle at your table for all
  future shows. When you want to change your wine\, come back to this form 
 and update your preference.2-item Per Person Encouraged(opens in a new tab
 )🎶  While we do not require a two-item food or beverage minimum\, we st
 rongly encourage it. Most ticket revenue goes directly to the artist and p
 roduction costs\, so food and drink purchases help support the staff\, ser
 vice\, and atmosphere that make these intimate shows possible.The good new
 s: we think you’ll love the food and wine just as much as the show.Becom
 e a Vinofile Member(opens in a new tab)🍷  Members get 48 hour early acc
 ess to new shows\, pay no ticket fees\, and earn points to exchange for co
 mplimentary tickets. Vinofile Plus members also receive many wine benefits
 . Add a membership to your cart during checkout to start saving now. Alrea
 dy a member? Make sure you are signed in to access your benefits. Become a
  Vinofile Member and enjoy the benefits today.(opens in a new tab)(opens i
 n a new tab)(opens in a new tab)DateAug15Doors Open11:00 AMLocationCity Wi
 nery Pittsburgh1627 Smallman StreetPittsburgh 15222United States(opens in 
 a new tab)
LOCATION:City Winery Pittsburgh
