BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:PureSoul Presents Women of 90's R&B Brunch
DTSTART:20260816T160000Z
DTEND:20260816T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260711T000153Z
UID:b95229c2-7cbb-11f1-83f5-ba7a2e570787
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/puresoul-presents-women-of
 -90s-rb-brunch-86j66n\nCity Winery Pittsburgh & PureSoul present Women of 
 90's R&B Brunch live on Sunday\, August 16th\, at 12:00 PM(opens in a new 
 tab)!Step into the golden era of R&B as PureSoul Presents brings their vib
 rant Soul and R&B Brunch to City Winery Pittsburgh\, celebrating the women
  who defined a generation. This live tribute features the music of Mary J.
  Blige\, Brandy\, SWV\, and TLC\; artists whose voices\, style\, and story
 telling shaped the sound of the 90s.With a band of the best R&B musicians 
 in the Northeast\, alongside powerhouse vocals\, the show brings new life 
 to beloved hits while staying true to the emotion and groove that made the
 m iconic.  Pair the music with great food and wine\, and enjoy a Sunday af
