DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/live-band-karaoke-bingo-br
 unch-wqke0o\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Live Band Karaoke Bingo Brunc
 h hosted by Lead Singer Wanted live on Sunday\, August 30th at 12:00 PM(op
 ens in a new tab)!Welcome to the first ever Live Band Karaoke Bingo Brunch
 ! Every guest will receive a bingo card featuring songs from Lead Singer W
 anted's extensive setlist. You choose how you get involved: as a vocalist 
 leading the band\, or a fan of the group aiming for the top prize in bingo
 . Better yet\, do both! As performers take the stage to sing with the live
  band\, mark off each song you hear and race to complete your card for a c
 hance to win. Whether you're grabbing the mic or cheering from your seat\,
  you'll be singing along\, enjoying delicious brunch favorites\, and joini
 ng in on a one-of-a-kind interactive experience that's equal parts concert
  and karaoke. Lead Singer Wanted is Pittsburgh's original live band karaok
 e experience. Here's how it works: the stage has guitar\, bass\, drums\, a
 nd a backup vocalist... but no lead singer! That's where the audience come
 s in. Guests pick a song from a catalog of over 160 hits\, scan a QR code 
 to sign up\, and when their name is called\, they take the stage and sing 
 lead vocals with the band while the original music video plays on screen b
 ehind them.It's not karaoke with a backing track! Every note is played liv
 e\, and the band adapts to each singer in real time. Whether you're a show
 er singer or a secret rock star\, it's the most fun you'll have with a mic
 rophone. Over 7 years and 100+ shows\, LSW has performed everywhere from d
 ive bars to LiveNation's Star Lake Pavilion\, Pittsburgh Riverhounds FC ga
 mes\, Mr. Smalls Theatre\, and Jergel's Rhythm Grille. Every show ends wit
 h the Crowd Singalong\, where the whole audience is on stage together for 
 one last song! À la carte brunch is not included in the ticket price and 
 is a separate charge.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new tab)🍽️  We prov
