DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/emma-nissen-w3ssks\nCity W
 inery Pittsburgh presents Emma Nissen live on Thursday\, October 22nd\, at
  7:30 PM(opens in a new tab)!Emma Nissen is one of the fastest-rising voic
 es in jazz-pop\, captivating audiences with her signature blend of soulful
  vocals\, jazz improvisation\, and faith-inspired songwriting. The 25-year
 -old singer-songwriter first gained national attention when a video of her
  scatting on her original song “Breathe” went viral in late 2023\, lau
 nching what fans now affectionately call her “Jesus and Jazz” sound.Si
 nce then\, Emma has amassed more than 200 million views across social medi
 a and grown a devoted global following drawn to her timeless voice\, magne
 tic personality\, and authentic artistry. Her meteoric rise has earned rec
 ognition from artists including SZA\, Meghan Trainor\, Lauren Daigle\, and
  Queen Latifah. She was also invited by acclaimed producer Adam Blackstone
  to perform at New York’s legendary Blue Note\, leading to the collabora
 tion that produced her chart-topping single “Love Like You.”With the r
 elease of her new album Moved\, Emma continues to connect with audiences t
 hrough uplifting songs\, exceptional musicianship\, and unforgettable live
  performances. Join us for an intimate evening of live music\, wine\, and 
