BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Charge Ups’ “King for a Day” Album Release Royal Ball
DTSTART:20260913T000000Z
DTEND:20260913T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260713T150827Z
UID:b339bc72-7ecc-11f1-8a0d-6aee3c075612
DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/the-charge-ups/\nThe Charge Ups cap
 tivate audiences with infectious songs\, a swaggy wardrobe\, a hyper-energ
 y live show\, fun choreography\, and ingenious mashups.  The band “effor
 tlessly meshes metal riffs with pop-punk choruses” to electrify rock fan
 s of any persuasion.Originally formed in Pittsburgh\, PA as “Chip & The 
 Charge Ups” in 2018 by the unique family team of Chip Dominick & then 16
 -year old Maleena Dominick\, the band later added powerhouse drummer\, Nol
 an Allen\, to round out their thunderous sound.  Chip & The Charge Ups rel
 eased four albums between 2018 and 2023 and has been voted “Best Rock Ba
 nd” once\, “Best Punk Band” twice\, and “Best Alternative Band” 
 four times in the Iron City Rocks Pittsburgh Music Awards.The Charge Ups a
 re making 2026 their most ambitious year to date.  First\, by tweaking the
 ir name.  Second\, by sharing lead vocal duties somewhat equally between m
 embers of the trio.  And\, third\, by outdoing KISS with a simultaneous fo
 ur album release.  These albums include a solo album from each member plus
  the crown jewel of the collection\, “King for a Day” – the first al
 bum the band is releasing under the modified name\, The Charge Ups.  The C
 harge Ups are determined and poised to stand out as royalty among their po
 p-punk peers.This Event Is All AgesAll Sales Are Final.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
