 ing “Cowboy Jack Clementine” (2023) and creating countless media video
 s through her platforms on social media\, gaining her over millions of vie
 ws\, her sound and traditions began to be recognized: crowning her the nam
 e of “The Rose of Appalachia.”\nTicket Tier Info:General Admission Tic
