BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Marc Scibilia
DTSTART:20260924T000000Z
DTEND:20260924T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260714T140800Z
UID:6c2347a6-7f8d-11f1-8a0d-6aee3c075612
DESCRIPTION:https://thunderbirdmusichall.com/event/marc-scibilia/thunderbir
 d-cafe-music-hall/pittsburgh-pennsylvania/\n\nMarc Scibilia \nNo One Knows
  My Name Tour\n \nWednesday\, September 23\, 2026Thunderbird Music Hall40
 53 Butler Street\, Pittsburgh\, PADoors @ 7:00 pmShow @ 7:45 pmAGE RESTRIC
 TION: 18+ or with legal guardian\nhttps://www.marcscibilia.com\nMarc Scibi
 lia is an internationally acclaimed singer-songwriter whose music has amas
 sed more than 200 million streams worldwide. With a devoted social media f
 ollowing of over 3 million fans\, Marc sold out every date on his debut US
  headline tour in 2024 and repeated the feat on his 2025 More To This Worl
 d Tour\, performing sold-out shows across Europe\, the US and Canada. His 
 music has been certified gold and topped charts throughout Europe. Born an
 d raised in Buffalo\, New York\, Marc’s forthcoming work draws heavily f
 rom his hometown roots. Buffalo serves as both the backdrop and emotional 
 centerpiece of his recent singles “No One Knows My Name” and “By You
 r Side\,”two melancholic reflections on the blue-collar community that s
 haped him. His next studio album\, due in 2027\, further explores Marc’s
  distinctly American sound\, blending folk\, country\, alternative and pop
  into songs steeped in warmth\, nostalgia and emotional honesty. Marc’s 
 music has been featured in Shrinking\, Peter Rabbit\, Bones and About a Bo
 y\, alongside campaigns for brands including Jeep\, Chrysler\, Samsung and
  Water.org. Beyond his solo work\, he has built an extensive career as a s
 ongwriter and producer\, collaborating with artists including Teddy Swims\
 , Keith Urban\, Lainey Wilson\, Ian Munsick\, Robin Schulz\, Quinn XCII\, 
 Claptone\, Ingrid Andress\, Seal\, Ben Rector and Lennon Stella.  Marc re
 turns to the road in 2026 supporting Teddy Swims across major markets befo
 re launching his own global headlining tour later in the year.\nVIPTIER 1:
  VIP SOUNDCHECK EXPERIENCE \n\n\nOne General Admission ticket\nEarly venu
 e entry 30 minutes before general doors\nAcoustic song performance by Marc
 \nQ&A with Marc from the stage\nExclusive VIP merch item and autographed i
 tem distributed at entry\n\nTIER 2: BUS HANG VIP EXPERIENCE\n\nEverything 
 included in Tier 1\, plus… \nPriority early entry 60 minutes before Tie
 r 1 \n\nIntimate hang with Marc on his tour bus\n\n\nMarc shares an un
 released demo from his upcoming album\n\nIndividual photo with Marc\n1 pe
 rsonalized signed item per guest\n\nTicket Tier Info:General Admission Tic
 kets – Standing Room Only\nFor accessible seating accommodations\, pleas
 e send an email in advance to contact@thunderbirdmusichall.com after ticke
 t purchase. All sales are final. 
LOCATION:Thunderbird Music Hall
END:VEVENT
