SUMMARY:SHANNON SHAW BAND (OF SHANNON AND THE CLAMS)
DTSTART:20260801T000000Z
DTEND:20260801T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260716T200159Z
UID:34121a20-8151-11f1-a0f3-4e55ecfe6986
DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/shannon-shaw-band-of-shannon-and-the-
 clams-july-31-2026-691749\n  SHANNON SHAW BAND with support from GEORGIA M
 AQ  $22 ADV / $25 DOS 7PM DOORS / 8PM MUSIC ALL AGES  for fans of... Shann
 on & The Clams\, La Luz\, Being Dead\, Nancy Sinatra  BIO: Powerhouse sing
 er and bassist Shannon Shaw released her acclaimed solo debut\, Shannon in
  Nashville\, in 2018 on Easy Eye Sound. Produced by Dan Auerbach\, the alb
 um showcased Shaw’s soaring\, soul-baring vocals through a cinematic ble
 nd of vintage pop\, country soul\, and heartbreak balladry.  Since its rel
 ease\, Shaw has toured internationally in support of the album\, including
  dates opening for John Prine and touring alongside Neko Case. She has als
 o remained a constant presence onstage with her celebrated bands Shannon a
 nd the Clams and Hunx and His Punx.  The album was hailed by numerous publ
 ications\, with Pitchfork describing it as “a diamond” that “sounds 
 like Roy Orbison and his musicians lost in the Brill Building.”   
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
END:VEVENT
