DESCRIPTION:https://app.opendate.io/e/ucb-reads-reddit-august-05-2026-72800
 3\n Would you like to pass judgment upon the experiences of strangers in a
  totally socially acceptable way? Now you can!   The finest improvisers UC
 Burgh has to offer bring to life your favorite Reddit thread... AM I THE A
 -HOLE… in a brand new\, totally original concept where the internet meet
 s real life. r/AmItheAsshole\, abbreviated as AITA\, is a subreddit where 
 users post about their real-world interpersonal conflicts and receive judg
 ement from fellow redditors.  Laugh and cry as you watch them act out the 
 thread’s most horrible dates\, overbearing parents\, encounters with ran
 dom strangers and MORE... all with an IMPROV TWIST!  Whether you’re a Re
 dditor\, a storyteller\, or you just love some good gossip\, we’ll see y
 ou at UCB READS REDDIT! 
LOCATION:Bottlerocket Social Hall
