DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/mr-smalls-ghost-hunt/\nPLEASE NOTE:
  Tickets sold in the Cafe and Main Office - no online sales! Limit of 20 s
 pots available!Join us in an investigation of Ghostly activity at Mr. Smal
 ls. We have collected accounts of paranormal activity from throughout the 
 years\, identified hot spots\, and are ready to see if we can experience &
  document these supernatural phenomena.This Ghost Hunt will be led by Greg
  & Elaina of Smalls Cafe\, both of whom have lifelong interest in\, and pe
 rsonal experiences with\, the paranormal and paranormal investigations. Th
 ey will have equipment but everyone is encouraged to bring their own.The e
 vening will begin at 11pm with a pre-event mixer where coffee & espresso d
 rinks will be available.Doors will be closed at 11:30pm\, after which no e
 ntry will be allowed.There will then be a short talk about the history of 
 Mr. Smalls and paranormal activity experienced by staff over the years. Yo
 u will then be lead through a psychic experiment that will help shift ever
 yone's awareness to better sense activity & entities from beyond the veil.
  For the rest of the night you will have the opportunity to investigate se
 veral hot spots of paranormal activity at Mr. Smalls. We will\, if Spirit 
 suggests\, lead group activities to contact & communicate with our Ghostly
  friends.This Event Is 18+
LOCATION:Mr. Smalls Ghost Hunt
END:VEVENT
