DESCRIPTION:https://mrsmalls.com/events/no-man/\nNØ MAN is a blistering Wa
 shington\, D.C.–area hardcore band formed in 2017. The four-piece featur
 es punk scene veterans Matthew Michel (guitar/vocals)\, Pat Broderick (dru
 ms)\, and Kevin Lamiell (bass)—best known for their foundational work in
  Majority Rule—alongside frontperson Maha Shami. NØ MAN blends chaotic\
 , melodic hardcore with deeply personal and socio-political themes. Fronte
 d by Shami\, a Palestinian-American artist\, the band's intense discograph
 y—including their full-length albums Devils Cast Long Shadows (2018)\, E
 rase (2020)\, and Glitter and Spit (2024)—confronts patriarchal expectat
 ions\, political oppression\, and displacement.This Event Is All AgesAll S
 ales Are Final.
LOCATION:The Funhouse at Mr. Smalls
END:VEVENT
