BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Don't Call Me White Girl Live
DTSTART:20260816T233000Z
DTEND:20260817T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260723T000151Z
UID:b4d4635c-8629-11f1-aad6-767a4eaec1f4
DESCRIPTION:https://tickets.citywinery.com/event/dont-call-me-white-girl-li
 ve-k6juwp\nCity Winery Pittsburgh presents Don't Call Me White Girl Live o
 n Sunday\, August 16th\, at 7:30 PM(opens in a new tab)!Don’t Call Me Wh
 ite Girl is one of the most unapologetically funny voices on the internet 
 and on stage. Known for her razor-sharp storytelling\, unfiltered opinions
 \, and hilarious takes on relationships\, motherhood\, and everyday life\,
  Damona Dixon has built a devoted audience through her authenticity and fe
 arless comedy. Whether she’s going viral online or selling out live show
 s\, she brings the same raw honesty and laugh-out-loud energy that has mad
 e her a fan favorite nationwide.Don’t Call Me White Girl has become one 
 of comedy’s fastest-rising touring headliners by blending fearless story
 telling\, sharp cultural commentary\, and unforgettable audience interacti
 on into a live experience that audiences can’t stop talking about.Known 
 for turning everyday moments into laugh-out-loud stories\, Damona delivers
  a show that feels less like a performance and more like spending the even
 ing with your funniest cousin. Every performance is uniquely shaped by the
  city she’s in\, often featuring local comedians\, creators\, and commun
 ity voices that make each show a one-of-a-kind experience.Whether she’s 
 performing in an intimate comedy club or a sold-out theater\, one thing re
 mains the same:The Cousins always show up.Dine At Your Show(opens in a new
  tab)🍽️  We provide food and beverage service directly to your table 
 in the venue. Or\, for an expanded menu and more relaxed experience\, arri
 ve early and enjoy a meal in our restaurant before the show. When dining i
 n the restaurant\, reservations are encouraged and can be made via Resy st
 arting one month before the show. View Our Concert Dining Menu.(opens in a
  new tab)Wine At Your Table(opens in a new tab)Reserve your preferred wine
  by filling out this form(opens in a new tab) and have a bottle waiting at
  your table when you arrive at your show. No more waiting for your first d
 rink! We will save your wine preference and have a bottle at your table fo
 r all future shows. When you want to change your wine\, come back to this 
 form and update your preference.2-item Per Person Encouraged(opens in a ne
 w tab)🎶  While we do not require a two-item food or beverage minimum\, 
 we strongly encourage it. Most ticket revenue goes directly to the artist 
 and production costs\, so food and drink purchases help support the staff\
 , service\, and atmosphere that make these intimate shows possible.The goo
 d news: we think you’ll love the food and wine just as much as the show.
